window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3201,"title":"Chapter 3201: The Probability of Getting the Medicine from Sister Nian Is 0","paragraphs":["Chapter 3201: The Probability of Getting the Medicine from Sister Nian Is 0","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qingru raised her chin and ordered her subordinates, “Go and investigate.”","The small pills on the black market were very famous.","After a while, the person she had sent to investigate returned.","“Empress, I’ve found it.”","“Hm? Where?”","“This kind of small pill was seen in the black market in the past, but it has rarely appeared since a year ago. Everyone knows the wonders of this medicine, so those who manage to get it act low-key. It’s very difficult to find a specific buyer,” he said softly.","Nie Qingru frowned fiercely. Her gaze turned cold and she impatiently said, “If you can’t find the buyer, why don’t you check the seller?! Do you even need me to teach you this?”","“It’s... it’s because...” The man’s face turned pale and cold sweat broke out on his back. He was still stammering and could not speak for a long time.","Nie Qingru’s expression became more and more impatient and solemn.","“I’ll do it.” Shadow stepped forward and gestured for the man to leave.","“... Yes, yes.”","The man was relieved. He looked at Shadow gratefully, pursed his lips, and found a corner to hide.","Nie Qingru saw a subtle change in their interaction. Her eyes narrowed dangerously. She adjusted her shawl and slowly said, “Tell me what happened.”","“Yes.”","Shadow did not beat around the bush. “Empress, we found out that the seller of the pill is... Qiao Nian.”","He indeed did not beat around the bush.","However, this was clearly the name Nie Qingru did not want to hear the most.","“It’s her?”","Nie Qingru couldn’t help but be surprised.","Shadow continued with his head lowered. “Yes. Do you still remember the Miracle Doctor from Rao City that Tian Chen found for you when your migraine acted up?”","“I thought she faked her identity to save Lu Zhi.” Nie Qingru was expressionless.","She remembered this.","That was the first time Qiao Nian had seen her.","She could smell the Ji family’s b*stard’s scent from that pair of unruly eyes. The insufferable arrogance that the Ji family could not hide was vividly displayed in the young girl!","In a way, compared to the Ji Qing she gave birth to, Qiao Nian was more like Ji Wusun.","She was cold, indifferent to the world, and calculative. Whoever dared to provoke her would have the favor returned to them a hundredfold. She was unwilling to suffer for half a day!","“That’s not a fake identity.” Shadow saw that her face had paled. He took a deep breath and said in a low voice, “She’s indeed the famous Miracle Doctor of Rao City on the black market. The reason why this Miracle Doctor is so famous on the black market is because she knows how to make this medicine. She’s very close to Zhong Yiliu of the Pharmacy Association. Even Zhong Yiliu praises some of the medicine she makes... That small pill is one of them...”","This was not good news.","Nie Qingru supported her forehead with her hand, closed her eyes, and thought. “If I ask her for it directly, what are the chances of her giving it to me?”","Shadow stole a glance at her expression and helplessly said, “... The probability is 0.”","Nie Qingru opened her eyes and looked at him arrogantly. “0?”","Faced with her question, Shadow had to tell the truth. “With your current relationship with her, it’s fine if she doesn’t know it’s you. We might be able to get the medicine through other channels. If she finds out this is the only medicine that can save Young Master Qi, she might block our drug purchasing channel without hesitation.”","This wasn’t the most terrifying thing."]},{"number":3202,"title":"Chapter 3202: Tell Her I Can Save Her Daughter","paragraphs":["Chapter 3202: Tell Her I Can Save Her Daughter","Editor: Atlas Studios","This wasn’t the most terrifying thing.","The most terrifying thing was that Qiao Nian was the famous Miracle Doctor on the black market and the creator of the small pill. She could deny selling the medicine to anyone.","After all, those after the medicine were in a weaker position.","When people reached a certain age, only this kind of divine medicine was better than benefits!","“Heh.” Nie Qingru did not expect she would one day be forced to such an extent by someone.","Thinking quickly, she smiled and asked Shadow, “I remember she has a second aunt. Does she have a grudge against her?”","“You mean...” Shadow immediately understood.","He was the only person Nie Qingru had trusted in all these years. She still had a certain emotional foundation with him. Her expression softened. “If I ask her directly for the medicine, she definitely won’t give it to me. I can only start with the people around her. What if it’s her... loved ones who need it?”","At this point, Nie Qingru’s heart, which had finally softened a little, hardened again.","“Those people are no different from me. Didn’t they only find out about her existence later? They didn’t care about her for more than 10 years.","“She cares a lot about those people. They’re more important than her mother’s biological uncle! Ridiculous.”","Shadow just listened and did not dare to say anything to provoke her.","He understood Nie Qingru’s hatred for the Ji family and the pain of being forced to choose between her biological daughter and power...","Qiao Nian always talked about Ji Qing.","If she knew the truth from back then, she probably would not have gone against the Empress like this.","At the end of the day, the Empress was also a victim.","Nie Qingru was upset but would not sink into negative emotions. She immediately instructed him, “Contact her second aunt.”","Shadow raised his head slightly and looked at her seriously.","Nie Qingru tugged at her shawl and frowned in disgust. “Tell her that as long as she helps me with this matter, I can agree to one of her requests. Any request is fine as long as it’s within my ability, including saving her daughter!”","Shadow had already told her about Qiao Nian’s family background.","It wasn’t strange for Nie Qingru to know about Tang Wanru and Jiang Xianrou. She knew everything about Qiao Nian’s life in the first 18 years.","Other than some things Qiao Nian did not want others to know, she did not deliberately hide all other information about her life.","Therefore, Nie Qingru also knew the grudge between Tang Wanru and Qiao Nian, as well as Jiang Xianrou, who was still imprisoned in the women’s prison...","Shadow bowed and left. “Right away.”","In a bad mood, Nie Qingru waved her hand and said, “Go.”","Not long after Shadow left, Nie Tao and some of the Nie family members rushed to the hospital from their residence.","They saw Nie Qingru in the corridor.","With Nie Tao taking the lead, they quickly surrounded them.","Nie Tao looked worried and asked Nie Qingru, “I heard that Qixing isn’t doing well? Are they alright? We got so many experts here, but none of them were useful?”","Nie Qingru knew he was not sincere, but she could not expose him directly. With a cold expression, she replied casually, “He’s fine. I’ve already thought of a way.”","Nie Tao was greatly disappointed, but he still forced himself to smile. “That’s good. As long as he’s fine.”","The other Nie family members were not as pretentious as him. They were so disappointed that the words “He’s not dead yet?” were practically plastered on their faces. So many people, but none of them were as pretentious as Nie Tao. They all looked like they wanted Nie Qixing to die today."]},{"number":3203,"title":"Chapter 3203: She Really Received a Call","paragraphs":["Chapter 3203: She Really Received a Call","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qingru was annoyed by the sight and walked away with a grunt.","Nie Tao’s face immediately turned ashen. He clenched his fists and suppressed his resentment.","At the Jiang family villa.","“Can you really save Xianrou?”","Tang Wanru was dazed after receiving a call.","Then, her expression changed drastically. She immediately stood up, ignored the servants and Jiang Yao’s surprised gazes, covered her cell phone, and rushed to the second floor.","After closing the door, she anxiously asked the other party for confirmation, “Is what you said true? You’re not lying to me?”","“Do I have to lie to you?” The man’s voice on the other end of the call was calm. It was an unfamiliar voice that she had never heard before.","Tang Wanru’s violent heartbeat stabilized, and she became suspicious. “But no one in Beijing can save Xianrou. How can you save her? If it was so easy to save her, I would have done so long ago.”","In fact, Tang Wanru had never given up on saving Jiang Xianrou.","She had sold a lot of jewelry in private and spent money to smooth things over. However, it was like a stone sinking into the sea. She was either cheated or had the dealer back out of helping her.","She also tried to plead with Old Master Jiang, Jiang Zongjin, and Jiang Zongnan. Every time she mentioned something, everyone in the family would scowl and ignore her...","She had thought of all the ways she could think of but still couldn’t get Jiang Xianrou out of prison.","How could she believe this person could do it so easily?","“Hehe.” The other party seemed to know what she was thinking and casually said, “Remember to answer the phone in 10 minutes. I’ll get your daughter to talk to you.”","“You...” Tang Wanru was extremely surprised, and her heart was pounding.","The person calmly said, “This is just the ‘down payment’. As long as you can help me do this, I will do what I promised you.”","“Who are you?” Tang Wanru had been in Beijing all her life and was not stupid.","Ye Wangchuan’s influence in Beijing could be said to cover the sky with one hand. Xianrou had offended him and was sent to prison, but this person actually could get her out of prison.","She couldn’t help but suspect his identity.","“Who... are you?” Tang Wanru was suspicious and afraid.","Unfortunately, the other party had no intention of answering her question. She only heard the beeping sound from the other end. The person had already hung up.","Tang Wanru looked at the darkened screen. Her heart skipped a beat as she paced around the room uneasily.","She wanted to tell Jiang Yao about it, but she was afraid he wouldn’t stand on her side...","Ten minutes passed as she hesitated.","As expected, Tang Wanru’s phone rang.","She remembered what that person said and picked up the call. “Hello, Xianrou?”","A familiar female voice cried out from the other end. “Mom, do you have a way to save me? I heard from the person in charge that you can save me. Save me, save me. I’m going crazy here. I can’t take it anymore.”","Tang Wanru’s heart ached for her daughter. She was clearly so slender and elegant in the past, and she had grown up to be a dazzling pearl in the socialite circle in Beijing.","Now, she had become a prisoner and was extremely thin.","As a mother, how could she not feel sorry for her child?","Tang Wanru gritted her teeth and thought of what the other party had mentioned. She made up her mind and comforted her crying daughter. “Don’t worry, Mom will definitely save you!”"]},{"number":3204,"title":"Chapter 3204: Calculating How to Pluck The Medicine From Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Chapter 3204: Calculating How to Pluck The Medicine From Sister Nian","At this moment, Jiang Yao knocked on the door and asked.","“You looked terrible. Are you in there?”","“I’m here.”","Tang Wanru was afraid he would come in and hurriedly responded.","She covered the cell phone with her hand and said to Jiang Xianrou, “Don’t cry. I’ll think of a way. Your brother is outside. I have to hang up.”","On the other end, Jiang Xianrou was still crying and asking to save her.","Tang Wanru had to protect herself and had no choice but to hang up first.","Then, she tidied up and tried her best to look normal, walked over, opened the door, and looked at the person outside. “Why are you looking for me?”","Jiang Yao frowned and glanced into her room. He did not see anyone.","Looking back at her suspiciously, he paused and said, “I saw you didn’t look too good after receiving a call. I thought something had happened to you, so I came up to check on you.”","“Oh, I’m fine,” Tang Wanru replied too quickly.","Jiang Yao frowned again.","“Are you really okay?”","Tang Wanru knew she had to find a reasonable reason, so her eyes darted around and she said with a dark expression, “I heard from a good friend that Jiang Li’s new movie is about to be released. She got the VIP tickets for the premiere and asked if I was going.","“I just found out about this! He didn’t even tell me about such a big thing. It’s obvious he doesn’t care about his mom!”","Tang Wanru was naturally furious upon mentioning Jiang Li.","She gave birth to the three of them. Even if Jiang Yao was not as obedient as before, he still knew how to care for her.","Only Jiang Li did not even come home. He was always around Qiao Nian.","He was closer to a cousin than his biological sister!","Tang Wanru was angry at the mention of it, and her expression became real. “I had to hear about this from someone else. I felt so awkward.”","As expected, Jiang Yao believed her. He sighed and comforted her. “Haven’t you always disliked the entertainment industry? Jiang Li probably didn’t tell you because he thought you wouldn’t like it.”","“I’m afraid that’s not all he thinks. He doesn’t have me in his heart anymore.” Tang Wanru did not appreciate it.","Jiang Yao didn’t want to continue on this topic with her. Seeing that she was fine and did not seem to be hiding anything from him, he found an excuse to leave for the company.","Tang Wanru heard the car engine starting outside the villa and knew that Jiang Yao had already left. She quickly returned to her room to tidy up, picked up her bag, and rushed out.","“Madam, where are you going?” The servant asked with concern when she saw her changing her shoes at the entrance.","Tang Wanru glared at her. “Shut up and do more work! It’s not your place to care where I go.”","The servant was only concerned out of goodwill, but she was scolded instead and did not dare to make a sound.","Tang Wanru picked up her bag and left the house in a hurry.","**","This time, she was thinking about how to get the medicine out of Qiao Nian. She probably had to interact with her a lot.","In some aspects, Tang Wanru understood Qiao Nian’s personality pretty well. She knew that she was a person who did not care about anything and did not think highly of herself.","Therefore, Tang Wanru quickly drove to Old Master Jiang’s sanatorium.","On the way there, she thought about how she was going to get the medicine step by step, and her eyes gradually became firm..."]},{"number":3205,"title":"Chapter 3205: Your Grandpa Is About to Die","paragraphs":["Chapter 3205: Your Grandpa Is About to Die","Editor: Atlas Studios","In the afternoon.","Jiang Li waved goodbye to the editor-in-chief and got into the huge van.","His assistant’s cell phone rang.","“Brother Li, your phone.” The assistant hurriedly handed the cell phone to him.","Jiang Li took the cell phone and asked casually, “Who is it?”","The assistant recalled the caller ID he saw on the screen and casually said, “I think it’s your mother.”","Unexpectedly, Jiang Li frowned and his expression became serious.","“Why is she calling me?”","He had always been casual, so the people in the van were not used to this sudden change.","The phone was still ringing in the car.","The assistant finally realized he might not have a good relationship with his family. He stopped arranging the clothes he had used for the magazine and asked him softly, “Brother Li, aren’t you going to answer your phone?”","Jiang Li was still wearing makeup, which accentuated his peach-blossom eyes. He was a top-notch existence in the entertainment industry.","No wonder he had so many fans.","Jiang Li frowned as he stared at the word “Mom” on the phone screen for a few seconds. He opened the door and jumped out of the car. Without looking back, he said to his assistant, “Wait for me. I’ll go take this call.”","He did not go far.","He accepted the call on the lawn not far from the huge van. “Hello.”","He originally thought he would be greeted by Tang Wanru’s endless complaints or requests like asking Nian Nian to let Jiang Xianrou out...","Unexpectedly, this time was completely different.","“Jiang Li, something happened.” Tang Wanru’s voice was panicked and she was crying.","Jiang Li suddenly straightened up and his voice deepened. “What’s wrong? What happened?”","“Your grandfather... Your grandfather suddenly had a cerebral hemorrhage and was hospitalized.” Tang Wanru brought bad news.","Jiang Li’s temples throbbed. His knuckles turned white as he gripped his cell phone tightly. He gritted his teeth and asked, “Which hospital is Grandpa in? I’ll be right there!”","He quickly walked back.","However, Tang Wanru said, “The doctor said he wants a small pill. It’s the medicine your grandfather took previously... Do you still have that medicine? Send some over first.”","“...You mean the medicine Nian Nian gave him?” Jiang Li suddenly stopped in his tracks, a strange look in his eyes.","He knew about the drug.","It was a health supplement. Qiao Nian told the Old Master that they were Rao City’s specialty. They were worthless and unpackaged. She would give the Old Master a bottle every time she came back.","How did the doctor in the hospital know about this medicine? And why did he specifically ask for it?","Just as he was suspecting...","Tang Wanru pressured him. “I sent your grandfather to the hospital with the people from the sanatorium. The nurse from the sanatorium told the doctor. Is there any more medicine at home? Your grandfather... is about to die!”","... He was about to die?","Jiang Li swayed, and his face suddenly paled. Fortunately, he quickly grabbed the door of the huge van and barely held on.","He thought about it carefully. “I don’t think we have this medicine at home.”","This time, Qiao Nian came back at the last minute and did not bring any medicine to the Old Master.","Tang Wanru immediately said, “Where’s Qiao Nian? Go get some from her. She definitely has some!”","Jiang Li asked, “Did the doctor say it has to be this medicine?”","“Your grandfather has been taking it, and the effect is quite good... This is a sudden cerebral hemorrhage. The doctor said to give it a try...”"]},{"number":3206,"title":"Chapter 3206: Jiang Li, Where’s the Medicine?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3206: Jiang Li, Where’s the Medicine?","Tang Wanru did not give him much time to consider and quickly urged him, “Hurry up. Come over as soon as you get the medicine. It’s urgent!”","Jiang Li wanted to say something, but his mother had already hung up.","He held his cell phone with a terrible expression.","The people in the nanny van were all looking at him. Jiang Li ignored them and called Old Master Jiang.","His cell phone was switched off.","He took a deep breath and called the doctor who usually took care of Old Master Jiang.","His cell phone was also switched off.","The two consecutive phone calls did not get through.","Jiang Li was a little suspicious, but he was more worried that something had really happened to his grandfather.","He quickly got into the car and closed the door. Then, he said to the chauffeur in a deep voice, “Let’s go to Rhine.”","“Brother Li, we still have work to do...” The a.s.sistant wanted to remind him that they still had work to be done at the radio station.","Jiang Li held his cell phone and was about to call Qiao Nian when he said without looking up, “Tell them I won’t be able to make it. I’ll compensate for the breach of contract, no matter the price.”","‘That’s what he said.","**","Twenty minutes later.","The huge van arrived outside the Rhine Apartments.","Qiao Nian had just rushed from the dining area and was waiting for him by the roadside.","Jiang Li’s car had just stopped when he opened the door and went straight to the girl. He asked anxiously, “Nian Nian, that medicine...”","Qiao Nian was wearing a baseball cap. Without another word, she took out a gla.s.s bottle and handed it to him.","Her anxiousness was reflected in her cold eyes. Her expression darkened and her voice became obscure. “Which hospital is Grandpa in?”","Jiang Li only told her that Jiang Weishang had suddenly suffered a cerebral hemorrhage and was hospitalized. He urgently needed a small pill...","But he was pressed for time and did not say which hospital he was in.","She came back from the independent continent in a hurry this time and did not have time to make small pills.","Hence, she went to Wei Lou to get the medicine the moment she received the call.","Fortunately, Wei Lou still had some, so it was not too bad.","However, to Qiao Nian, Old Master Jiang’s sudden cerebral hemorrhage was terrible news...","Her mood almost hit rock bottom.","And it was Jiang Li who told her this news.","Jiang Li wasn’t someone who would joke about such things.","Qiao Nian was truly anxious.","“The First People’s Hospital.” Jiang Li got the medicine and turned back in the van’s direction. “Come with me.”","“Okay.”","Without any delay, Qiao Nian immediately followed him.","—","Only when the huge van arrived outside the hospital did Jiang Li remember he did not ask which emergency room his grandfather was in.","Ignoring his celebrity status, he casually put on a mask without wearing his usual cap and hopped out to call Tang Wanru.","“I’m here. I got the medicine.”","He said in a hurry, “Mom, where are you?”","“I’ll come out to meet you.” Tang Wanru did not say the exact location and asked him where he was. “Where are you?”","Jiang Li frowned. He wanted to say it would be faster if he went over directly, but he thought wasting time would only delay the Old Master’s treatment.","Hence, he reported his location.","He did not wait for long.","Tang Wanru came out of the hospital consultation hall in a hurry. She looked dignified and elegant, dressed exquisitely, and her hair was not messy. She did not look anxious at all.","Jiang Li frowned.","But he did not have time to think about it.","Tang Wanru had already walked up to him and reached out to him. “Jiang Li, where’s the medicine?”"]},{"number":3207,"title":"Chapter 3207: Sister Nian Finds Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 3207: Sister Nian Finds Out","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Grandpa...” He wanted to know more about the Old Master’s current situation.","But Tang Wanru urged him, “Give me the medicine first so that I can give it to the doctor. Don’t waste any more time.”","Jiang Li took out the medicine and handed it to her.","Tang Wanru revealed a look of joy and was about to leave upon receiving the medicine.","Jiang Li grabbed her. “Where’s Grandpa?”","Tang Wanru seemed distracted. She glanced at the girl who left the van and grew nervous. She looked at the anxious Jiang Li and casually said, “The first emergency room.”","Jiang Li let go of her and turned to look at Qiao Nian, planning to go with her to take a look.","At this moment, Qiao Nian had already walked over.","“Nian Nian, Old Master is in the first emergency room...” Jiang Li started.","However, the girl pulled down the brim of her baseball cap and put on her earpiece, seemingly on the phone as she looked over his shoulder.","“Hm? Please help me find someone.”","Jiang Li followed her gaze and only saw Tang Wanru’s back. He turned around and said to the girl again, “Why don’t we go over first?”","He was really afraid something would happen to the Old Master.","Unexpectedly, the girl did not seem to be in a hurry. Her black eyelashes lowered and she whispered to the Bluetooth piece, “I understand. Thank you.”","Jiang Li was so anxious that he wanted to go alone.","However, he was also worried about Qiao Nian staying here alone. He suppressed his anxiety and hurriedly said, “Nian Nian, let’s go take a look...”","He did not finish his sentence when Qiao Nian pinched the bridge of her nose, as if she did not know how to tell him something. She paused for a second before looking at him and saying, “Grandpa is fine.”","Jiang Li was stunned.","He was fine? How could he be fine? His mother had clearly said that he had been sent to the hospital with a cerebral hemorrhage. Now, he was being resuscitated in the first emergency room...","Qiao Nian seemed to know what he was thinking. She put away her phone and suppressed her anger as she coldly said, “She lied to you.”","Jiang Li’s eyes widened.","Qiao Nian’s voice was low. “She just wanted the medicine.”","The scam wasn’t brilliant.","The only smart thing about it was that Tang Wanru used Jiang Li to get the medicine from her.","Only if Jiang Li told Qiao Nian that the Old Master suddenly had a cerebral hemorrhage would she not immediately doubt the authenticity of his words.","Tang Wanru banked on this.","Jiang Li wasn’t stupid.","He quickly understood what Qiao Nian meant.","When he connected it with Tang Wanru’s abnormal behavior, his fingers dug into his flesh, his back stiffened, and he couldn’t even turn his neck. “She used Grandpa to lie to me?”","Although Qiao Nian did not want to say this, it was the truth. “I won’t suspect you. I would just take out the medicine immediately.”","Jiang Li felt as if he had been whipped. His heart ached and numbed his senses. After a long time, he squeezed out, “What does she want this medicine for?”","“I don’t know.” Qiao Nian shook her head. Then, she pulled down the brim of her cap with her cold white hand and said in a deep voice, “But I guess it has something to do with some people in Continent F.”","She guessed that someone had said something to Tang Wanru.","For example, releasing Jiang Xianrou in exchange for Tang Wanru giving them the medicine.","“Continent F?” Jiang Li did not think that far ahead and was stunned.","Qiao Nian patted his shoulder lightly and said, “I’ll investigate what happened. I’ll tell you after I figure it out.”"]},{"number":3208,"title":"Chapter 3208: Provoked, She Really Won’t Stop for a Second!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3208: Provoked, She Really Won’t Stop for a Second!","Editor: Atlas Studios","“That medicine...” Jiang Li wanted to die.","He had never thought that one day, his mother would use him to cheat someone of something. Even though he had never thought that this would happen, it had resulted in such consequences.","“Nian Nian, I...” Jiang Li did not have the face to look at her.","Qiao Nian saw that his eyes were a little red. She pursed her lips and patted his arm. “It’s fine. It’s just medicine.”","Jiang Li still blamed himself. He couldn’t accept this.","Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows and emphasized, “It’s really fine. I have a lot of this medicine...”","On the black market, these small pills were sold for an astronomical price, and even a single pill was difficult to obtain.","However, as long as she was willing, she could make as many as she wanted... The bottle Tang Wanru had cheated out of her was not a loss to her.","What she was more concerned about was what Tang Wanru wanted to do by spending so much effort to obtain the medicine... Or rather, what was the person behind this doing with the medicine...","Qiao Nian had already guessed who was behind this. “Go back first. I’ll tell you when I find out!”","Jiang Li was quite famous. He had just finished a photo shoot for a magazine and had dazzling hair and makeup on. Even though he was wearing a mask, his face was still eye-catching.","The people coming and going had already noticed them.","They whispered to each other.","Jiang Li knew it wasn’t suitable for him to stay here for long. Although he was still depressed about his mother lying to him, he did not insist. “Nian Nian... I’ll give you an explanation.”","Qiao Nian looked at him. She knew that no matter what, Tang Wanru was his biological mother. In addition, other than using the Old Master’s health to lie to him, she did not do anything else. She replied softly, “Mm.”","She still had to go back and confirm some things, so she turned around and waved. “I’ll leave first.”","Jiang Li watched her leave with mixed feelings.","Then, he thought of everything Tang Wanru had done today.","Pursing his lips, he pulled out his cell phone and called the number he had not contacted in a long time. “Dad, come home. I have something to tell you.”","Qiao Nian received a call from Ye Wangchuan as soon as she left the hospital.","She hailed a cab back from the curb and picked up the call. “Hello.”","“Is Old Master Jiang alright?” Ye Wangchuan immediately asked.","Qiao Nian rubbed the space between her eyebrows and said to the driver, “To Rhine.”","The car started.","She replied casually, “I’ll tell you when I return.”","The hospital was a distance away from the apartment, and there was a traffic jam on the road.","40 minutes later.","Qiao Nian finally returned to the apartment.","Along the way, Wei Lou also called asking about Old Master Jiang and if it was convenient to visit him in the hospital... Qiao Nian could only reject his good intentions and tell him that Old Master Jiang was fine.","When she entered, Ye Wangchuan handed her a glass of water before leaning against the wall and asking, “I just called the sanatorium. Old Master Jiang is fine. What happened?”","Qiao Nian had been running around for a few hours since she received Jiang Li’s call. She walked in and took a sip of water.","After a while, she briefly explained what happened and then concisely said, “It should be Nie Qingru’s doing.”","She walked to the sofa and sat down. Her eyebrows were lowered, and her aura impatiently cold.","“Tang Wanru came up with the idea, but the person behind it should be her.","“She really won’t stop for a second.”"]},{"number":3209,"title":"Chapter 3209: Let’s See How They Deal With It First","paragraphs":["Chapter 3209: Let’s See How They Deal With It First","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan grabbed her cup and placed it on the coffee table. Then, he looked down at her and said, “Then, do you care?”","Qiao Nian felt a little annoyed. She paused for a moment and said, “I asked Daji to check on the hospital’s internal information. Nie Qixing is probably dying... Otherwise, with her personality, she wouldn’t have come after me so soon.”","Even without her saying it, Ye Wangchuan could guess most of it.","His deep and narrowed eyes were fixed on the girl as he slowly said, “I mean Tang Wanru...”","Qiao Nian looked up and met his gaze. Seeing the coldness in his eyes, she looked away and rubbed her temples.","Ye Wangchuan continued lazily, “... It’s not suitable for her to continue staying in the Jiang Family.”","He knew Qiao Nian had been holding back on Tang Wanru because of Old Master Jiang, Jiang Li, and the others.","This time, Tang Wanru did not cause any substantial harm to the family, but next time, the following time... As long as she continued to stay in the Jiang Family, there would be countless ‘next time’s.","Who could guarantee that she could achieve her goal without hurting the Old Master?","What if the next time Nie Qingru asked for Old Master Jiang’s life in exchange, or if she used Jiang Zongjin...","Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes and lowered his tone. “Do you want me to deal with this?”","Qiao Nian’s facial features were exquisite. She took off her baseball cap and twirled it around her fingertips as she thought. After a moment, she calmly said, “Let’s see how they deal with it first.”","She was clearly referring to Jiang Zongnan and Jiang Yao...","Tang Wanru had gone overboard by lying about Old Master Jiang’s health this time.","Let’s see if her second uncle and the others would do anything.","The atmosphere in the Jiang Family villa was heavy.","Jiang Zongnan told the servants to leave early.","Only his family was left in the huge villa.","Old Master Jiang was also at home with a nurse wheeling him. Besides the nurse, the only outsider was a middle-aged man in a suit and glasses.","The middle-aged man stood in a corner, trying his best to reduce his presence. He was as quiet as a backdrop...","Jiang Zongnan sat on the sofa with a deep frown.","A few pages were spread out in front of him. They were densely packed with words... He seemed to carefully read the terms before picking up a fountain pen to sign.","“Dad!” Jiang Yao tried to stop him, and the atmosphere turned cold.","Everyone looked at him.","His temples were throbbing, and his eyes were dark. He pursed his lips and solemnly said, “Have you thought it through? You can’t go back after signing this.”","Neither Old Master Jiang nor Jiang Li said anything.","Jiang Zongnan seemed moved by his words. His grip on the fountain pen tightened. A second later, he said in a low voice, “If it weren’t for the two of you, I would have signed this long ago. Fortunately, it’s not too late today...”","“Dad.” Jiang Yao hesitated for a long time but could not say anything to persuade him.","After all, even he, as her son, could not stand what Tang Wanru had done. How could he have the face to force his father to endure it...","Jiang Zongnan ignored him and decisively signed his name at the end.","Then, he sat up straight and let out a long breath. His expression was one of relief as he handed all the documents to the middle-aged man standing in the corner.","“I’ve signed it.”"]},{"number":3210,"title":"Chapter 3210: President Jiang Has Already Signed It","paragraphs":["Chapter 3210: President Jiang Has Already Signed It","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Alright. Thank you, President Jiang.”","The middle-aged man took the documents from him and stood aside, organizing them one by one.","At this moment.","The hum of an engine was heard outside the villa; Tang Wanru had returned.","Jiang Yao suddenly looked up. His handsome face became complicated, and he did not know where to put his hands and feet.","Jiang Li was expressionless. He just stood beside Old Master Jiang. It seemed like Tang Wanru had already worn out his feelings.","Old Master Jiang sat up slightly. His old face was serious as he pursed his lips and remained silent.","Finally, Tang Wanru entered after parking the car.","After changing her shoes at the entrance, she realized the servants were not around. Right on the heels of that, she saw Old Master Jiang, who should be in the sanatorium, in the living room.","“Dad? Why are you...”","Before she could finish speaking, she noticed Jiang Li standing beside him.","Tang Wanru avoided his gaze and revealed a guilty expression. She still walked forward with wishful thinking. “Dad, why didn’t you tell me you were coming? I could have asked the chef to make soup for you and prepare something that suits your taste. I wonder if it’s too late...","“By the way, why don’t I see any servants? Where did they all go?”","“Enough,” Jiang Zongnan interrupted her.","Tang Wanru would usually get angry at his bad attitude, but this time, because of guilt, she did not dare to say anything. “I just want... the servants to buy groceries.”","Jiang Yao couldn’t decide if he was disappointed or desperate. He simply took the initiative to break the stalemate. “Mom, you received a call at noon. Your expression wasn’t right. You even hid from me and went to your room to answer it. Who called you?”","As expected, Tang Wanru’s reaction was huge. “Why are you asking this?”","Jiang Yao insisted, “Who called you?”","Tang Wanru tried to deflect. “It was just a call. They called the wrong number.”","Jiang Yao kept quiet and closed his eyes.","In Jiang Zongnan’s eyes, there was only disappointment. The last bit of warmth in him was also obliterated.","“Lawyer Zhang, show her the divorce agreement.”","“Will do.”","At this moment, the middle-aged man in glasses stood up from the corner, walked to the shocked Tang Wanru, and handed her the document Jiang Zongnan had just signed. “Madam Tang, look at this agreement. The division of assets is clearly detailed. If there’s no problem, you can sign your name at the end.”","“You want to divorce me?” Tang Wanru looked as if she had been struck by lightning. Her face was as pale as paper. She clenched her fists and glared at Jiang Zongnan.","Jiang Zongnan did not answer her. He did not even look at her.","The lawyer continued, “President Jiang has already signed it. You’re the only one left.”","Jiang Zongnan had already signed. The answer was self-evident.","Tang Wanru finally realized the seriousness of the matter. She looked around. Jiang Li did not make eye contact with her, and Jiang Yao avoided her gaze.","Her gaze landed on Old Master Jiang in the wheelchair. She pounced over and cried. “Dad, I know I did something wrong. But Zongnan wants to divorce me... I’ve at least given birth to children for the family. He wants to divorce me at his age... Dad, speak up for me.”","She really did not dare to imagine her life after the divorce."]},{"number":3211,"title":"Chapter 3211: No Room for Maneuver This Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 3211: No Room for Maneuver This Time","Editor: Atlas Studios","Tang Wanru was already used to the rich life of the Madam of the Jiang Family, interacting with the upper-class people and distanced from ordinary people.","Such a comfortable life would be far away from her once she got a divorce.","All the rich ladies around her went out with her because of her family background. Without the Jiang Family, she would be nothing...","“Dad...” Tang Wanru panicked now. Her eyes reddened, and she was terrified.","She knew that although Old Master Jiang looked strict, he was actually very soft-hearted, so she immediately begged him.","After all, one word from the Old Master was more useful than a hundred from her!","But this time, she was destined to be disappointed.","Jiang Weishang had long heard from Jiang Li that she had used him to cheat Qiao Nian of the medicine. He had also tacitly agreed to Jiang Zongnan’s decision.","Therefore, even though Tang Wanru cried her heart out and hugged his leg, he only sighed. “The Jiang Family can’t keep you anymore.”","Tang Wanru’s eyes, which were stained with tears, widened slightly. “Dad...”","Jiang Weishang shook his head. “It’s useless even if you call me. After Xianrou’s matter came out, I took Yao’er and the rest into consideration and tolerated you repeatedly. Including Zongnan. Even after what you did, he never embarrassed you in public...”","With Jiang Zongnan’s status and identity, and the fact that he was not even 50, he was at the golden age of men. The Jiang Family members were not bad-looking, and Jiang Zongnan had the charm of a mature man.","Such a person would have plenty of women throwing themselves at him.","If Jiang Zongnan was willing, he could raise a small child outside like everyone else in the circle.","But he did not do that.","Even though Tang Wanru had cuckolded him, he still maintained the dignity of someone from a large family and gave Tang Wanru enough face.","Even though he often used overtime as an excuse to sleep in the company or in a hotel, he did not cause any scandals outside.","But what about Tang Wanru?","As the one at fault, she did not restrain herself and still did stupid things for Jiang Xianrou.","As the only elder in the family, he couldn’t indulge her anymore.","“Take a good look at the terms of the divorce agreement and see if it’s alright. If there’s no problem, sign it.”","Old Master Jiang knew that Jiang Zongnan had considered Jiang Yao and Jiang Li, his two adult children. He couldn’t mistreat Tang Wanru in the divorce agreement.","Therefore, he said to Tang Wanru very calmly, “If you sign it, everyone will be free.”","Tang Wanru could see his determination. Her legs went limp and she slid to the ground, unable to stand up for a long time. Her face was pale, her lips trembled, and her face was filled with despair—","The bespectacled middle-aged lawyer was indeed a sensible person. At this moment, he slowly handed the divorce agreement to her again and softly said, “Madam Tang, the agreement is here. Take a look. You can raise any objections. We’ll discuss it in depth.”","Tang Wanru’s blood was cold, and so were her fingertips. She couldn’t see the document in front of her at all. Her vision was blurry, and she only felt deep regret.","She... had long been used to being the center of attention. She was used to the life of a rich and noble lady.","Even if Jiang Zongnan had left her some money and a house in the agreement, how could it compare to the status of Mrs. Jiang?","She began to tremble as she desperately looked around, wanting to find someone to plead for her.","“Jiang Yao...”","Jiang Yao gritted his teeth and turned his head away.","Tang Wanru felt as if she had been splashed with cold water. She then glanced at Jiang Li, who was standing beside her... Her gaze slowly focused and finally turned into twisted hatred.","“It was you?”"]},{"number":3212,"title":"Chapter 3212: Tang Wanru’s Ending","paragraphs":["Chapter 3212: Tang Wanru’s Ending","“You betrayed your own mother!","“You’ll be happy when I’m kicked out?","“If I had known I would give birth to a heartless son like you, I would have drowned you in the toilet bowl from the start!”","Yes.","She should have done so from the start.","She never liked her younger son.","He had been disappointing and disobedient since he was young. He insisted on entering the entertainment industry to embarra.s.s her. Then, he followed behind his cousin and did not know how to feel sorry for his biological sister...","This kind of child was a debt collector. Why didn’t she kill him with her car?!","Jiang Li said in a low voice, “I only did what I had to do. You can think whatever you want.” Tang Wanru was furious.","Jiang Zongnan was afraid she would say something that would hurt his son again and stopped her in a low voice. “Alright, sign it. If you delay any longer, I’ll change my mind and get a lawyer to talk to you.”","Tang Wanru choked back her words and looked up at him. Seeing that Jiang Zongnan did not look like he was joking, she finally took the doc.u.ment, looking pained...","**","The news of Tang Wanru and Jiang Zongnan’s divorce quickly spread throughout the upper- cla.s.s circle of Beijing.","When the rich ladies she knew heard the news, they immediately drew a clear line with her and kicked her out of their social circle.","At the same time, as she lost the protection of the Jiang Family, her charitable foundation t.i.tles were also replaced.","Overnight, Tang Wanru was ostracized by the upper echelons of Beijing.","She still lived in a villa in the wealthy district, but her status was worlds apart from before. She had become a laughingstock in the circle.","It was also a topic that everyone was happy to talk about recently.","Tang Wanru knew all of this.","After signing the agreement, she locked herself in her room for the next few days and kept calling the number that caused all this.","However, she either could not get through or the phone was switched off.","One day the number didn’t exist anymore.","Tang Wanru had taken the risk for Jiang Xianrou. Realizing that the other party had lied to her, she went crazy and almost hysterically wanted to find out who had lied to her.","But she had already given them the medicine.","She didn’t know where to start looking for the person after they cut off her only contact.","Continent F.","The hospital was filled with the pungent smell of disinfectant. The medical staff in the corridor were in a hurry. It looked like something big had happened.","“Is he awake?”","“He’s awake, he’s awake!”","Outside the tightly guarded ward, the doctors whispered to each other about the situation inside.","“That medicine really worked.”","“After all, it’s a legendary medicine on the black market. Even Elder Zhong of the Pharmacy a.s.sociation approves of it...”","The Nie clan members were all in the corridor when they heard the news.","Nie Tao’s expression was gloomy as he said coldly, “He’s lucky to wake up, but so what? He’s already a cripple!”","Although the others did not dare to agree with him, they more or less had the same thought. Nie Qixing might as well just die.","At the very least, his death was tragic enough to make people remember some of his highlights, such as his ident.i.ty as a scientist...","But he somehow was saved.","Even if a one-eyed man with a crippled leg was still alive, what awaited him would not be the applause of flowers, but endless pain.","Nie Qixing probably did not want to live anymore; thus, his weak will to live.","Unfortunately, he survived!","In the future, he would have to live as a cripple.","Nie Tao dropped his cold facial expression. He couldn’t wait to go in and see Nie Qixing’s reaction when he opened his eyes and faced reality..."]},{"number":3213,"title":"Chapter 3213: No One Understands Her Arrangement","paragraphs":["Chapter 3213: No One Understands Her Arrangement","Editor: Atlas Studios","Besides the doctors and nurses busy in front of Nie Qixing’s bed, only Nie Qingru and Shadow were in the ward.","Nie Qixing was about to wake up, and even Shadow could not hide his excitement.","On the other hand, Nie Qingru, who had spent a lot of effort to save him, was exceptionally cold.","The man on the hospital bed was still being resuscitated, but she had already shifted her gaze away. Her sharp gaze landed on the Shadow and she lowered her voice. “What’s Qiao Nian doing in Beijing?”","“Uh...” Shadow did not react immediately.","When she retracted her gaze...","He lowered his head and replied, “I haven’t heard anything of note. I only heard that Jiang Zongnan and Tang Wanru have divorced. The procedures have been completed. Basically, all their acquaintances know.”","“... Just a divorce?” Nie Qingru narrowed her eyes, her expression uncertain. She had a feeling that Qiao Nian was not someone who would let things go easily!","Shadow knew what she was suspecting. He kept his head lowered and said, “Empress, she’s only 20 years old. You don’t have to overthink.”","Nie Qingru’s sharp gaze landed on him. She did not say a word, but her dignity did not allow for provocation.","Shadow also knew that he had crossed the line. He lowered his head even more, and his back formed the shape of a bow. He was very obedient.","After a while.","She shifted her gaze away from him and said in a low voice, “Don’t forget that she’s the Ji family’s descendant.","“I’m afraid no one in the Ji family is more like Ji Wusun than her!”","Shadow quickly raised his head and peeked at her expression. Seeing Nie Qingru’s expression was calm, he relaxed a little.","At this moment, an apparatus made a “ding” sound.","A doctor shouted excitedly, “The patient has opened his eyes.”","“Quick, get the detector.” Another doctor quickly asked the nurse to get the device.","The nurse was very fast. She grabbed the silver heartbeat detector beside her and quickly handed it to the doctor.","The doctor placed it on the man’s chest. His heartbeat was normal, but slightly slower than an ordinary person’s...","That was normal for a patient who was unconscious for four days and three nights.","The doctor removed the device and finally relaxed. He turned around and walked to Nie Qingru and Shadow.","“Madam Nie, the patient is out of danger and has woken up. Do you want to take a look?”","“He’s awake?” Shadow’s heart skipped a beat, and he revealed a rare look of joy.","Nie Qingru was still discussing the commotion in Beijing with him when she heard the news. She froze for a moment...","However, it was only for a short moment.","The next second, she gathered her shawl and said indifferently, “There’s no need to look.”","Everyone in the ward turned to look at her. They did not understand why this person, who had spent so much effort to save the man, did not even bother to look at him.","Nie Qingru never cared about how others looked at her. She turned to leave and said, “Get ready. We’ll go back to Continent M in an hour.”","Her meaning was clear. She wanted to bring Nie Qixing back as well.","Shadow looked at Nie Qixing who had just opened his eyes and could not speak. His chest felt uncomfortable, but he didn’t dare to speak up for him. He could only lower his head and accept the order. “Yes, Empress.”","The news that Nie Qingru was going back to Continent M soon spread throughout the hospital.","Not to mention the doctors and nurses, even her closest family members could not understand her decision.","“What does she mean? Doesn’t she care a lot about Nie Qixing? Why is she throwing a tantrum the moment he wakes up?” Nie Xia asked."]},{"number":3214,"title":"Chapter 3214: So Sister Nian Isn’t Not Counterattacking","paragraphs":["Chapter 3214: So Sister Nian Isn’t Not Counterattacking","Editor: Atlas Studios","Previously, Nie Xia had a conflict with Nie Qingru over whether Nie Qixing could take over. However, she couldn’t afford to offend her.","Nie Tao’s face was also dark. “I don’t know. She’s become more and more unpredictable recently.”","Nie Xia frowned and whispered into his ear, “We can’t let her continue like this. The old man...”","“Don’t talk nonsense!” Nie Tao’s expression changed slightly. He pulled her away and scolded sternly, “Qingru is my biological sister, the Old Master’s biological daughter... We’re family. You have to watch your words! Don’t let me hear such words again.”","A mocking look quickly flashed across Nie Xia’s eyes, but she still lowered her head obediently. “I know my mistake, Patriarch.”","“Okay.” Nie Tao was unhappy. He waved his hand and said, “Let’s go back.”","Nie Qingru made the decision quickly and even set the time to leave so soon.","The Nie Family members, who had followed them here, were flustered. They returned to their hotels to pack their luggage.","Fortunately, they knew they wouldn’t be staying long. They did not bring much with them. At most, they brought some clothes and valuables.","An hour later.","Continent F airport.","The Nie family’s plane was already waiting under the blue sky and white clouds.","The leading Lincoln slowly stopped, and the cars behind it also stopped one by one. The most eye-catching one was the medical vehicle transporting Nie Qixing.","The bodyguards of the reclusive families were well-trained as they helped the medical staff carry Nie Qixing off the stretcher and prepared to push him onto the plane.","At the same time, Nie Qingru also got out of the car. She took off her sunglasses and narrowed her eyes as she looked at the big plane parked on the tarmac from afar. She tilted her head and arranged the matters in Continent M.","Everything seemed calm.","Then, a deafening explosion suddenly erupted!","Everyone looked in the direction of the sound.","A huge heat wave swept up where the plane was parked. Flames soared and smoke instantly covered the sky, blocking the blue sky and white clouds, leaving only dust...","Along with the explosion, the surging heat wave dispersed in all directions. Nie Qingru only felt a wave of heat assaulting her face. Her brain did not even have time to react to the sudden explosion.","Shadow’s warning voice rang in her ears.","“Quick! Protect the Empress!”","“Guards, escort the Empress out of here!”","“Hurry up!”","Right on the heels of that, someone grabbed her arm and anxiously said, “Empress, it’s dangerous here. I’ll bring you to a safe place first.”","Nie Qingru suddenly came back to her senses and stood rooted to the ground. Her exhausted face after several days of staying up, was now ashen. As if the words had been squeezed out of her, she asked, “Who did this?!”","Shadow was afraid there were other bombs and hurried her. “Empress, let’s go to a safe place first...”","Before he could finish his sentence, the aftershocks caused by the explosion of the plane continued. Two more small explosions, loud and terrifying, occurred while he was talking.","Shadow looked at the continuous explosions and became more anxious. He asked Nie Qingru to get into the car first. “Empress...”","No matter how much he urged Nie Qingru, she did not move. There was an undercurrent in her eyes as she clenched her fists tightly. Her expression was extremely ugly.","“Empress, please...” Shadow urged again.","She finally said coldly, “It’s her.”","Shadow was confused.","Nie Qingru’s shoulders were tense, and she was so angry that her heart was drumming in her chest. Her tone was exceptionally cold. “Who else in Continent F can plant a bomb under my nose?”"]},{"number":3215,"title":"Chapter 3215: I Have a Good Granddaughter!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3215: I Have a Good Granddaughter!","Editor: Atlas Studios","It was Qiao Nian.","She had already made her move.","It was precisely because of this that Nie Qingru was furious.","“She’s really something! I have a good granddaughter! She wants to blow up her own grandmother!”","Shadow looked at the burning plane.","Was it Qiao Nian?","“Why did Qiao Nian do this?”","“The medicine.”","Nie Qingru’s face was as dark as water. Of course, she understood that Qiao Nian’s ultimate goal was not to blow her up. Otherwise, the plane wouldn’t have blown up before she even boarded it.","Moreover, according to her travel rules, the relevant staff would check the plane before she boarded it. The bomb would have been found...","However, Nie Qingru was still so angry that her eyes almost spewed flames.","She was so angry that her lips turned white. “She’s warning me not to go too far!”","Shadow didn’t know how to respond to her complicated feelings. The other party was too arrogant.","How was this a bomb?","This was a slap.","The aftershocks were like slaps on their faces!","Qiao Nian...","She really dared!","Nie Qingru took a deep breath and ordered Shadow, “Arrange for a new plane. We will return to Continent M today.”","“Empress, isn’t it too risky?” Shadow was afraid Qiao Nian would do the same to the next plane.","“She’s not that boring.”","Nie Qingru was calmer and more composed than him, so she knew what Qiao Nian wanted to do. “She won’t pester us anymore since she achieved her goal. This kind of thing is enough done once. Going overboard is as bad as falling short.”","Qiao Nian’s goal was just to tell her not to go too far.","Otherwise, she could also mess with the reclusive families.","For example, it was clear Qiao Nian had spies close by.","It wasn’t classy to play the same trick twice.","Qiao Nian would not do it again.","However, Nie Qingru was not entirely sure. When Shadow was about to turn around to make arrangements, she stopped him with a frown. “Tell them to check the new plane properly.”","Shadow looked back at her and nodded solemnly. “Understood.”","With that, he hurried off to get a new plane.","Nie Qingru looked at the burning plane. Her chest felt heavy again, making it difficult for her to breathe. She put on sunglasses and sat in the car expressionlessly, letting Shadow comfort the frightened people outside.","Qiao Nian’s move almost scared everyone in the Nie family out of their wits.","Due to the time difference, it was still early in the morning in Beijing. The orange morning sun had just broken free from the clouds and poked its head out, covering the ground with a slight warmth.","“Hey.” The girl woke up by a phone call. She sat up in bed with her eyes still closed, frustrated from being woken up.","Daji’s voice exploded in her ears. “Sun, you don’t know how scared those people from the Nie family are. Nie Tao contacted me and asked me if I had any other plans... I think he’s in trouble this time. He probably regrets coming to Continent F with the old witch.”","Qiao Nian was dizzy. She finally opened her dark, cold, and outstanding eyes. She dug her ears. “You’re too noisy.”","Daji finally realized something. “Are you still sleeping?”","“What do you think?” Qiao Nian glanced at the clock on the wall.","It was 8:30 a.m.","Tsk, very good.","She was now completely woken up. She lifted the blanket, got out of bed, and went to take a cold shower in the bathroom. It was inconvenient to hold her phone."]},{"number":3216,"title":"Chapter 3216: Master Wang Was Called Away Early in the Morning","paragraphs":["Chapter 3216: Master Wang Was Called Away Early in the Morning","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian walked to the bathroom door and stopped. “What about Nie Qingru? How did she react?”","“Oh, her,” Daji replied nonchalantly. Then, he lowered his voice and continued, “She reacted more rationally than anyone else. She soon realized we were just trying to warn her. We’re not really doing anything.","“I’ve received news that she has already arranged for a new plane. She’s bound to leave Continent F today...”","“As I expected.” Qiao Nian smiled coldly.","If Nie Qingru had been so easily frightened, she would not have been able to remain the Empress of the reclusive families for all these years.","As expected, she was the first to react.","“Sun, should we...” Daji wanted to ask if she wanted to do it again.","Qiao Nian’s eyes moved slightly as she said casually, “No need.”","“Huh? You’re letting her go just like that?” Daji sounded a little regretful.","Qiao Nian placed her hand on the handle of the bathroom door. Hearing that he found it a pity to let Nie Qingru go just like that, she could not help but smile. “Do you really think the reclusive families aren’t capable? This kind of thing is enough done once. Two times is too much of a slap in the face. I’m afraid some people won’t be able to take it anymore.”","This time, Nie Qingru knew that she was in the wrong.","Once was enough.","If she stepped on her head twice and slapped her in the face again, she might not be able to take it anymore...","Qiao Nian was not afraid of getting into a conflict with her. It was just that she had yet to make arrangements for Beijing and the independent continent.","Once Nie Qingru acted recklessly, she could not guarantee the safety of her family and friends.","“Wait a little longer.” Qiao Nian seemed to be saying this to him and herself simultaneously.","Of course, Daji had no objections. “I’ll listen to you. As long as you’re okay.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian hung up. She placed her cell phone on the sink and took a cold shower.","Half an hour later.","Qiao Nian changed her clothes and went downstairs.","This time, Ye Wangchuan was not at home. Only Gu San was busy in the living room.","Seeing her come down, Gu San greeted her warmly. “Miss Qiao, you’re up so early today?”","“Mm.” Qiao Nian’s voice was low. She walked past him and realized that someone was missing from the house. She looked at him and asked, “He’s not here?”","Gu San understood who she was asking about and immediately smiled. “Master Wang received a call early in the morning and went out. It should be about the Ninth Branch.”","He wiped his hands and walked to the kitchen. “By the way, Miss Qiao, do you want Chinese breakfast or Western breakfast? I’ll prepare it for you.”","“Chinese style.” Qiao Nian pulled out the dining chair.","Gu San had already come out with a plate and placed the soy milk and fried dough sticks on the table. “I wonder what’s the matter with Master Cheng. He was quite anxious over the phone.”","Qiao Nian held the fried dough stick in one hand as she heard him mention Master Cheng. Her fair skin was superior, and her neckline was perfect. She took a bite of the fried dough stick and tilted her head to ask lazily, “Did Master Cheng call him over?”","Gu San replied, “Yes, Master Cheng called early in the morning. I saw when Master Wang came out of the bedroom to answer the call.”","Qiao Nian nodded as if she was just asking casually.","Gu San scratched his head and said to himself, “I wonder why Master Cheng called Master Wang.”","Although Qiao Nian was not present for Master Cheng’s call in the morning, she knew better than Gu San that it was most likely about the Tsar.","As for the specifics, she did not know.","However, Qiao Nian had always known her limits.","Unless necessary, she would not interfere in the internal affairs of the Ninth Branch.","She listened to Gu San’s nonsense and ignored him. She lowered her head and slowly ate her breakfast..."]},{"number":3217,"title":"Chapter 3217: Miss Qiao, My Master Is Inviting You","paragraphs":["Chapter 3217: Miss Qiao, My Master Is Inviting You","Editor: Atlas Studios","On her way back from Jiang Zongjin’s place in the afternoon, a black car slowly stopped beside her.","Qiao Nian could tell the car had been following her the entire time, so she raised her hand and pulled down her baseball cap. Her eyes were cold as she stopped in her tracks.","A chauffeur quickly got out of the car and jogged to stop her. “Miss Qiao, my master wants to see you.”","“Your... master?” The girl narrowed her eyes slightly. Her aura was quite strong.","The chauffeur immediately reacted. “My master’s surname is Wei. He’s an old friend of yours.”","Wei?","And he knew her?","There was only one Wei family in Beijing.","Qiao Nian did not expect Wei Lou’s family to look for her. After some thought, she walked towards the car.","The chauffeur heaved a sigh of relief upon seeing that she was willing to follow him and quickly ran to open the door for her. “Miss Qiao, please.”","“Thank you.” The girl was distant but thanked him politely.","The chauffeur was stunned and could not react in time.","He had always heard that the fiancée of the Ye family was cold and difficult to get close to. However, she was not as difficult to get along with as the rumors said.","Returning to his senses, he saw that she was already seated. He quickly closed the car door and jogged to the driver seat.","The chauffeur peeked at the person in the backseat through the rearview mirror. Thinking she would be afraid, he gently explained, “Mr. Wei is not far away.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian recognized his good intentions and was patient.","Seeing that she was calm and did not look afraid, the chauffeur was relieved and focused on driving.","The Ye family’s old residence’s courtyard was located near the most prosperous Chang’an Street, but it was deep and quiet; a quiet atmosphere amidst the commotion.","It had all kinds of expensive flowers and plants, but mainly Old Master’s favorite orchids.","An exquisite birdcage hung beside the pillar of the brownish-red pavilion, with beautiful thrushes in it. The little birds jumped around on the branches, their tails and feathers exceptionally bright.","The scenery in the old residence was low-key and calm, not high-profile at all.","However, the atmosphere in the old residence was very solemn today. The servants came and went in a hurry, all with their heads lowered, and no one dared to speak loudly.","In the council hall that had not been used for a long time.","Master Cheng, Wei Mingxuan, and the others were all there.","Ye Maoshan sat at the head of the table with a teacup in his hand. He used the tea lid to remove the foam and took a sip.","Placing the teacup on the table, he glanced at everyone. “What do you think? Do you want to discuss it further?”","Ye Wangchuan was the leader of the younger generation. Bo Jingxing, Qin Si, and the others were all there.","Even Bo Zheng, who was rarely with them, was also here.","There were many people here, but very few were actually speaking.","Bo Zheng did not know much about this. He sat upright at the side, his firm and handsome face expressionless. He pursed his lips tightly and almost did not express his opinion.","Only Master Cheng and the others could make professional decisions.","Master Cheng thought for a moment. “... Should we reject it?”","Ye Maoshan pursed his lips, and a hint of helplessness flashed across his eyes. “Do you think so?”","How could Master Cheng not be helpless? He met his gaze and bitterly said, “Although hiding isn’t a solution, we don’t know what the other party wants to do. If we rashly agree, I’m afraid something will happen!”","Everyone present fell silent.","Actually, everyone was thinking the same thing.","Bo Jingxing and the others had not expressed their opinions because they were actually worried about this."]},{"number":3218,"title":"Chapter 3218: Someone Might Have a Way","paragraphs":["Chapter 3218: Someone Might Have a Way","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Maoshan sighed. “I understand.”","He originally wanted to fight for his pride.","However, since Master Cheng had said so, he could not say anything else.","“I...” Ye Maoshan was about to wave his hand to dismiss everyone.","At this moment, a different voice suddenly sounded.","“Since the other party has come knocking on our door, we can’t hide.”","Ye Maoshan frowned. He looked up and saw his young brat slowly straighten his back, raise his eyes, walk to the center, and speak casually.","Ye Wangchuan’s voice was low and soothing but with an unquestionable charm. “The news of the Tsar has already spread. We can hide for a while, but we can’t hide forever. The other party didn’t achieve their goal this time. There’s still a next time... We can only use our prowess to shut them up!”","Ye Maoshan’s eyelids twitched violently, and he angrily said, “Do you think we old men don’t know what you’re saying? It’s easy for you to say that. If something happens midway, who will be responsible? Can you be responsible?”","He did not give Ye Wangchuan a chance to reply at all. “Don’t tell me you can! You can’t bear this responsibility.”","After saying that, Ye Maoshan seemed a little tired and waved his hand. “I’ll discuss with Master Cheng and the others how to reject them. You can go back!”","He only kept Master Cheng, Wei Mingxuan, Bo Zheng, and a few others behind.","He seemed to want to chase Ye Wangchuan and the others away.","Bo Jingxing left his seat and prepared to pull Qin Si out.","Unexpectedly, Wei Mingxuan also said, “Elder Ye, I think what Young Master Ye said makes sense. We can discuss it again...”","“How can you say that?”","Ye Maoshan had already made up his mind, but now he wavered.","He looked at Wei Mingxuan and said after some thought, “Do you have any other way? A good way to ensure the safety of the Tsar and Master Cheng?”","Wei Mingxuan shook his head. “I have no idea.”","He truly did not have a good idea now.","However, he had already thought of this.","Wei Mingxuan took the initiative to mention it. “But I guess someone might have a good idea.”","Wei Lou heard his father talking to Old Master Ye. When he mentioned ‘someone’, his heart palpitated inexplicably. He turned around thoughtfully.","As expected, Ye Maoshan asked, “Who?”","Wei Mingxuan was about to reply when the door was knocked.","Right on the heels of that was the girl’s cold voice. “Sorry to disturb you.”","Wei Mingxuan suddenly turned around and saw the girl standing at the door. The girl was facing the light, and the light blurred her outline, unable to hide the wanton flamboyance on her body.","“Miss Qiao.” Wei Mingxuan saw who it was and immediately stood up to greet her gentlemanly. “Come in quickly.”","“Mm.” Qiao Nian walked past Wei Lou and entered.","Ye Maoshan was surprised. “Are you talking about Nian Nian?”","He immediately thought about it. He also felt it was reasonable for Wei Mingxuan to think of Qiao Nian.","Wei Mingxuan personally gave up his seat to the girl. His refined face was calm. “You can sit here.”","Qiao Nian did not sit down and politely said, “I’ll just stand.”","After all, Wei Mingxuan was Wei Lou’s father. He was considered an elder, so she would not go so far as to not give him face.","A trace of admiration flashed across Wei Mingxuan’s eyes. He was even more satisfied. From the corner of his eye, he saw his stunned son not far away and sighed silently.","He admired Qiao Nian and wished she could be his daughter-in-law. Unfortunately, his son was disappointing. What could he do?"]},{"number":3219,"title":"Chapter 3219: Sister Nian and Master Wang Think of the Same Thing","paragraphs":["Chapter 3219: Sister Nian and Master Wang Think of the Same Thing","Editor: Atlas Studios","Not knowing his father despised him, Wei Lou stopped walking and turned back. “Why did you bring Qiao Nian here?”","Wei Mingxuan looked at him with a straight face. “Do I have to explain myself to you?”","Wei Lou said angrily, “That’s not what I meant.”","Qiao Nian saw many familiar faces. After greeting everyone, she saw that Ye Wangchuan was also there and walked over with raised eyebrows.","“Gu San said you went to the Ninth Branch?”","Ye Wangchuan was not surprised to see her. “It’s about the Ninth Branch.”","“Oh.”","Qiao Nian had already guessed it.","As they were speaking, Ye Maoshan could not help but ask Qiao Nian, “Nian Nian, you know about this?”","This happened quite suddenly. Did the Young brat tell Qiao Nian about it early in the morning?","Ye Maoshan glanced at the lazy man with uncertainty and could not make up his mind.","Qiao Nian looked away from Ye Wangchuan and faced the Old Master’s question. She said seriously, “No, I don’t know.”","She paused and looked at Wei Mingxuan. “Uncle Wei asked me to come.”","Wei Mingxuan nodded at her kindly and admitted to Old Master Ye, “I called Miss Qiao over. It happened so suddenly that I didn’t have time to tell her about it.”","Qiao Nian had one hand in her pocket and wanted to pull down her baseball cap. However, she felt that it was not appropriate with so many elders around, so she did not make a move. She asked in a slightly hoarse voice, “What happened at the Ninth Branch?”","Ye Maoshan thought that, since she was already here, and they were family, he told her about the notification he had received in the morning.","Strictly speaking, it was not a big deal. A large-scale weapons exhibition invited the Ninth Branch to participate in it. They specified the new project developed by the Ninth Branch—Tsar.","The weapons exhibition was led by Continent M. The invitation letter sent to the Ninth Branch was quite rude. The subtext was that they could choose not to participate if they were afraid...","The other party was clearly provoking them, but Old Master Ye, Master Cheng, and the others still wanted to reject them because they were afraid the other party would play tricks.","Qiao Nian quickly figured out the ins and outs of the matter. Under everyone’s gaze, she slowly raised her hand and covered the brim of her cap. “Why should we hide? Hiding will only make them think we’re afraid. The more afraid we are, the more they will not let go. We can only hit them back hard! Once they know pain, they will use their brains before they speak next time.”","Ye Maoshan’s tightly knitted brows slowly relaxed and he smiled. “You little girl...”","He turned to look at a certain someone. “Someone said something similar to you just now. He had the same intentions.”","When Qiao Nian heard him say that there was someone, and since he was looking at the spot beside her, she knew who that ‘someone’ was.","She could feel that the gaze on her had gradually turned from serious to gossipy and teasing. She rubbed the space between her eyebrows.","However, in the face of serious matters, Qiao Nian was still more serious. She met Old Master Ye’s gaze and paused before saying, “I know who started this.”","“You know?” Ye Maoshan was surprised.","Qiao Nian’s expression was cold and solemn. Her gaze was sharp, and she sounded a little frustrated. “I know. She’s probably prepared for a long time for this. She won’t give up easily.”","Nie Qingru had been lying dormant for so long and had not made a move even once.","This time, she wanted to force Master Cheng and the Ninth Branch to participate in the weapons exhibition in the name of Continent M. How could she let them go so easily?"]},{"number":3220,"title":"Chapter 3220: How’s the Thing I Asked You to Prepare?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3220: How’s the Thing I Asked You to Prepare?","The provocative invitation letter that Old Master Ye mentioned was just a catalyst. Even if they refused, Nie Qingru probably had other methods to force them to partic.i.p.ate.","Instead of dodging, it was better to fight head-on.","They should see what Nie Qingru planned to do.","Ye Maoshan fell into deep thought when he heard that.","Then, his hale and wise face revealed a serious expression and he said to Qiao Nian, “This matter involves a lot of things. I can’t decide on this immediately.”","“I know.” Qiao Nian was not insensible.","Ye Maoshan nodded and smiled. “I’ll tell you my decision after I discuss it with Master Cheng.”","Qiao Nian had no objections. “Alright.”","Ye Maoshan wanted to discuss with Master Cheng again, so he urged the others to leave.","Wei Mingxuan represented the middle-aged generation, so he stayed behind with Bo Zheng to partic.i.p.ate in the discussion.","Ye w.a.n.gchuan, Wei Lou, and the others went out with Qiao Nian.","Bo Jingxing and the others walked in front, with Qiao Nian in the back.","Ye w.a.n.gchuan was also with her. He looked at the person in front of him and asked in a voice that only the two of them could hear, “Do you think Nie Qingru is behind this?”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows at “Nie Qingru”. Her eyes were dark, and her lips were curled into a cold smile. “She’s the Empress of the reclusive families, after all. How can she be suppressed by us every time?","“It would be strange if she didn’t do anything.”","If Nie Qingru remained dormant, it would be even more terrifying.","But since she was showing her cards, they could slowly play with her...","A smile appeared in Ye w.a.n.gchuan’s eyes. He did not continue the conversation, but he thought the same thing as Qiao Nian. He also felt that it was much better for Nie Qingru to play directly than to remain dormant.","Qin Si watched them whispering in front of him and urged them with some envy, w.a.n.g, Sister Qiao. Let’s go quickly. It’s time to eat.”","Qiao Nian stopped talking and followed them.","“Master","**","On the other side.","The plane took almost a day to land at Continent M’s airport.","Nie Qingru had made a big scene this time.","The ground crew was ready when the plane landed.","A special rescue car took Nie Qixing and immediately sent him to a special sanatorium.","Even so, Nie Qixing’s condition was definitely not good.","He had just woken up. If not for Nie Qingru’s order, he would have had to recuperate in the hospital for some time before he could be discharged.","However, because of Nie Qingru’s request, he had no choice but to fly to Continent M while his body was still in intense pain. He suffered a lot along the way.","If not because he was in his prime and very healthy, he would have been half-dead from the b.u.mpy journey.","Shadow watched as Nie Qixing was sent away. After making arrangements for the others, he returned to Nie Qingru and said in a low voice, “Empress, that woman in Beijing is still contacting you. She wants you to fulfill your promise and let her daughter out.”","This was also the condition they had agreed to.","Unexpectedly, a trace of disdain and mockery flashed across Nie Qingru’s face. She put on her sungla.s.ses to hide the coldness in her eyes. “I won’t mess up the entire plan for her. She can’t blame me for her own stupidity!”","Shadow could tell that she did not intend to keep her promise. He raised his head slightly before lowering it again. “Yes, I understand.”","“Mm.” He did not say anything that would make her unhappy. Nie Qingru looked down at him in satisfaction. “How’s the preparation for the weapons exhibition going?”"]},{"number":3221,"title":"Chapter 3221: Beijing Agreed, Slap to Her Face!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3221: Beijing Agreed, Slap to Her Face!","Editor: Atlas Studios","Shadow said, “Everything is arranged.”","Nie Qingru said, “Let’s see if Beijing dares to accept the invitation...”","She reckoned that Beijing wouldn’t agree so quickly, and it was more likely to reject it.","But it did not matter.","She still had a backup plan that would force them to agree.","“I’m sorry, Empress.” Shadow’s cell phone vibrated at this moment. He took it out and glanced at it apologetically. Then, his facial expression turned serious. “Beijing has agreed.”","“!!!” Nie Qingru choked.","Her originally unsightly expression darkened a few shades.","They agreed so quickly?","They did not even try to decline politely?","Were they that confident?","Shadow felt that she was easily provoked by Qiao Nian. He did not dare to say a word and tried his best to reduce his presence.","Fortunately, Nie Qingru’s emotions only fluctuated for a moment. She quickly composed herself and walked in front with a cold expression. “Let’s go.”","The exhibition was set for the middle of that month.","There were about 10 days left. Since Master Cheng had decided to participate in this exhibition, he would definitely do his best to prepare for it.","He couldn’t bring something as big as the actual Tsar to the exhibition.","Master Cheng needed to complete a scaled-down model of the Tsar in 10 days. When the time came, he would participate in the exhibition with the model. Of course, confidential data was not to be announced to the public.","The Ninth Branch and Master Cheng would handle this part vaguely.","Of course, these small details would not affect the use of the model and its explosion. It was just that the power would be modified to a certain extent.","Qiao Nian was also on the list of participants.","However, it was different this time.","In the past, she had participated in the competition as a contestant, but this time, she was only one of the accompanying members of the Ninth Branch and would keep a low profile.","This was “low profile” only in the eyes of ordinary people.","Those in Continent M were shocked when Beijing handed the entourage list.","The Privy Council received the list immediately. The neutral faction led by the archbishop was the first to see Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan’s names on the list.","“Archbishop, are they coming too—”","“Well, they’re on the list.”","Jacob frowned as he stared at the last name on the list, “QIAO”. He stood beside the man for a long time before saying, “I’m afraid they’ll be in a tizzy again if they come to Continent M.”","The middle-aged man in the red clerical robe narrowed his eyes as he held the name list. Then, he nonchalantly said, “She was personally invited by the Empress. She should be the one to clean up the trouble.”","Jacob did not dare to say anything else when it came to matters at this level. It was mainly because his status did not allow him to express his opinions.","At this moment, someone rushed in from outside.","Jacob looked up and greeted respectfully, “Elder Xue.”","The person who came with Elder Xue was a young man. His facial features were well-defined and deep. His brown curly hair looked clean and neat, and the outline of his face seemed to have been carved by a knife.","He did not look as anxious as the silver-haired old man as he bowed slightly and greeted Quentin. “Archbishop.”","Quentin also glanced at him and restrained his arrogant expression. His tone was calm. “You’re here too?”","“Yes, I came with Elder Xue.” The young man was Luke, who had briefly interacted with Qiao Nian in the independent continent.","Quentin responded with an “oh” and did not express any opinion.","The silver-haired old man noticed the name list he was holding and walked over. Then, he said with a serious expression, “You also got this name list?”"]},{"number":3222,"title":"Chapter 3222: An Acquaintance Told Me Not to Go to Continent M","paragraphs":["Chapter 3222: An Acquaintance Told Me Not to Go to Continent M","“Yes.” Quentin gave him the name list.","Elder Xue took it and quickly read it. He already knew the names on the list. Without beating around the bush, he said bluntly, “Qiao Nian can’t come to Continent M!","“She’s too dangerous.”","He admired this girl who had some ancient Eastern blood flowing in her. It was just that everyone was on different sides now, so he had his own considerations.","As the representative of the conservative faction, he would agree to weaken the Empress’s power. However, he did not wish for anyone to stand above the Empress and provoke the reclusive families.","This was not his original intention.","“I wonder how much trouble she will cause this time...” Elder Xue narrowed his eyes and said sternly.","However, this time, his suggestion was not echoed by the other two.","As the leader of the neutral faction, Quentin was on the same level as him and spoke more directly. “I remember that you have a good relations.h.i.+p with her?”","“Personal relations.h.i.+ps are personal relations.h.i.+ps, but I still need to consider the Privy Council and the reclusive families’ interests.” He said without hesitation, “If the two conflict, I will stand on the Privy Council’s side!”","“Heh.” Quentin sneered, but he did not say anything. He still had that indifferent att.i.tude. “Then you should look for the Empress. After all, this matter was brought up by the","Empress.”","“You!”","The silver-haired old man did not seem to understand his reaction. He frowned and turned to look at the people of the Radical Faction, Leonard’s family, who had always followed the Empress’ lead.","“The Leonard family thinks so too?”","Luke owed Qiao Nian a favor from before.","He raised his eyes slightly and said irresponsibly, “I’m sorry, we won’t get involved in the weapons exhibition.”","Elder Xue frowned even more.","Luke looked at him and continued, “Actually, I think the archbishop is right. This matter wasn’t started by Beijing. Even if we want to interfere, we shouldn’t talk to Qiao Nian.”","Elder Xue regained his senses after a long time.","What he meant was that he was on Qiao Nian’s side!","Hadn’t Leonard and his family always followed the Empress’ lead? As Leonard’s successor, Luke’s att.i.tude at this moment was too intriguing.","Even Quentin glanced at him before retracting his gaze.","The Privy Council was divided into three factions. Two factions expressed that they would not interfere.","Even if Elder Xue was anxious, he couldn’t represent the entire Privy Council to ask Qiao Nian not to come to Continent M...","He originally thought that things would go smoothly if he was the one to come forward.","Now that the two of them were not cooperating with him, he could only keep quiet with a livid expression...","However, he did not give up. After leaving, he got into the car and found QIAO on his contact list. Then, he sent her a message.","The next day.","Qiao Nian saw she had an additional unread message from an overseas number.","She had added Elder Xue’s contact number before, so she was quite surprised to see his message. However, when she saw the message’s contents, her lips twitched, and her eyes turned indifferent and cold. She held her cell phone with her cold white hand and replied to him.","“What’s wrong?” Master Cheng casually asked when he saw she was looking at her phone with a mocking expression as he walked past her.","Qiao Nian had already replied. She put her phone back into her pocket and looked up at him. “An... acquaintance sent me a message asking me not to go to Continent M. Otherwise, he will be in a difficult position.”"]},{"number":3223,"title":"Chapter 3223: Sister Nian: Different Paths Can’t Work Together","paragraphs":["Chapter 3223: Sister Nian: Different Paths Can’t Work Together","Editor: Atlas Studios","Master Cheng had just gotten the model’s data from the computer. Hearing this, his eyes were filled with surprise. He thought for a moment and said, “Are you... very familiar with each other?”","“He gave me a seal before.” Qiao Nian thought for a moment, not knowing how to describe it. “But I haven’t used it once. I don’t owe him a favor.”","Before she left the Privy Council, Elder Xue had indeed come to look for her. He even forcefully stuffed a seal into her hands and said she could use it if needed.","However, she had never used it. She had only accepted it.","At that time, she accepted his kindness.","But according to the message she had just received, this old man, whom she had interacted with before, did not have a warm attitude.","He did not say anything too harsh in the text message, but when considered carefully, the meaning was not that friendly.","He mainly told her not to go to Continent M. Also, as a former member of the Privy Council, he hoped that she would not forget her original intentions and maintain reverence for the reclusive families.","Moreover, according to the message’s meaning, he seemed to disapprove of her recent actions in Continent F and felt that she was disrespecting the reclusive families...","The message was long.","Anyway, the meaning between the lines indicated one thing—he was reprimanding her.","Master Cheng could roughly tell from her expression and actions and did not ask further. He patted the girl’s shoulder and softly said, “It’s hard to work with people we don’t align with.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows. She had the same feeling.","Without dwelling too much on Elder Xue’s message, she followed Master Cheng outside of the glass-enclosed experiment table. Through the glass, she looked at the model gradually taking shape inside. After a moment, she said, “The Tsar’s model is already beginning to have lethality. I think this size is more or less suitable. People will become fearful if it’s stacked further.”","The Tsar was the greatest result of the Ninth Branch’s research. Master Cheng had yet to announce the specific data of this research to the public.","Nie Qingru came up with a weapons exhibition just to see what the Tsar looked like.","Just based on this point, Qiao Nian felt that if she continued to replicate the Tsar’s power, it would easily attract the covetous eyes of Continent M and other forces.","Ye Wangchuan could protect the Tsar, but Master Cheng was a living person.","It was dangerous for him.","If some people couldn’t get the Tsar, they could target Master Cheng or even destroy him...","Qiao Nian had to protect him.","A glint flashed across Master Cheng’s eyes, and his facial features softened. He looked in her direction and smiled. “I know what you’re worried about.","“However, since the Tsar is going to appear at this weapons exhibition, we have to show those people that our research results are not inferior to those overseas!”","His facial expression was extremely serious, the kind of seriousness and competition from the older generation in Beijing.","Qiao Nian looked at his serious expression and retracted her gaze. With one hand in her pocket, she said coolly, “Alright, I’ll ensure your safety.”","It was a little tight to complete a model in 10 days.","Fortunately, Master Cheng was a workaholic. He wished he could work 24 hours a day. With Qiao Nian’s help, the model was completed smoothly.","On the eighth day, the model was basically formed.","Qiao Nian mainly helped with professional data analysis and modeling. Most of the work was still done by Master Cheng and the laboratory members.","This time, Master Cheng no longer emphasized Yu Wenhao. Instead, he handed the work of making parts to Jiang Tianzhi and Li Lei."]},{"number":3224,"title":"Chapter 3224: Thinking Sister Nian Complained Behind His Back","paragraphs":["Chapter 3224: Thinking Sister Nian Complained Behind His Back","Editor: Atlas Studios","The previously highly valued Yu Wenhao was squeezed to the margin.","Unable to calm down, he came to the laboratory when the model was completed on the eighth day.","“Teacher...”","Qiao Nian was discussing a few small details with Master Cheng. Seeing him at the door, she put away the notebook and said to Master Cheng, “I’ll go back and try to build a model with the computer. I’ll tell you when it’s done...”","“Alright.” Master Cheng naturally saw Yu Wenhao outside and nodded.","Qiao Nian put away her things, picked up her bag, and left casually.","Yu Wenhao waited for her to leave before gritting his teeth and walking towards Master Cheng. He hesitated before speaking, “Teacher...”","Master Cheng sighed and finally put down the data book. He faced him with a benevolent expression and gently asked, “Why are you looking for me?”","Yu Wenhao found it difficult to speak. He took a deep breath and finally mustered the courage to look up. “Teacher, I want to ask you if you didn’t let me participate in the model production this time because I offended... Miss Qiao?”","Master Cheng’s wise eyes flashed as he looked at him seriously. “Is that what you think?”","Yu Wenhao was embarrassed by his sharp gaze and couldn’t look him in the eye. However, he still said, “I’ve been thinking these few days about why you wouldn’t let me participate in the model production of this project. You let others do it, but you didn’t let me do it. I couldn’t figure it out! So when I think of what happened before and how I didn’t perform well those times, I wonder... could it be because of this... Teacher, you distanced yourself from me.”","Master Cheng really did not expect him to be so conflicted over this for the past few days. He restrained his gentle attitude, which was rare, and showed some anger. “Do you think only you are entitled to this chance?”","No matter how stupid Yu Wenhao was, he realized his teacher was angry. He waved his hand in a panic. “That’s not what I meant, Teacher. I...”","“No, that’s what you mean!” Master Cheng let out a shaky breath and told him firmly, “You’ve been expressing this to me from the beginning to the end.”","Yu Wenhao’s face was pale. He bit his lips, unable to defend himself.","Master Cheng was furious but relaxed again. He looked at him like he expected better of him. “You are indeed talented. I also want to nurture you. However, I now realize that you still need to temper your temperament. Narrow-mindedness won’t affect your experiments, but it will affect whether a scientist can become a good person.”","A narrow-minded scientist who could not tolerate others was not a good thing for society. Of course, it was not a good thing for the Ninth Branch either.","He wanted to nurture a good scientist. He did not want the person he nurtured to have a problem with his basic character.","“Think about it.”","Master Cheng did not want to be too harsh to him. After all, he was his student. It was not like he did not feel for him.","He hoped that Yu Wenhao would think it through himself.","However, he finally understood why Ye Wangchuan had called him out to talk about Yu Wenhao that day...","This time, he did not give the go-ahead for the model. Instead, he found someone else to help.","Yu Wenhao wondered if Qiao Nian had said something to him in private.","Master Cheng was extremely disappointed and ignored Yu Wenhao’s flustered expression. In the end, he looked at him deeply, grabbed his things, shook his head, and left..."]},{"number":3225,"title":"Chapter 3225: Sister Qiao, What’s That on Your Arm?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3225: Sister Qiao, What’s That on Your Arm?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Yu Wenhao watched as Master Cheng left. He quietly clenched his fists and lowered his head, his expression contorting in pain.","August 15th.","There were still two days before the weapons exhibition. The Beijing delegation began to make preparations.","Qiao Nian was definitely going.","Ye Wangchuan had no reason not to go.","Bo Zheng was also going to ensure Master Cheng’s safety. He even brought his deputy, Luo Qing...","This time, Bo Jingxing was not going with them. He gave up his spot and decided that Jiang Tianzhi would go in his place.","The group set off from the airport in grandiosity. They planned to go to the hotel arranged by the organizers a day in advance so they could organize and rest before the weapons exhibition began.","The Beijing weather was sunny.","Ye Wangchuan and Gu San went to the Ninth Branch early to pick up Master Cheng.","Qiao Nian was the last to arrive at the airport.","Qin Si was the first to notice her.","“Sister Qiao is here.”","A group of around 10 people looked in the terminal gate’s direction. As expected, they saw a girl in a white short-sleeved shirt and an ice sleeve on her arm. Her baseball cap was lowered and she did not carry luggage. She only had a bag slung over her shoulder as she walked casually and coolly.","Without a doubt, the person with such a strong aura was Qiao Nian!","Master Cheng saw the girl and took the initiative to wave at her. “We’re here~”","Not far away.","Qiao Nian had already seen them and walked towards the group.","Qin Si was indeed a chatterbox. He immediately noticed the ice sleeve on her arm and looked around teasingly. “Sister Qiao, you’re still wearing this? It doesn’t make sense ~”","The others were also looking at the ice sleeve curiously. However, they were too embarrassed to ask about it as familiarly as Qin Si.","“Give me your shoulder bag. I’ll carry it for you,” Ye Wangchuan said gently.","Qiao Nian pursed her lips before handing the shoulder bag to him.","Qin Si, who was originally standing between the two of them excitedly, immediately revealed a look of disgust when he saw this. He looked like he had just been forced to watch their public display of affection and said with disdain, “Master Wang, I have a suitcase too. Why don’t...”","“Huh?” Ye Wangchuan grabbed the shoulder bag and turned to look at him. He looked like a modest gentleman and was as gentle as jade. “What else?”","‘You look like you want to kill me. Do I dare?!’","Qin Si admitted defeat. “Why don’t you put it together with my suitcase? I’ll help you push it away. This way, it won’t be difficult.”","He even shamelessly offered to carry the luggage, as if he was a lackey.","Fortunately, everyone was just joking. Ye Wangchuan would not let him help carry it. He elegantly carried Qiao Nian’s bag and lightly said, “No need. I’ll carry it myself.”","Qin Si should have been happy that he did not have to help carry Qiao Nian’s bag. However, when he saw how willing he was to carry Qiao Nian’s bag...","Qin Si felt like he was the one missing out.","He was not easily dejected. Soon, he remembered the topic he had asked Qiao Nian previously and caught up with the girl. “By the way, Sister Qiao, why are you wearing that thing on your arm?”","Qiao Nian had just greeted Bo Zheng, Luo Qing, and the others when she was pestered by him again. She immediately felt a headache. “Didn’t you check the Continent M weather?”","“What’s wrong with the weather there?” Qin Si was still chattering.","Qiao Nian was getting a headache from this argument and was about to stop him.","Bo Zheng grabbed Qin Si’s collar and dragged him back. “They issued a high-temperature warning in Continent M for the next few days. The temperature is approaching 40oC.”"]},{"number":3226,"title":"Chapter 3226: Preparing to Set Off","paragraphs":["Chapter 3226: Preparing to Set Off","Editor: Atlas Studios","“The ultraviolet light over there is strong. Wearing an ice sleeve can prevent skin sunburn...”","“Gosh!! 40oC?!” Qin Si looked like he was eating grass.","However, Bo Zheng did not give him a chance to speak and dragged him. “Come with me to help with the luggage.”","Luo Qing was Bo Zheng’s assistant, so he naturally followed him.","He had not seen Qiao Nian in a long time and missed her. He had wanted to talk to her more, but he had no choice and only greeted the girl regretfully. “Miss Qiao, I’ll help them.”","“Okay.”","Qiao Nian responded.","Luo Qing did not delay and followed Bo Zheng and Qin Si.","As soon as Qin Si left, the surroundings fell silent. There was no longer the chirping of sparrows.","Master Cheng was so bothered by the noise that his head hurt. Now, he could finally relax. Caught between laughter and tears, he said to Ye Wangchuan, “Has he always been like this?”","Hearing this question, Ye Wangchuan placed the sapphire blue suitcase by his leg and replied casually, “All bottom-feeders are like this.”","“Yes.” Master Cheng nodded thoughtfully.","He remembered that Qin Si seemed to have graduated from a certain technical university. Of course, his resumé was inferior to Ye Wangchuan’s.","In front of this Young Master Ye, few people were not considered... bottom-feeders.","After all, Ye Wangchuan wasn’t a star student. He was a genius. Only Qiao Nian’s talent was on par with his.","At this moment, the airport broadcasted an announcement.","Ye Wangchuan said gently, “Master Cheng, it’s time.”","They were also on a private plane this time.","Since they were representing the Ninth Branch and Beijing in the weapons exhibition this time, they did not use the Ye family’s private plane. Instead, they chose the Ninth Branch’s plane.","The plane left at 10 o’clock.","At 9:40 am, everyone boarded the plane.","As usual, Qiao Nian sat in a corner by the window. She asked the flight attendant for a blanket and eye mask and prepared to sleep.","Qin Si knew of her habit of sleeping the moment she boarded the plane and did not pester her. He sat with Bo Zheng.","Bo Zheng sat down and looked at him. “I remember your Mom asked me to find you a girlfriend not long ago. Why? You haven’t found a suitable person yet?”","Qin Si originally wanted to ask him about matters overseas. After all, Guan Yan was always outside.","However, before he could say anything, Bo Zheng mentioned that his family was urging him to get married. He immediately brushed him off. “How can I so easily meet the right person? Isn’t Bo Jingxing still single? How can I find a partner before he does?”","Bo Zheng raised his eyebrows noncommittally. “You can also consider your personal problems so your mother won’t worry.”","Afraid he would continue, Qin Si simply laughed and changed the topic. “By the way, Uncle Bo, do you think we’ll encounter danger on this trip to Continent M? Even you and the vice-captain are here this time. Could it be that the weapons exhibition is very dangerous? Does someone have... malicious intentions?”","“Don’t overthink.” Bo Zheng patted his shoulder, not wanting to reveal too much.","“Okay.” Qin Si was a smart person. He immediately sensed what he meant and tactfully stopped talking.","The people from the Ninth Branch were sitting behind them.","Jiang Tianzhi was tall and took the initiative to give up the seat by the window. “You can go first.”","Yu Wenhao also came this time. He declined several times, but seeing that Jiang Tianzhi insisted on giving up his seat, he thanked him and sat by the window.","Jiang Tianzhi unhurriedly sat down and asked the flight attendant for two bottles of water, one for him and the other for Yu Wenhao."]},{"number":3227,"title":"Chapter 3227: Sister Nian Received Another Text Message","paragraphs":["Chapter 3227: Sister Nian Received Another Text Message","Editor: Atlas Studios","“You can put it aside and drink it when you are thirsty.”","“Okay, thanks.”","Yu Wenhao thanked him awkwardly. He held the water bottle in his hand and lowered his eyes. After thinking for a while, he raised his head and looked at him.","“Well”","Jiang Tianzhi looked at him in confusion. “What?”","Yu Wenhao knew he did not like him. After hesitating for a while, he was too embarrassed to say anything and just shook his head. “Nothing.”","As a Northerner, Jiang Tianzhi never liked beating around the bush. Seeing that Yu Wenhao stopped mid-sentence, he frowned, and his tone was much colder than before as he said, “Tell me if you want to go out later. I’ll make way for you.”","Yu Wenhao could feel his cold attitude and did not want to embarrass himself. “Okay.”","Jiang Tianzhi simply closed his eyes and stopped talking to him.","Seeing this, Yu Wenhao silently took his laptop from his bag and placed it on the small tray to start sorting out the data.","He did not have to come originally, but Master Cheng had previously handed some data collection work to him.","The Tsar was appearing at the weapons exhibition, so he needed to use some old data.","Yu Wenhao calculated some of the data, so it would take someone else time to master it.","He would have to hand the data to the newcomer.","It would be a waste of time.","The weapons exhibition was imminent. Master Cheng did not want to make it too troublesome. After careful consideration, he chose to bring him along.","Although that was the case, to temper his temperament and arrogance, Master Cheng deliberately did not talk to him much.","Qin Si and Bo Zheng weren’t from the Ninth Branch and were unfamiliar with them.","They did not have much in common, so there was nothing to talk about.","Master Cheng ignored him. Yu Wenhao could be said to be suffering in his heart. However, he understood his teacher’s intentions and did not continue complaining.","He could only devote all his energy to organizing the data. However, this kind of experimental data was complicated and messy, to begin with, so it was very difficult to sort it out.","Secondly, Jiang Tianzhi was sitting beside him. Although he was resting with his eyes closed, he still felt an invisible pressure, making him unable to breathe.","In the past, Master Cheng would probably only bring him along and not even consider anyone else.","But this time... he almost could not make the cut.","While Yu Wenhao was flustered about his predicament ...","On the other side, Qiao Nian had already stretched her long legs and put on a blanket to sleep.","The plane would take off in five minutes.","She was about to turn off her cell phone when the screen lit up.","A new message popped up in the bottom left corner.","Qiao Nian clicked on it and saw it was still a familiar foreign number with a reproachful tone.","[Are you really coming to Continent M?]","Qiao Nian glanced at it and frowned.","Ye Wangchuan had just gone to the front to get her another bottle of water. When he returned, he saw the girl’s hardened face, dark eyes, and cold aura.","He stopped and noticed Qiao Nian was looking at her cell phone. He handed her the water bottle and raised his eyebrows. “Elder Xue again?”","“Ah.” The girl raised her eyelashes slightly and suppressed her impatience. “Who else could it be?”","Seeing that she was no longer in the mood to drink water, Ye Wangchuan retracted his hand and thoughtfully unscrewed the bottle cap before handing it to her. “Drink water to reduce the heat.”"]},{"number":3228,"title":"Chapter 3228: Nie Qixing Is Going Crazy?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3228: Nie Qixing Is Going Crazy?","Qiao Nian got up early in the morning and rushed to the airport. She did not drink any water along the way. Thus, she took the bottle from him and took a sip. Then, she capped the bottle and said with a frustrated expression, “This is already the sixth message.”","She had replied to the other party once and made it very clear that she was going over as an entourage of the Ninth Branch this time. As long as the reclusive families did not take the initiative to provoke her, she would not cause trouble at the weapons exhibitions.","However, Elder Xue did not seem to listen. From time to time, he would persuade her not to come.","He even said that if she was worried, the Privy Council could send two people to protect Master Cheng.","Gee.","The Privy Council was an organization of the reclusive families. Nie Qingru was the one to propose the weapons exhibition. And he expected her to ask the reclusive families’ people to protect Master Cheng and the Tsar model? Was there any difference from asking wolves with ill intentions to protect sheep?","The reasoning behind this was simple.","However, some people were used to only caring about themselves and always thought everyone should act according to their whims and fancies.","Ye w.a.n.gchuan took the water bottle from her hand and placed it on the tray. His voice was low and mellow as he asked, “Aren’t you going to blacklist him?”","“I’ve thought about it.” Qiao Nian was quite direct, mainly because there was nothing she had to hide in front of him.","Ye w.a.n.gchuan raised his eyes slightly. “You thought about it? Why didn’t you do it?”","Qiao Nian felt the left side of her seat sink. He was beside her. She pulled down her baseball cap, revealing only her snow-white chin.","“I realized that I did not owe anyone an explanation.”","She did not need to explain, so she naturally did not need to pay attention to the other party’s text messages.","Furthermore, she had accepted the other party’s seal. Although she had never used it, she had accepted it as a token of her appreciation. As to blacklisting his contact ... she would reconsider.","“He’s quite restrained. He knows only to send messages and not call me.” Qiao Nian’s temples throbbed. Just thinking about it annoyed her. “Just take it that I’m giving the archbishop face.”","This time, only Elder Xue looked for her.","It was obvious the neutral archbishop and the Leonard family’s radical faction were not on his side.","Since most of the people in the Privy Council were neutral...","She was not intending to fight with them.","“Master Cheng values this weapon exhibition very much. Let’s wait until the weapon exhibition is over,” Qiao Nian said in a low voice.","Actually, as long as Nie Qingru did not cause trouble, she did not have to do anything.","Elder Xue worried too much.","Instead of worrying about her, the Privy Council might as well think of a way to make Nie Qingru stop for a few days.","**","Continent M.","Nie Qingru’s car slowly entered the manor.","Shadow quickly opened the door for her and stood by, respectfully waiting for her to get out. After leaving the car, Nie Qingru took off her velvet gloves and handed them to the servant. She walked in and asked, “Have the people from Beijing set off?”","Shadow quickly followed her. “Their plane left two hours ago. They will land at the airport in five hours.”","“Mm.”","Nie Qingru had already stepped into the garden. Pa.s.sing by the angel fountain carved from white jade, she remembered Nie Qixing’s condition in the sanatorium and stopped in her tracks. Her tone softened and she said, “Go to the sanatorium to see Qixing. The doctor said his mental state is unstable.”","Shadow raised his head, and a trace of helplessness and heartache flashed across his face.","Ever since Nie Qixing woke up and found that he had lost an eye and had a disability in his leg, he had fallen into a low point.","In the beginning, he smashed things crazily and refused to eat.","After Nie Qingru slapped him twice, he was willing to cooperate with the doctor, ate, and received treatment, but his mood was very low. He was like a walking corpse."]},{"number":3229,"title":"Chapter 3229: Master Wang, I Think I Can Still Be Rescued","paragraphs":["Chapter 3229: Master Wang, I Think I Can Still Be Rescued","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qingru said, “You have a good relationship with him.”","“Go see him. He might feel better.”","“Yes, I’ll go later.” Shadow did not dare to go against her wishes. He was still worried about Nie Qixing, so he agreed readily.","“Mm.” Nie Qingru’s sharp eyes were indifferent. She didn’t appear happy or angry. She turned around and talked to him about serious matters. “Is the hotel ready?”","Shadow raised his head. “I’ve done as you instructed.”","“That’s good.” Her expression softened slightly, and her eyes finally lit up as she coldly said, “Previously, it was difficult to do anything to her in Continent F and the independent continent. But now that they’re in Continent M, I have to let her know whose home ground this is!”","Shadow crossed his hands and bowed respectfully. He would only speak when Nie Qingru asked him, and he usually did not talk much...","Nie Qingru was most satisfied with his tactfulness. She elegantly took off her hat and handed it to the servant before entering.","Continent M.","3:30 pm.","Master Cheng’s plane landed at the airport.","According to the process card issued by the organizer of the weapons exhibition, event staff were in charge of picking up the guests and bringing the delegations to special hotels.","After the plane landed, everyone took their luggage and prepared to leave.","The majestic oriental faces were extremely eye-catching. Qiao Nian’s hands were in her pockets and she also wore a baseball cap that covered most of her face as she walked in the middle of the crowd.","Besides her strong aura, she wasn’t too eye-catching.","But Ye Wangchuan was different.","Although he had an oriental face, he was handsome and elegant, destined to stand out in the crowd.","He was not dressed in a high-profile manner. He wore light-colored casual clothes with a decorative waistcoat, and his beige pants accentuated his long legs.","His temperament was even more outstanding and eye-catching.","A few blonde women could not help but glance at them when they passed by.","“Tsk.” Qin Si noticed the gazes and placed one hand on Qiao Nian’s shoulder. He said smugly to the noble and lazy man, “Master Wang, your peacock tail is a little too big. It’s too much! Sister Qiao is still here. Tsk, tsk, tsk. What should I say about you?”","He rolled his eyes and thought:?“Unmanly in your principles!”","Qiao Nian calmly pushed his hand away and pulled down her baseball cap as she followed the group, completely uninterested in his “unethical” behavior.","Qin Si was left behind. When Bo Zheng passed him, he gave him a sympathetic look and even patted him gently on the shoulder. “I hope you can still see the sun tomorrow.”","“Young Master Qin, you’re very bold. You have my moral support. Good luck.” Luo Qing also chuckled and ran away quickly.","In the blink of an eye, only he and Ye Wangchuan were left at the back. Only then did Qin Si realize he had spoken too quickly and was about to admit defeat.","Unexpectedly, Ye Wangchuan ignored him. He pushed his luggage and followed the person in front, brushing past him.","Qin Si was speechless.","Seeing he was the only one left behind, Qin Si reacted quickly. He quickly pulled his luggage and followed him. Then, he leaned over and smiled cheekily. “I was just joking, right? Sister Qiao did not even react...”","Ye Wangchuan had one hand in his pocket and the other pushing the luggage. He glanced sideways at the person scratching his ear and cheeks and said, “You’re definitely going to Mo Dong’s place.”"]},{"number":3230,"title":"Chapter 3230: Sister Nian Won’t Pamper Them","paragraphs":["Chapter 3230: Sister Nian Won’t Pamper Them","Editor: Atlas Studios","“No, Master Wang, can you reconsider it... I think I can still salvage it...” Qin Si wailed and pulled his arm. Then, he immediately knelt. “Master Wang, save me.”","Soon, they arrived at the entrance of the airport.","At this moment, Master Cheng frowned and stopped. “Why don’t I see the staff?”","He turned to ask the others, “Did any of you spot anyone here for us?”","Jiang Tianzhi shook his head.","He did not see the staff either.","Yu Wenhao was even more confused. He didn’t know that there would be a pick-up.","Bo Zheng took out his cell phone and looked at the time. “We told them the time we’d be arriving. There’s no traffic on the way here. Logically speaking, they should already be here.”","He did not continue, which implied that the organizers were deliberately making them wait.","Qiao Nian walked in the middle. When Master Cheng and Bo Zheng communicated briefly, she unhurriedly walked to the side of the road and calmly signaled for a taxi.","There were many taxis near the airport.","Waving her hand and stopping one, Qiao Nian moved aside and said to Master Cheng, “You and Captain Bo go first. I’ll take the one behind you. We’ll gather at the hotel.”","Bo Zheng’s face froze and he looked at her subconsciously. “You mean...”","Qiao Nian was blunt. “They probably won’t pick us up anytime soon. We probably might have to wait for two to three hours. In that case, why don’t we go directly to the hotel? It’s not like we can’t find the way ourselves. Why should we wait for them?”","Bo Zheng and Master Cheng were originally quite angry about the organizer’s actions. Hearing what she said, their anger dissipated and their facial expressions relaxed.","Bo Zheng smiled and raised his hand gentlemanly. “Master Cheng, you’re an elder. Get in first.”","Master Cheng pulled his luggage and chuckled. “Then I won’t stand on ceremony.”","The two of them got into the car one after another. Since there was still a seat, Jiang Tianzhi also got in.","Qiao Nian closed the door for them and raised her hand to call for another taxi. She told Luo Qing and Yu Wenhao to get in. Behind them, Qin Si was kicked in by Ye Wangchuan.","After they left, Qiao Nian unhurriedly signaled the last taxi and got in.","Ye Wangchuan and Gu San followed her.","Gu San held back and did not speak all this time.","Seeing they were about to reach the hotel, Gu San could not help but say, “Miss Qiao, do you think they did the same thing with the hotel?”","Qiao Nian rolled down the window and let the wind in.","Her face was fair, and her dark eyes were narrowed. She was frustrated, but she did not take this matter too seriously. “I don’t know.”","Gu San really wanted to say, “Even you don’t know?”","Qiao Nian said right on the heels of that, “We’ll deal with whatever comes our way.”","She also wanted to see what kind of opening gambit Nie Qingru had prepared for her!","At the same time.","Shadow had already received the news from the spies at the airport.","“What did you say? They didn’t wait for the staff to pick them up?” His tone was bad.","The spy could tell from his tone as well. He could only bite the bullet and tell the truth. “Yes, the Beijing people did not wait for the staff. They took taxis. They had no intention of waiting for us to pick them up...”","Under normal circumstances, given that the procedure stated that the staff would go to the airport to receive them, ordinary people would at least wait, right?","However, the other party refused to wait and did not indulge them for a moment!"]},{"number":3231,"title":"Chapter 3231: Must Establish An Upper Hand","paragraphs":["Chapter 3231: Must Establish An Upper Hand","Editor: Atlas Studios","This made them feel a little untenable. After all, as the organizers, they had the obligation to receive the various delegations.","“What do you think we should do next?” The spy asked carefully.","Shadow did not expect Qiao Nian and the others to be so direct. They did not wait for a moment. It was completely different from their expectations.","Shadow rubbed his temples and said in a deep voice, “You don’t have to worry about the rest. I’ll deal with it.”","“Will do.”","The spy was very obedient.","Shadow hung up the phone and contacted the hotel. He suppressed his anger and said, “They’re almost there. Follow the plan!”","After making a few consecutive calls, he composed himself, put away his phone, and strode into the private sanatorium where Nie Qixing was recuperating.","Master Cheng’s taxi arrived at the hotel first, followed by Qin Si and the others’, and then some researchers from the Ninth Branch.","Finally, Qiao Nian’s taxi arrived.","When everyone was present, Master Cheng entered and went to do the check-in.","Bo Zheng accompanied him.","Qiao Nian followed silently.","Arriving at the front desk, Master Cheng handed over his personal information and invitation letter. After verifying them one by one, the front desk person looked up and said with a troubled expression, “May I ask if you have any of the organizer’s staff members with you?”","Master Cheng immediately frowned. “Hasn’t the document I provided already proved our identities? Even if we don’t have any of the personnel with us, this has nothing to do with us checking into the hotel, right?”","The front desk staff was apologetic. “I’m sorry. According to our hotel’s rules, the team participating in the weapons exhibition this time must be guided by the staff to complete the check-in procedures.”","The staff returned the documents to Master Cheng and gently said, “Why don’t you wait for the staff to arrive?”","Master Cheng took the documents with a solemn facial expression. He clearly understood that the other party was making things difficult for him.","However, the front desk staff even added fuel to the fire. “There are 12 people based on the documents you submitted. We may not have enough rooms for all of you. Three of the rooms would be double rooms.”","Her meaning was clear.","12 rooms were compressed into nine.","Apart from six single rooms, the rest were all business-standard rooms.","This was not the standard of a weapons exhibition.","Even the good-tempered Master Cheng could not help but turn around now. “Why didn’t I receive advance notice?”","The front desk staff’s tone was casual. “We just realized there aren’t enough rooms. According to how the weapons exhibition was handled in the past, in such an unexpected situation, we must first ensure that the previous champion team and the teams that have produced good results have rooms. This is your third time participating, right? The last time was 10 years ago, and your results weren’t outstanding. Therefore, we can only leave the double rooms to you.”","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes.","The front desk person actually dared to speak so explicitly. Qiao Nian did not believe she had the guts to say that without any instigation!","But the other party was very smart.","After all, this was the front desk. She did not scold anyone or anything. She acted politely the entire time.","Besides her words being unpleasant to listen to, she was reasonable and well-founded.","They would inevitably attract gossip if they conflicted with the front desk person.","The others did not know them.","If news of this conflict spread, it would affect the image of Beijing and the Ninth Branch.","This was probably what Nie Qingru wanted!"]},{"number":3232,"title":"Chapter 3232: Sister Nian Counterattacks","paragraphs":["Chapter 3232: Sister Nian Counterattacks","Editor: Atlas Studios","Master Cheng knew that very well. Even though his neck was red from anger, he held back from arguing with the other party.","At this moment, a hoarse female voice interrupted.","“Since you don’t have enough rooms, we’ll stay in another hotel. Is that okay?”","The front desk person was shocked and instinctively looked over.","She was stunned upon seeing the girl wearing a baseball cap looking at her calmly. She could not think of a solution for a moment. “Uh... this isn’t good, right? This is the stipulated hotel...”","“What stipulation? I didn’t see anything about it in the organizer’s participation requirements. It was only indicated that this hotel will be provided as accommodation.”","Qiao Nian was quite impatient. “Since your hotel didn’t prepare in advance, we’ll give up our rooms to the other teams so everyone can be more comfortable. What’s wrong with that?”","The front desk person was stunned. She stammered, unable to find a reasonable explanation.","After all, Qiao Nian expressed a good attitude in her argument... However, as the front desk staff, she had been instructed to stop this group and make them wait in the lobby for a few hours.","This was clearly not the desired outcome.","Seeing that the matter was about to get out of her control, the front desk person could only hurriedly say, “Wait a moment. I’ll ask the manager.”","She pretended to pick up the office line, but instead of the manager, she called an outside number.","In the sanatorium.","Nie Qixing was in a bad situation.","Just as Nie Qingru had said, only his body was still here.","“... In other words, if Young Master Qi continues like this, his body will quickly deteriorate?”","“That’s right. We can only try our best to maintain his physiological indicators. But you should also understand that humans not only need the “hardware” to maintain their survival, but they also need to be rejuvenated. If the patient continues like this, not to mention physical rehabilitation, he won’t even have the basic desire to survive. We can’t do anything about the current situation.”","“I... understand.”","Shadow said goodbye to Nie Qixing’s attending doctor and went to the garden outside to find the man in the wheelchair.","Before the accident, Nie Qixing could not compare to Qin Si and Ye Wangchuan’s ostentatious looks but could be considered a promising young scientist with a refined and dignified image.","However, now sitting in a wheelchair with a scraggly beard and lifeless eyes, he no longer looked like the graceful figure from not long ago.","If not for the fact that he was recuperating in the most expensive sanatorium in Continent M, people would have believed he was a tramp based on his current image.","Shadow looked at him from afar. It would be a lie to say that he did not feel uncomfortable.","After all, he saw the child grow up.","He could not help but lighten his footsteps as he approached. “Young Master Qi, are you feeling better?”","Nie Qixing did not look at him. He was numb as if he could not hear anything from the outside world. If not because his chest was still heaving, he would have looked like a dead man.","It was not an exaggeration to say that he was as withered as a corpse!","Shadow held his breath. His chest was being pulled and he did not know what to say to him. He stood there and followed his gaze for half an hour.","At this moment, his cell phone rang.","At first, Shadow rejected the call because of Nie Qixing’s presence.","However, the other party was persistent. He glanced at the caller ID and said to the person in the wheelchair, “Young Master Qi, I’ll go answer this call.”","Nie Qixing did not say anything, but at least he looked in his direction.","Shadow hurried to a corner to answer the call."]},{"number":3233,"title":"Chapter 3233: Actually, You’re Related to Her","paragraphs":["Chapter 3233: Actually, You’re Related to Her","Editor: Atlas Studios","The sanatorium’s lawn was well-trimmed.","Shadow walked to the corner and answered the call. “Speak.”","The front desk person finally got him. She hurriedly told him about the situation and then softly asked, “Manager, can we check in for the guests?”","Shadow’s temples bulged after hearing this. He did not say anything for a long time.","“Manager?” Because Qiao Nian and the others were not far away, the front desk did not dare to expose the people they had contacted outside the hotel.","Shadow took a deep breath. “Do it. I’ll take care of the rest.”","The front desk person was more than happy to oblige and immediately agreed. “Okay, okay.”","The call ended.","Shadow listened to the busy tone and kept his phone. He then walked back with heavy eyes.","Nie Qixing was still the same as when he left. His eye was as dull as a dead person’s, without any luster.","Seeing him like this, Shadow pondered briefly before suddenly saying, “Young Master Qi, Qiao Nian is in Continent M.”","Then, he added, “She’s checking in at a hotel right now.”","She actually dared to come!!!","The man in the wheelchair seemed to have received a huge shock. His eyes widened as he grabbed the armrest tightly and began to pant heavily.","He looked overstimulated.","Shadow resisted the urge to help him and clenched his fists. Looking down at him struggling and in pain, he deliberately said, “She came to the weapons exhibition as a delegate from Beijing. You’re an outstanding scientist. Don’t you want to compete with her?”","Nie Qixing’s facial muscles trembled violently, and his expression turned ferocious and painful.","Shadow tried to persuade him bit by bit. “The Empress has given you a chance this time. If you continue to be depressed like this, it will only make Qiao Nian happy. Don’t you want to... stand up again?”","“Stop it.” Nie Qixing let out a hoarse roar. His voice was so deep that it sounded like a beast’s. He did not sound like a normal person at all.","Shadow was secretly happy that he finally spoke. He knew that he had done the right thing. He did not listen to Nie Qixing and instead continued. “Young Master Qi, she’s actually a relative of yours.”","Nie Qixing recalled the memory of his eye being gouged out and his leg being broken. The entire world was dyed red.","It was not until Shadow mentioned that Qiao Nian was related to him that he looked up in disbelief.","Qiao Nian was related to him?","What did that mean?","How could they... be related?","“She’s the Empress’s granddaughter.” Shadow saw his confused expression and explained, “Strictly speaking, you two are very close by blood. She should even call you granduncle.”","Nie Qixing opened his mouth slightly, and he squeezed out after some time, “Does she know?”","This time, his voice was slightly better than before. At the very least, it was not as hoarse. However, it was broken and unpleasant.","Shadow returned his gaze and answered his question directly. “Qiao Nian knew about it a long time ago.”","If she knew that they were related, why would she do this?!","Nie Qixing’s anger reached its peak. He leaned forward and spat a mouthful of black blood."]},{"number":3234,"title":"Chapter 3234: Sister Nian: There Must Be a Limit!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3234: Sister Nian: There Must Be a Limit!","Editor: Atlas Studios","Shadow was shocked and hurried to support him. He was sweating profusely. “Young Master Qi, are you alright?”","“Doctor!” Shadow turned around and shouted.","“I’m fine.” Nie Qixing grabbed his arm tightly.","Shadow saw that his empty eye was lit up.","Nie Qixing gritted his teeth and said, “She knows who I am and still did this to me. She can’t be forgiven!”","Shadow wanted to tell him about the grudges of the previous generation, but he held back upon seeing that Nie Qixing was filled with hatred and his desire to live was at least ignited.","Nie Qixing wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth. His heart had long been corroded by hatred. He gritted his teeth and squeezed out a sentence. “Weapons exhibition, right?”","Shadow’s eyebrows twitched. He helped him to sit down again and observed his expression. In the end, he did not say anything.","At the hotel lobby.","The front desk person hung up and immediately smiled at Master Cheng and the others. “I’m sorry for the wait. I’ve asked the manager. I can do the check-in now. There’s no need to wait for the staff anymore. May I help you?”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and placed her fair hand on the counter. She curled her fingers and knocked.","The front desk person’s heartbeat accelerated. She quickly asked Master Cheng, “Do you need me to do the check-in for you now?”","Master Cheng did not answer her immediately. Instead, he looked at Qiao Nian as if asking for her opinion.","Qiao Nian looked straight at the front desk person and casually asked, “Only nine rooms?”","The front desk person was naturally afraid of her and hesitated before saying, “This... According to past results and regulations...”","Qiao Nian did not spoil her. “Then call your ‘manager’ and ask if you only have nine rooms. If so, we’ll go somewhere else.”","The front desk person did not expect her to be so unyielding. She gritted her teeth and mustered her courage to remind her, “Madam, all the other delegations are staying in our hotel. If you insist on changing hotels, you might not be able to participate in the weapons exhibition...”","“Tsk.”","The girl sneered frivolously.","Then, she looked up and met the girl’s dark eyes. They were so deep that they seemed to be able to suck her in. “Who told you we want to participate in the weapons exhibition?”","The front desk person was stunned. Weren’t they the ones begging to participate?","This was the most prestigious exhibition of scientific weapons in the world. It was an honor to participate.","Qiao Nian said, “Ask your backer. There has to be a limit. I don’t have such a good temper that I’ll always give in to her.”","The front desk person was speechless.","Qiao Nian raised her head slightly, revealing her exquisite, expressionless face. “I’ll give her three minutes to consider. If she wants to continue playing tricks, I’ll immediately bring my people back. I won’t stay for a second longer!","“Alright, call her. It’s best to ask her in one go this time.”","Although the front desk person felt aggrieved, under the girl’s strong aura, she instinctively picked up the office line and called the number again.","She tactfully repeated Qiao Nian’s words to the ‘manager’.","Qiao Nian did not know how the ‘manager’ replied, but after the front desk person hung up, she was much more restrained and respectful.","She looked up and said to Master Cheng and the others, “I’m sorry, we have enough rooms in the hotel. We’ll arrange your rooms according to the previous plan.”"]},{"number":3235,"title":"Chapter 3235: It’s Miss Qiao","paragraphs":["Chapter 3235: It’s Miss Qiao","Editor: Atlas Studios","This time, she stretched out her hand and did not dare to mention the accompanying staff she insisted on earlier. She said to Master Cheng very easily, “Please give me your check-in information. I’ll settle the procedures right away.”","Master Cheng considered before finally handing her the documents. “The rooms...”","He did not finish speaking before the front desk person quickly said, “They’re all single business suites. Don’t worry about that.”","Qin Si smacked his lips and touched his earlobe. When Master Cheng received the room card and handed it to him, he glanced in the girl’s direction.","Qiao Nian also got a room card. Her room was next to Ye Wangchuan’s, and close to Master Cheng’s room... The location was all right.","She put away the room card and turned to the front desk person. “Is there no one to help us carry our luggage?”","The front desk person experienced firsthand that she was not to be trifled with. Moreover, even the people from the reclusive families seemed afraid of the girl. Naturally, she did not dare to pretend to be stupid and immediately said, “I’ll immediately call the bellboy.”","Then, she called the staff and asked them to send bellboys to help the Beijing delegation with their luggage...","Luo Qing saw how difficult it was for them to check-in. Now, someone was helping them with their luggage. They only needed to return to their rooms to rest.","He immediately grinned and whispered into Bo Zheng’s ear, “... It has to be Miss Qiao.”","Bo Zheng glanced at him and pushed his face away. Then, he said in a low voice, “I’m afraid there’s another layer of relationship we don’t know about.”","Luo Qing was puzzled. “What relationship?”","Bo Zheng did not spill the beans. “Just watch. I’m afraid the weapons exhibition won’t go so smoothly this time!”","In the afternoon.","Nie Qingru received news that Qiao Nian and the others had successfully checked in. She also learned from Shadow about Qiao Nian’s unyielding attitude.","She did not show much emotion. She put down the document she was reading and indifferently said, “This is just an appetizer. I didn’t want to use this to teach her a lesson.”","After exchanging blows with Qiao Nian a few times, she could already tell that this evil creature did not have Ji Qing’s personality and was not so soft and easy to get along with.","Most importantly, this evil creature did not treat her as her grandmother.","Without any blood ties, Qiao Nian was too similar to that person!","Back then, Nie Qingru was already suffocated by that person. It was not until that person died that she regained her freedom. Decades later, facing an opponent as powerful as her, she also had the urge to avenge her previous humiliation!","“How’s the situation on Qixing’s side?” Nie Qingru still took the time to show concern for Nie Qixing at this time. It was obvious how important Nie Qixing was to her.","Shadow raised his eyebrows. “Young Master Qi is much better now. He has been actively cooperating with the doctor’s treatment. But he made a request and asked me to pass it on to you.”","Nie Qingru leaned back and placed her hands on the table. “Speak.”","Shadow said, “He hopes to participate in this weapons exhibition.”","Nie Qingru immediately looked at him. Then, she looked away as if she had expected this. “You told him Qiao Nian is here?”","Shadow was a little terrified. He pursed his lips and said with difficulty, “I think Young Master Qi really... has no desire to live. That’s why...”","He immediately apologized to the woman sitting behind the desk. “Empress, I didn’t ask for your permission. Please punish me! I’m willing to accept any punishment.”","“That’s enough.” Nie Qingru waved her hand indifferently. “Even if you didn’t say it, I’d still have told him.”","Shadow was confused."]},{"number":3236,"title":"Chapter 3236: The Old Demonic Woman Invited a Heavyweight This Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 3236: The Old Demonic Woman Invited a Heavyweight This Time","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qingru glanced at his puzzled expression and chuckled softly. “He’s the heir I’ve nurtured for thirty years. How can I give up on him so easily? Now that the opportunity is in front of him, as long as he can amaze the world at this weapon exhibition, he still has a chance to make a comeback...","“Although I’m the Empress of the reclusive families and have supreme power and status, it concerns the interests of hundreds of families below me. Even I can’t make the decision alone. If he wants to sit in my position in the future, he needs the approval of those old things in the Privy Council!”","A layer of worry enveloped Nie Qingru. “Can’t you tell? The neutral archbishop has already quietly changed his position. I think that sly old fox wants to support Qiao Nian! He probably already knows about my relationship with her. According to the rules, that bastard child can also sit in my position...”","This was something she absolutely could not allow.","Therefore, Nie Qingru had been thinking about how to completely destroy the archbishop’s wishful thinking and firmly grasp the position of successor in her hands.","“Oh, right.” Nie Qingru suddenly remembered, and her expression became serious and anxious. “I heard that Mr. Auburn’s plane is arriving soon?”","Shadow raised his watch and looked at the time. “There’s still an hour.”","Nie Qingru’s brows relaxed, and a determined glint appeared in her eyes. She immediately instructed him, “Get Qixing to prepare. I’m taking him to see Mr. Auburn.”","Shadow was stunned, but he did not take action immediately.","Nie Qingru looked at him as if everything was under her control. “Why do you think I asked you to visit him in the sanatorium this morning? I knew you would tell him about Qiao Nian’s arrival in Continent M.","“As long as he knows that Qiao Nian is here, he won’t let himself continue being dispirited. I originally planned to bring him to see Mr. Auburn. Everything was planned!”","Mr. Auburn was the most authoritative judge in this weapons exhibition!","This was because he was an experienced weaponsmith. Ji Qing and Xie Tingyun had learned a lot from him.","Nie Qingru had long wanted Nie Qixing to get to know such a person.","If Nie Qixing could get some pointers from him, his future achievements would be immeasurable!","Of course, Nie Qingru could not wait and was also very nervous about this matter.","Shadow returned to his senses and immediately said, “I’ll contact Young Master Qi and ask him to pack up.”","“Alright.” Nie Qingru waved her hand and ordered, “Go there yourself. Make sure he stays alert.”","This was a rare opportunity, and Nie Qingru did not want to miss it. Before Shadow left, she stopped him and strategically said, “Remember to suppress the news that Mr. Auburn is the judge of this weapons exhibition. Don’t let the others know. We’ll talk about everything after Qixing meets Mr. Auburn!”","She was trying her best to pave the way for Nie Qixing.","Shadow received her order and hurried to do it.","At the same time.","Qiao Nian had just entered her hotel room. She threw her black shoulder bag on the bed and dragged a chair to sit down. She was prepared to take a cold shower after resting for a while.","She took out her cell phone and looked down to see a new message.","It was from Guan Yan.","Qiao Nian opened it casually.","[Guan Yan: I heard Mr. Auburn was invited to the weapons exhibition this time. Tsk, this old witch still has some connections. She even invited Auburn!]"]},{"number":3237,"title":"Chapter 3237: Sister Nian: I’m Not Prepared","paragraphs":["Chapter 3237: Sister Nian: I’m Not Prepared","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian held her cell phone in one hand and a water bottle in the other. She leaned against the chair and unhurriedly took a sip of water before her gaze landed on the screen again.","Guan Yan’s next message was still about Mr. Auburn.","The girl’s eyebrows were quite low. Her eyelashes covered her long and narrow eyes, making her look a little casual. Her bangs were lowered as if she was thinking about something.","Guan Yan’s message came again.","[Guan Yan: The old witch is even using Mr. Auburn as her backing now. Sun, do you have a plan?]","Qiao Nian saw another new message pop up on the slightly lit screen and finally replied lazily.","Extremely concise.","Extremely arrogant.","[Q: No.]","At a certain pier in Harbor City.","The dark clouds rolled up waves of thunder, and dark tides surged on the dark sea surface. From time to time, tempestuous waves would hit the deck.","The guests hid in their cabins, afraid they would be swept away by the waves.","Only a delicate woman leaned against the railing with no intention of hiding.","She had beautiful chestnut curly hair. From afar, her fair skin posed a stark contrast to the waves occasionally rising on the deck.","It was so beautiful that it made one’s heart tremble!","Some people hiding in the cabin noticed someone on the deck. A few men noticed her astonishing beauty.","They looked at each other.","Some of them rubbed their palms together and prepared to leave their cabins to chat with her.","“Beautiful...” One of the men was about to say ‘lady’.","Then, a black muzzle was pointed at his head. The burly quickly noticed there was someone else on the deck. He was wearing a black shirt and black pants. Only his chest had an eye-catching logo with an S on it.","The 1.8-meter-tall man’s legs went limp when he saw the red S mark.","He trembled and said, “Diamond, diamond big boss...”","This Harbor City was close to Continent F and belonged to a small area. Many people from many continents sold goods here.","However, this lawless place had its own rules.","For example: don’t mess with people wearing the S logo!","This was because these people represented the diamond big boss of Continent F and the forces of the illegal Red Alliance!","He never expected the beautiful woman on the deck to be related to the S Organization. The burly man was filled with regret.","With him as a precedent, the other men hiding in the cabin no longer dared to have any crooked thoughts. All of them were glad that they were not blinded by lust.","Otherwise, they would be the ones facing the muzzle now.","“Boss, what should we do with this person?” The people from the Red Alliance controlled the burly man who had run to the deck without permission and turned to ask the woman.","Guan Yan was still immersed in Qiao Nian’s natural and self-righteous response and didn’t say anything for a moment.","Fortunately, she noticed the uninvited guest on the deck. She reluctantly turned around and glanced at the burly man who was scared silly with her amorous almond-shaped eyes. She was too lazy to dirty her hands. “Let him go.”","The burly man couldn’t believe what he was hearing.","It was simply the sound of an angel.","He bit his tongue. “Th-thank you.”","Guan Yan ignored him and muttered, “Damn, she didn’t prepare anything? She should at least have a plan. No, I have to talk to her.”","The burly man could not understand what she was saying. He watched as Guan Yan played with her cell phone and sent a message.","10 minutes later.","Far away in Continent M’s hotel, Qiao Nian saw a certain someone’s long message on her phone after taking a cold shower."]},{"number":3238,"title":"Chapter 3238: Master Wang Has a Friend Coming to Continent M","paragraphs":["Chapter 3238: Master Wang Has a Friend Coming to Continent M","Editor: Atlas Studios","The general meaning was to explain how awesome Mr. Auburn was and not let her guard down.","Qiao Nian had just come out of the shower. Her hair was still wet and draped over her shoulders. She dragged a chair to the desk and sat down to look at Guan Yan’s message. Then, she placed her cell phone on the desk, grabbed the hairdryer, and dried her hair.","As she did that, the phone screen lit up again.","Qiao Nian glanced at it sideways and saw it was another message.","[Guan Yan: Big boss, are you listening to me?]","“...”","This perseverance!","The girl finally put down the hairdryer, picked up her cell phone again, and replied to her: [I’ll see!]","The last exclamation mark was the main point.","Guan Yan was typing again.","Qiao Nian wanted to blacklist her.","At that moment, the doorbell rang.","“Come in,” she replied casually as soon as she raised her eyes.","The doorbell was still ringing.","Qiao Nian frowned and paused before remembering she was staying in a hotel. The people outside could not enter without a room card.","Rubbing her temples, she got up and went to open the door.","Ye Wangchuan stood outside neatly dressed. He saw that her hair was wet and she was wearing a long T-shirt, exposing her two straight and fair legs.","His gaze paused for a moment, but he immediately retracted it gentlemanly and followed the girl into the room, closing the door behind him.","“Do you have any plans for later?”","“Hm?”","After Qiao Nian entered, she returned to the chair by the desk and sat down. She casually tied up her hair which was already 70-80% dry. Hearing this, she only raised her eyelids slightly.","“What’s the matter?”","“I want to introduce you to someone.”","Ye Wangchuan walked over and touched her hair ends. Realizing it was still a little wet, he dragged a chair over and grabbed the hairdryer. He naturally plugged it in and dried her hair again.","The wind from the hairdryer was warm and not uncomfortable.","Qiao Nian habitually raised her head slightly, narrowed her long and narrow eyes, and lazily asked, “You still have friends here?”","Ye Wangchuan’s fingers intertwined with the girl’s thick black hair. The corners of his mouth curled up slightly, and his eyes were filled with light. “He happened to be here for something, so he asked me out for a meal. I thought that if you didn’t have any arrangements, I would bring you to get to know him.”","“Mm,” Qiao Nian replied casually, feeling like she was about to fall asleep.","Ye Wangchuan relaxed his gentle hands and smiled gently. “Of course, I’ll introduce you as my girlfriend.”","Qiao Nian was originally sleepy from the warm wind of the hairdryer. Hearing this, a string in her head tightened and she opened her eyes.","“Done.”","At this moment, Ye Wangchuan finished drying her hair and tied it up clumsily. She barely looked the same as before.","Satisfied, he lowered his eyes and restrained his smile. “Then, Goddess Qiao, do you have time to meet him later?”","Qiao Nian thought about her following arrangements. There did not seem to be anything important in the afternoon. She supported her chin with her hand and nodded casually. “What time?”","Ye Wangchuan saw the fatigue in her eyes and could not bear to let her work too hard. However, his friend was very important. He hoped to introduce the two of them to each other. He could only say in a low voice, “Would now be alright?”","Qiao Nian was a little surprised. “Now?”","“Yes, his plane will be here soon.” Ye Wangchuan nodded helplessly."]},{"number":3239,"title":"Chapter 3239: Rejected Directly, And Said Nie Qixing Had a Stain","paragraphs":["Chapter 3239: Rejected Directly, And Said Nie Qixing Had a Stain","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian did not overthink. She picked up her baseball cap and put it on. “Wait a moment. I’ll change my clothes.”","**","An hour later.","A small private plane quietly landed in the airport terminal of Continent M.","The ground crew was already waiting. A car was specially parked beside the runway.","It could be said to be against the rules.","However, it could also be seen that the person’s identity was extraordinary.","Ten minutes later, the cabin door opened.","A group of people came down one after another. Among them was an old man in his seventies, with especially eye-catching white hair. His posture was straight, and he did not let anyone help him as he steadily walked down the stairs.","As for the large group getting off the plane with grandiosity, if one took a closer look, one would realize they were actually surrounding this old man.","Everyone’s attention was on the old man.","The white-haired old master steadily walked down the last step of the stairs. His assistant quickly walked over and carefully said, “Mr. Auburn, the car is ready.”","“Okay.”","The white-haired old man was about to get into the car.","At this moment, a woman in a light-colored sweater and knit top walked forward with a smile and blocked his path.","She smiled and said, “Grandpa, an elder asked me out for a meal. Do you have time? Why don’t you accompany me later?”","The white-haired old man immediately frowned. “Which elder?”","Daisy was a little embarrassed by his stern tone. She held his arm and shook it coquettishly. “A-Auntie Nie.”","Auntie Nie.","The white-haired old man immediately understood which Auntie Nie she was talking about. His gaze became sharp as he stared at the woman like a hook.","The people who got off the plane were still there. Daisy felt even more awkward and could only pretend not to see them. She continued to wave her hand and persuade him. “Auntie Nie has a younger brother who is also a physics scientist. It’s said that he’s young, promising, and very talented. I also want you to meet and get to know him...”","“Didn’t you see the recent news?” The old man in white did not buy it at all. Looking at her dumbfounded expression, he said indifferently, “I have my own principles and bottom line. I can’t meet such a tainted scientist, let alone know him.”","His words implied there was no room for negotiation.","Daisy was very embarrassed. She blushed and said in a low voice, “But I’ve already promised Auntie Nie!”","The Auburn family’s younger generation had many descendants, but she was the youngest and the most favored. She had also grown up by Mr. Auburn’s side.","She was pampered like a pearl.","Daisy naturally thought that a meal was not a big deal. As long as she acted coquettishly, there was no reason for her grandfather to disagree and insist on embarrassing her.","“I’ve already agreed to Auntie Nie.” She ignored the people still around and said anxiously with a red face, “If you don’t go, I’ll be very embarrassed.”","Unfortunately, she did not get what she wanted this time. The white-haired old man only glanced at her pouting expression and said frankly, “That’s because you rashly agreed without asking my opinion. You’ll have to bear the consequences. Besides, even if I’m willing to meet a tainted scientist, I don’t have the time...”","His granddaughter raised her eyes in confusion. “Why?”","Auburn said, “Because I already have an appointment with someone else.”","When the two of them spoke, there were other people around."]},{"number":3240,"title":"Chapter 3240: I Only Knew At the Last Moment That Mr. Auburn Had a Date","paragraphs":["Chapter 3240: I Only Knew At the Last Moment That Mr. Auburn Had a Date","Editor: Atlas Studios","At this moment, everyone revealed shocked expressions. They could not believe that this master had said this. It had to be known that Mr. Auburn rarely participated in private social engagements, let alone make appointments.","Daisy’s reaction was the same. “You have an appointment with someone else? When? Why didn’t I know about this? I...”","“Take care of what you promised first.”","She wanted to say that she wanted to go too, but she was seen through by her grandfather.","Daisy stomped her foot in displeasure. She had originally wanted to matchmake a dinner party, but in the end, she had been left to eat alone. However, there was nothing she could do about it!","After all, she was a descendant of a famous person. Even if she was used to being noble, was it not all given by him?","She was not stupid enough to make her grandfather unhappy because of someone else.","Daisy could only accept it. “Alright then.”","**","“What? Mr. Auburn isn’t coming?” Nie Qingru had already received the news in the departing car, and her expression suddenly darkened.","Pressure filled the car.","The chauffeur only focused on driving and did not dare to say anything. He only heard the Empress’s low and anxious voice coming from the backseat.","“Didn’t we agree that Mr. Auburn would come? I’ve already set off. Why are you only now telling me that he won’t come? What’s going on?”","The person in charge of contacting her also had a headache. He carefully explained the reason, “Mr. Auburn has a last-minute appointment. Miss Daisy pleaded with him, but Mr. Auburn didn’t change his mind and went to the appointment. So...”","“He has an appointment?” Nie Qingru grasped the main point and asked the most important question, “With who?”","Not many people knew she had invited this big shot to the weapons exhibition. It could be said she had suppressed this news well.","Under such circumstances, no one could contact the Auburn family and Mr. Auburn faster than her.","However, it was such a scheme.","She was intercepted by someone.","“I don’t know.","“Mr. Auburn didn’t say.","“Furthermore, this is his private itinerary. Only his closest assistant knows where he’s going and who he’s meeting. Even his granddaughter, Miss Daisy, doesn’t know!”","Nie Qingru could not help but feel irritated. “So secretive?”","“Mr. Auburn values this appointment very much.” These words poked at her lungs, making her uncomfortable everywhere.","Thankfully, the person added, “Although Mr. Auburn can’t go, Miss Daisy will. Miss Daisy is Mr. Auburn’s favorite granddaughter...”","Nie Qingru narrowed her eyes slightly. She knew what the other party was hinting at.","Daisy’s age was very suitable, and she was not married yet.","Coincidentally, Nie Qixing was also not married yet.","Originally, she wanted to choose a suitable candidate. It would be best if the woman could help him and he also liked her. But now... Nie Qingru had no choice but to consider an arranged marriage.","“Let’s see.”","She wanted to rope in this person with incredible power.","However, this Daisy was nothing special.","Without her family background, Nie Qingru looked down on her.","The person on the other end was afraid of her identity, so he naturally did not dare to say anything about Nie Qixing. He hung up after saying a few more words.","Nie Qingru lost most of her interest in the upcoming dinner when she found out that Auburn was not going. She only wanted to get to know Mr. Auburn.","She called the sanatorium and confirmed whether Nie Qixing and Shadow had set off.","Then, she leaned back on the leather sofa and closed her eyes to rest."]},{"number":3241,"title":"Chapter 3241: Slap in the Face, Thank You, Uncle Nie","paragraphs":["Chapter 3241: Slap in the Face, Thank You, Uncle Nie","Editor: Atlas Studios","The black car quickly slid into the entrance of the clubhouse.","This clubhouse had extremely high standards, so the service quality was naturally top-notch. The valet was already prepared as soon as their car entered the clubhouse.","The chauffeur saw the valet outside and stopped the car steadily. He turned around and said softly to the person in the back row, “Empress, we’re here.”","“Yes.” Nie Qingru opened her eyes, sharp as hooks, with no traces of sleepiness. Looking sideways at the clubhouse staff outside, she asked, “How long will they take?”","The chauffeur carefully asked, “You mean Young Master Qi?”","Nie Qingru did not even bother to respond this time.","If she was not talking about Qixing and the others, who else could she be talking about?","The chauffeur also realized that he had asked a stupid question. A layer of cold sweat appeared on his forehead. He quickly wiped his sweat and softly said, “Young Master Qi set off half an hour earlier than us. According to the distance, they should be arriving soon.”","Nie Qingru took her cell phone from her bag, searched for a number, and clicked on it.","The call went through, and a cheerful voice came from the other end. “Auntie Nie.”","Nie Qing’s tense face finally relaxed, and her tone became much gentler. “I’ve already arrived. Where are you? When will you arrive?”","...","At this moment, a low-key black car slowly drove in and stopped more than 10 meters in front of them.","Right on the heels of that, a man and a woman got out of the car. The man casually threw the car keys to the valet and turned to say something to the girl. The girl looked up lazily and said something in response.","The chauffeur was far away, and their windows were tightly shut, blocking out most of the sounds outside, so he did not hear what they said.","He saw the two of them walk into the clubhouse together.","Soon, their back views disappeared.","“Where did these Asians come from?” The chauffeur could not help but mutter softly.","He was not loud.","However, it was still very easy to hear in the sealed space.","Nie Qingru heard him. She looked through the car window and only saw the brilliant lights at the entrance. There was no one there.","She frowned but did not overthink. At this moment, another car slowly stopped in front of them.","She fixed her gaze on the person getting out of the car and said absent-mindedly to Daisy, “Then I’ll tell someone to pick you up outside later.”","“You haven’t seen Qixing, have you?” Nie Qingru stared straight at the young man in the wheelchair in front of her.","Nie Qixing’s dispiritedness disappeared ever since he found out that Qiao Nian had landed in Continent M. He shaved his beard, trimmed his hair, and changed into clean clothes. He was much more energetic.","Unfortunately, he was sitting in a wheelchair with a strange black blindfold covering one eye. It was very gloomy.","Nie Qingru watched Shadow get out of the car and push the wheelchair into the club.","She retracted her gaze and said in a haughty tone, “I’ll get him to come out and receive you later. I can introduce you guys.”","Daisy didn’t catch the underlying meaning in her words and thought it was normal social etiquette. Hence, she happily said, “I’ll have to thank Uncle Nie then.”","The words ‘Uncle Nie’ slapped Nie Qingru in the face.","Her face immediately turned a little green, and she spaced out momentarily. The corners of her mouth twitched, and she reluctantly said, “He’s about the same age as you. There’s no need to call him uncle.”"]},{"number":3242,"title":"Chapter 3242: The Two of You Were Not in the Hotel Room At the Same Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 3242: The Two of You Were Not in the Hotel Room At the Same Time","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, Daisy insisted on addressing her elders according to seniority.","Nie Qingru exchanged a few words with her before hanging up angrily. She put down her phone, her expression ugly.","The chauffeur did not dare to breathe loudly.","He only heard her suppressed disdain. “If Qixing hadn’t become like this...”","If Qixing had not become like this, with the heir she had nurtured for 30 years, how could a girl from the Auburn family be worthy of him?!","Nie Qingru suppressed the anger in her heart, opened the door, and got out of the car. Accompanied by the chauffeur, she entered the clubhouse.","“Hello, may I know which private room you’ve reserved?” a staff member asked politely as soon as they entered.","The chauffeur stopped and gave the name of a private room.","The staff member immediately stretched out his hand in a direction. “Please follow me.”","Nie Qingru had been wearing sunglasses and a wide hat the entire time. She covered herself tightly and did not say a word to the staff.","This time, she thought that she could invite Mr. Auburn. For the sake of this big shot, she did not hesitate to book the best private room in the club.","In the end, things didn’t go as planned. Mr. Auburn had a prior appointment, and she had wasted a good private room.","She was not in a good mood now, so she naturally could not be bothered with the ordinary staff.","**","At the same time, in another room.","Qiao Nian had just sat down.","Ye Wangchuan poured her a cup of hot tea and stood up. “I’ll go see if they are here.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian had no objections. She picked up her teacup and took a sip.","Ye Wangchuan went out to have a look.","Qiao Nian had nothing to do in the private room alone, so she took out her cell phone, intending to play a game.","However, just as she clicked on the game icon, she received a call from Master Cheng.","She could only close the game and answer Master Cheng’s call. “Hello.”","The private room was relatively empty, and their voices would be infinitely magnified.","Master Cheng did not seem to notice. He said strangely, “Aren’t you in your room? I just knocked on your door, but no one responded.”","Qiao Nian paused. “I’m out.”","“No wonder.” Master Cheng sighed. “Did you go out with Young Master Ye?”","Probably afraid that Qiao Nian would misunderstand, he quickly added, “I was looking for you guys. I went to your room first and knocked on the door, but there was no one. Then, I went to his room and knocked...”","In the end, he ‘coincidentally’ discovered that the two of them were not in the hotel rooms.","He looked for Qin Si. Qin Si was in the hotel, but he did not know they had gone out, let alone where they went.","Only then did Master Cheng call her.","Qiao Nian keenly caught the main points. She poured herself another cup of tea, leaned back slightly, and lazily asked, “Why did you call me?”","“It’s not a big deal...” Although Master Cheng said that, he was actually very anxious and concerned. “I heard some news, but I’m not sure... It said that Mr. Auburn will be attending this weapons exhibition. His plane has already landed. I want to know if this news is reliable.”","This time, Qiao Nian answered quickly, “... Yes.”","Master Cheng was extremely excited. “Mr. Auburn is really here? Has his plane arrived? Which hotel is he staying in? Is he staying with us or...”","Qiao Nian placed her hand on the table and tapped it. She thought before saying, “I don’t know about this. I only know that he will come. If you need the information, I can check.”"]},{"number":3243,"title":"Chapter 3243: Sister Nian Finally Meets Master Wang’s Friend","paragraphs":["Chapter 3243: Sister Nian Finally Meets Master Wang’s Friend","Editor: Atlas Studios","“However...” Her tone changed. Just as she narrowed her eyes and was about to say that ‘someone’ might be able to contact Mr. Auburn faster than them...","The door to the private room opened and some people entered the room.","One of them was Ye Wangchuan, accompanied by a white-haired old man. The old man looked exceptionally energetic, dressed in a modified Tang suit.","At the back was a person who looked much like an assistant.","The three of them entered.","Both parties were surprised.","Qiao Nian was surprised to see a white-haired old man.","Auburn and the others were surprised to see a young girl in the private room.","“However, what?","“Nian Nian, why aren’t you saying anything?","“By the way, let me tell you about Mr. Auburn’s characteristics. Or I can send you a photo. Otherwise, it won’t be easy for you to investigate.”","Master Cheng did not know the situation and was still talking to Qiao Nian on the phone.","Qiao Nian came back to her senses and lowered her eyes. She said in a low voice, “No need.”","She had already seen him in person.","Master Cheng still did not understand what she meant. “Don’t need what? Don’t need to talk about characteristics or don’t need photos? Where are you? Why don’t we meet?”","Qiao Nian listened to his impatient tone and saw that Ye Wangchuan had started to arrange seats. She could only rub her temples and say to Master Cheng in a muffled tone, “I’ll tell you when I return.”","**","They were in different private rooms in the same place.","Nie Qingru, on the other hand, felt like she was in a world of ice and fire.","The meticulously prepared dishes were all served, and their dazzling array filled the table. However, Daisy was very picky and barely touched the food. She even bluntly expressed that the dishes were not to her liking. They were too bland for her and were not her usual taste.","Nie Qingru was furious, but she still had to sit in her seat with a fake smile and listen to the ridiculous words of a youth knowing no fear.","This was not the most infuriating thing.","What infuriated her the most was that not only was Daisy extremely picky about her food, but she also said heart-wrenching words from time to time.","For example, they were just about to be done with her food.","Daisy’s bright eyes turned to the quiet Nie Qixing sitting beside her. Suddenly, she pointed at the eye patch and asked curiously, “Uncle Nie, is this... performance art?”","Nie Qixing’s body stiffened. The place where she pointed at him felt like it was on fire. It almost made his soul tremble.","However, the curious Daisy wasn’t done yet. She even explained with a smile, “I think this kind of outfit is very popular in Continent O. What’s it called? Locke style!","“The street artists love to perform these things. It’s called performance art.","“Are you also imitating this style?” Not only was she curious, but she also wanted to touch the eye patch.","Nie Qingru, who had been enduring for two whole hours, went completely cold. She slammed her knife and fork on the table, making a “bam” sound, suddenly interrupting Daisy.","Daisy jumped in fright and subconsciously looked at her, her expression one of confusion.","The muscles on Nie Qingru’s face twitched, but she forced herself to smile stiffly and said coldly, “His eye is injured.”","However, he did not specify how badly injured he was or why he needed to wear an eye patch.","Nie Qingru did not know if she was really naive or just pretending to be naive. Daisy took an exaggerated breath and immediately looked at Nie Qixing with sympathy. “So this isn’t performance art?”"]},{"number":3244,"title":"Chapter 3244: Direct Confrontation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3244: Direct Confrontation","Editor: Atlas Studios","If it weren’t for Master Auburn, Nie Qingru would have crushed this girl to death without hesitation just based on what she said. However, for Nie Qixing’s sake, she endured it with all her might. “Does your Auburn family like this kind of performance art?”","This question was very sharp.","Daisy immediately retracted her gaze and shook her head frankly. “No, we don’t.”","Nie Qingru’s temples throbbed fiercely again. Afraid she would be angered to death, she stood up and said to the two of them, “I’m going out to wash my hands.”","With Shadow in the room, Nie Qingru felt more at ease leaving.","After leaving the private room, she felt like she had breathed fresh air. Her expression softened slightly, but her mood was not much better.","She had originally wanted to matchmake them, but based on Daisy’s performance tonight, she had given up on that idea.","This Daisy was indeed Mr. Auburn’s favorite granddaughter. However, Nie Qingru’s evaluation of her at this moment was not only mediocre, but there was also a hint of disgust, blindness, and low EQ.","She wanted to find a powerful ally for Nie Qixing.","But this Daisy...","As Nie Qingru walked towards the washroom, deep in thought about how to get Nie Qixing close to Mr. Auburn through Daisy, she bumped into someone.","“I’m sorry.” The other party dodged quickly and spoke in a low and hoarse voice.","However, Nie Qingru was very familiar with this voice. She looked at the person and saw a face she had been dreaming about recently.","“Qiao Nian?”","Nie Qingru did not expect to bump into her here. Her already bad mood was instantly covered in a layer of gloom.","Especially when she saw the girl’s face that looked a little similar to someone else’s, disgust surged from the bottom of her heart, and she had the urge to strangle her.","“Why are you here?” Since she did not like it, Nie Qingru’s tone was also bad.","She spoke in a high and mighty tone, as if this was her territory and Qiao Nian needed her permission to be there.","Since she was so tactless, the girl had no intention of spoiling her.","After seeing clearly who she had bumped into, the girl only raised her eyebrows in surprise. Then, her gaze turned calm. “I can go wherever I want. In addition, since I’ve already come to Continent M, there will be many accidental encounters like this in the future.” Her tone was slightly raised, full of arrogance and carelessness. “If there’s no need, I hope the Empress can pretend not to see me. Don’t greet me, lest others misunderstand.”","Actually, it would have been better if she had not said this. Nie Qingru had originally thought so and did not want anyone to know about their relationship.","However, Nie Qingru’s face darkened since Qiao Nian was the one who said this. She gritted her teeth and reminded her, “I’m your grandmother!”","However, the girl only picked her ears and glanced at her impatiently. “Keep your voice down. Be careful not to be heard.”","People were indeed passing by here. If one was not careful, they would be heard.","However, Nie Qingru did not feel like she was being cared for. There was only a strong sense of... provocation.","She was the one who should be conscious about being associated with someone like Qiao Nian.","She had not even brought that up.","And Qiao Nian had the audacity!","“Let’s part here.” Before she could figure it out, the girl waved her hand and left without looking back."]},{"number":3245,"title":"Chapter 3245: Eh, Isn’t That My Grandpa’s Car?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3245: Eh, Isn’t That My Grandpa’s Car?","Editor: Atlas Studios","This arrogant and despotic attitude.","Nie Qingru was so angry that her face turned ashen. After a long time, she tidied her shawl and returned to the private room with a tense expression.","She was distracted for the next half hour, barely speaking.","Daisy was a genius at chatting, yet she couldn’t get Nie Qixing and Shadow to speak with her.","Soon, the room’s mood became gloomy.","Feeling bored, Daisy took the initiative to say, “Auntie Nie, I’m full. Why don’t we go back?”","After all, she was from a big family and still had basic social etiquette.","Without waiting for Nie Qingru to speak, she added awkwardly, “I just got off the plane and still have a lot of luggage left in the hotel. I want to go back and unpack it.”","Nie Qingru was uncomfortable the entire time, so she got up, picked up her bag, and told Shadow, “Go get the car.”","“Yes, Your Majesty.”","Shadow immediately got up and pushed the door open.","Seeing this scene, Daisy’s bright eyes blinked. She tilted her head in Nie Qingru’s direction and took the initiative to suggest, “I see that Uncle Nie’s movements are inconvenient, so I might as well wheel you.”","Nie Qixing hated it the most when someone mentioned his current disability. He immediately rejected her with a cold face. “No need. I can do it myself!”","Daisy pursed her lips and no longer offered to help.","At this moment, Nie Qingru broke the stiff atmosphere. “Let’s go.”","Nie Qixing quietly pushed the wheelchair and followed. Daisy followed behind him, looking left and right. Anyway, Nie Qixing did not want her help, so she was happy and relaxed.","Soon, they arrived at the clubhouse’s entrance and waited for the chauffeur to return with the car.","Nie Qingru was about to get into the car.","At this moment, Daisy, who had finally managed to shut up, seemed to have suddenly realized something. She pointed at a black car parked not far away and casually said, “Strange, isn’t that my grandpa’s car?”","Nie Qingru stopped and immediately looked over. “That’s Mr. Auburn’s car? Are you sure?”","Daisy turned around and saw her narrowed eyes. She looked at the license plate and nodded. “That’s my grandpa’s car.","“He said he had an appointment with a friend. So he’s here too?”","Nie Qingru did not expect this. After thinking for a short while, she immediately closed the car door and made a prompt decision. “Since Mr. Auburn is here, we should greet him before leaving.”","To put it bluntly, she did not want this trip to be a waste!","After all, Daisy had said a lot of stupid things that angered her. If she went back just like that, she would not be glad.","“Go ask the staff which private room Mr. Auburn is in.” Nie Qingru turned around and instructed Nie Qixing, who was sitting in a wheelchair.","Then she turned her head.","She revealed a rare smile and took the initiative to rope Daisy in. “Daisy, call Mr. Auburn to see if it’s convenient for him. I’ll pay him a visit.”","**","At this moment, the meal in the private room of the clubhouse was coming to an end.","Compared to Nie Qingru and the others, who had a dull and aggrieved meal, the mood in Auburn’s private room was comfortable and happy.","The meal lasted nearly three hours.","Other than Qiao Nian who went out to wash her hands halfway, Auburn chatted with Ye Wangchuan the entire time.","When Qiao Nian returned, Auburn heard she had stayed at the First Research Institute on the independent continent and knew Feng Yu. She was Feng Yu’s chosen successor. He was even more interested and asked her many questions about research topics."]},{"number":3246,"title":"Chapter 3246: The Person They Wanted to Meet Was Having a Meal With Sister Nian’s","paragraphs":["Chapter 3246: The Person They Wanted to Meet Was Having a Meal With Sister Nian’s","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian was good at these things, so her answer was neither too advanced nor simplistic. Basically, as long as he asked a question, she could answer it.","Auburn was amazed by her talent and could be said to be extremely fond of her.","At the end of the meal, he took the initiative to ask for Qiao Nian’s contact number without Ye Wangchuan asking.","He even said he would be staying in Continent M for a while. Qiao Nian could talk to him about black gunpowder research at any time.","The guests and hosts enjoyed the meal and prepared to leave.","“Sir, be careful.” Mr. Auburn’s assistant carefully helped him up.","Mr. Auburn was very energetic. He waved him away and did not let him help. Instead, he looked at the girl who had also stood up and put on her baseball cap. “By the way, the photon theory you just proposed...”","Qiao Nian looked at him. “Huh?”","Mr. Auburn looked at her familiar face and was distracted for a moment. He thought of someone, and a trace of pity flashed across his eyes.","However, he quickly composed himself and was about to continue. “It’s the photon technology you mentioned before you went to the washroom...”","Halfway through his sentence, his cell phone rang.","Mr. Auburn frowned and had no choice but to stop the conversation. He found his cell phone and looked at the caller ID. It was Daisy.","Even though he was frowning, he still gave the girl a look that said, “Sorry, I’ll take this call first.” Then, he pursed his lips and accepted the call.","It was unknown what the other party said.","Qiao Nian only heard his suppressed displeasure. “Now? You’ve already asked someone to check the private room? Didn’t I tell you... Forget it!”","Ye Wangchuan had just entered when he saw the white-haired old man hanging up the phone with a sullen expression. He seemed to be very angry. “What happened?”","Mr. Auburn calmed down and looked at him apologetically. “My immature granddaughter saw my car and insisted on coming to look for me.”","“It’s fine. Just let her come.” Ye Wangchuan’s eyebrows relaxed.","The white-haired old man shook his head. “It’d be fine if she was alone, but she’s someone. That person...”","He recalled that the reclusive families had tried their best to contact him as soon as he got off the plane. They wanted to introduce him to the so-called youngest scientist in Country M. He could not hide his annoyance.","He did not want to see a tainted scientist at all!","However, the other party had already come knocking on his door. He could not disrespect them.","Auburn understood this and looked at Ye Wangchuan and Qiao Nian. “You guys leave first. I’ll stay and meet them.”","Ye Wangchuan could almost guess who the other party was. He narrowed his eyes and looked in the girl’s direction.","The girl lowered her eyes and casually pulled down the brim of her cap before putting her hand in her pocket, as if she was not interested.","Ye Wangchuan smiled and said to the white-haired old man, “Alright, we won’t disturb you anymore.”","“Mm.” Mr. Auburn nodded and hesitated. “It’s not that it’s inconvenient for me to introduce you to them, but it’s best if you don’t see this person.”","“Understood.” Ye Wangchuan’s every word and action exuded the etiquette and elegance that a noble should have.","Seeing that he really did not take it to heart, Mr. Auburn heaved a sigh of relief. Then, he turned to the girl and said, “Then Miss Qiao, I’ll ask you out when I have time.”","“Okay.”","Qiao Nian agreed readily."]},{"number":3247,"title":"Chapter 3247: Qiao Nian, Don’t You Want to Apologize to Me?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3247: Qiao Nian, Don’t You Want to Apologize to Me?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan reached out to her, his fingers slender. “Let’s go.”","What... did he mean?","Qiao Nian glanced at the hand in front of her. After a pause, her hand slowly came out of her pocket.","Ye Wangchuan clenched his fist and held her hand tightly. He said a few more words to the white-haired old man before leaving with her.","**","Outside.","Qiao Nian walked out and bumped into Nie Qingru and the rest.","Nie Qingru’s face fell and her expression turned ugly. Even her footsteps slowed down.","Shadow, on the other hand, was extremely vigilant. He did not expect Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan to appear here.","As for Nie Qixing, his face was pale. He grabbed the wheelchair’s armrests, his nails digging into them. His eyes wanted to pierce through the man and woman walking towards him.","Daisy sensed the change in the atmosphere. Her almond-shaped eyes noticed the people walking towards them. The moment she saw the man, she was momentarily dazed.","They were not far away from each other, and the pair reached them soon enough.","Nie Qingru pursed her lips and her eyes became even colder. She was ready to counterattack at any time.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Nian did not even stop. It was as if she did not see them as she walked past them...","Nie Qixing watched as she walked past him. His blood boiled, and the pain of the past few days constantly tormented him.","He could not help but turn around and shout angrily, “Qiao Nian, don’t you want to apologize to me?”","What he meant was that since Qiao Nian had long known about their relationship and even ruined him in Continent F, shouldn’t she be ashamed to see him again?","His voice was not soft.","After all, everyone was very close. There was no reason why they could not hear his loud shout.","However, the girl acted as if she did not hear anything. She did not stop for a second and walked away freely.","It was a huge slap to his face!","Walking at her side, Ye Wangchuan could naturally sense the girl’s attitude. He also left the line of sight of the group of people behind him without stopping.","They left the clubhouse.","Ye Wangchuan stopped and told Gu San to pick them up.","Then, he turned to the sloppy girl. “Why did you ignore them just now?”","Qiao Nian had forgotten about this. Hearing this, she slowly thought of an answer. “I... couldn’t be bothered.”","**","She couldn’t be bothered.","Nie Qixing was so agitated that he almost lost control. After watching their backs disappear, the veins on his forehead bulged. He said to Nie Qingru in a low voice, “Sister, I’m not feeling well. I want to go back and rest.”","“Hold on a little longer.” Of course, Nie Qingru was also angry at Qiao Nian’s attitude. However, they were about to see Mr. Auburn, so how could they allow Nie Qixing to return?","Nie Qixing looked up with a pale face and saw her dignified expression. He knew he had no room to refute, so he simply shut his mouth and did not say anything else.","Instead, the atmosphere between them was too strange. As an outsider, Daisy could not help but ask, “Do you know the person who just left?”","Nie Qingru frowned. “I don’t.”","Daisy was not stupid. How could she believe that they did not know each other? After all, Nie Qixing had agitatedly called out one of their names just now.","Qiao Nian?","She found it familiar but could not remember where she had heard this name before."]},{"number":3248,"title":"Chapter 3248: Only Announced That Nie Qixing Was Participating At The End","paragraphs":["Chapter 3248: Only Announced That Nie Qixing Was Participating At The End","Editor: Atlas Studios","Fortunately, Daisy did not insist on remembering where she had heard the name. She said casually, “They came from the same direction of my grandfather’s private room. I wonder if they were with him.”","As soon as she said this, not to mention Nie Qingru, even Nie Qixing and Shadow could not accept it.","Shadow said, “I don’t think so. They just happened to come from the same direction.”","Nie Qingru and Nie Qixing remained silent.","“Is that so?” Daisy tilted her head and thought for a moment before saying, “But yeah, they look quite young. My grandfather’s friend shouldn’t be that young.”","Yes, this should be a coincidence!","Nie Qingru’s expression softened. She did not want to pursue this topic any further. “Let’s go. Let’s not keep Mr. Auburn waiting for too long.”","She led the way.","The others tossed Daisy’s unintentional words to the back of their minds and followed.","**","The next day.","The various delegations in the hotel where the weapons exhibition was being held received the news that Mr. Auburn would participate as a judge.","Master Cheng immediately went to look for Qiao Nian.","It just so happened that Bo Zheng and Ye Wangchuan were also in Qiao Nian’s room.","With the three of them, the not-so-wide room felt a little cramped.","The girl was sitting on the sofa with her legs crossed, playing on the computer. A black baseball cap was at her side, and she looked extremely annoyed.","Master Cheng walked over and greeted Bo Zheng and the rest. “Why are you here? Why are you looking for Nian Nian so early?”","Ye Wang Chuan glanced at Bo Zheng with a faint smile.","Bo Zheng lowered his head and coughed. He covered his mouth with his fist and said, “I came to ask something.”","“Is the question related to Mr. Auburn?” Master Cheng immediately asked.","Bo Zheng nodded. “I received news that the Empress of the reclusive families met Mr. Auburn at the clubhouse yesterday. I thought about getting Miss Qiao to investigate it.”","Master Cheng’s reaction was huge. He immediately raised his voice. “What? They’ve already met in private?”","Bo Zheng looked at him in confusion and rubbed his eyebrows. “After all, Continent M is the reclusive families’ territory. As the host, it’s normal for them to meet in private.”","“I’m not worried about that.” Master Cheng was very worried. He told them the latest news he had heard. “You know Nie Qixing, right?”","Bo Zheng glanced at the girl playing with the computer and slowly replied, “I know.”","“He’s also participating in this weapons exhibition as a representative of Country M... Mr. Auburn is one of the judges this time. I’m afraid their purpose for meeting him is not simple.”","“He’s also participating?” Bo Zheng was a little surprised.","He did not know about this.","Master Cheng’s expression was solemn. “I didn’t expect it either... I should say that the other participants also didn’t expect this. He was clearly not on the Continent M’s delegation list before... However, the organizer explained that the previous list was wrong and the computer missed a name. In addition, their delegation was indeed missing a person. Since his addition allowed the delegation to meet the quota, everyone had nothing to say.”","In fact, the organizers were obviously covering up for Nie Qixing. Otherwise, with Nie Qixing’s recent reputation...","If he told everyone he would participate from the start, people would probably boycott this weapons exhibition from the beginning...","However, what was done was done. Everyone had already brought the items for the exhibition to Continent M. They couldn’t return just like that."]},{"number":3249,"title":"Chapter 3249: Sister Nian: Isn’t This Her Routine Operation?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3249: Sister Nian: Isn’t This Her Routine Operation?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Bo Zheng spat out as he rarely did, “Isn’t she being shameless?”","Qiao Nian raised her head. She leaned back casually and leisurely crossed her legs, then casually said, “You just found out?”","Bo Zheng instinctively looked at her.","The girl’s eyes were wild, and there seemed to be a light fog between her eyebrows. Her red lips curled up, and her words were quite ruthless. “Isn’t this what she’s best at?”","“Ahem.” Bo Zheng wanted to laugh but felt it was not appropriate. He felt uncomfortable holding it in, so he covered his mouth with his hand and coughed dryly.","Master Cheng could not smile. The corners of his eyes and brows were filled with worry about Nie Qingru’s violation. He paced the room and said, “If he’s seen Mr. Auburn and he’s going to participate in this weapons exhibition, I’m worried...","“The weapons exhibition depends on skill. No matter how powerful the reclusive families are, they can’t force others to agree!”","Qiao Nian injected Master Cheng with a shot of cardiotonic when he was upset. She sounded very confident.","At this moment, Ye Wangchuan also said, “Mr. Auburn won’t stand on his side. Don’t worry.”","Master Cheng looked at him suspiciously.","How did he know Mr. Auburn would not stand on Nie Qixing’s side? If Mr. Auburn was not biased toward Nie Qixing and the reclusive families, why would he meet those people?","However, he had always known how capable this person from Beijing was. Since Ye Wangchuan said that Auburn would not favor the people from Country M...","“Alright then.” Although Master Cheng was unsure of the twists and turns, he still reluctantly believed it.","**","Over the next two days, delegations from all regions checked into the hotel one after another.","As more and more people arrived, the hotel became more and more lively.","In the cafeteria, one could see all kinds of faces and hear all kinds of languages.","For the past two days, Qiao Nian mainly followed Master Cheng to pick up the model of the Tsar and carry out the final inspection and adjustment work.","Ye Wangchuan was also very busy going to various places. Gu San went along.","Qiao Nian did not see him during the day and would only see him return at night.","During this period, Qiao Nian received a call from Mr. Auburn inviting her to eat together, but she declined.","She devoted herself to the Tsar’s model data.","Some time passed.","In the blink of an eye, it was the 15th of August.","According to the rules, each delegation had a booth where they could show off their high-end weapons in 3D models and simulated animations.","For convenience, the exhibition was held in the hotel’s exhibition hall.","Due to the large number of teams, many of the zones were right next to each other.","A few steps separated the team’s booths.","The last time Beijing participated in the weapons exhibition was 10 years ago. Their results were not ideal, so the position they were given this time was especially bad.","They were given the third-worst spot.","Of course, this weapons exhibition would attract more attention at the front.","By the time the visitors reached the last few stalls, they were already tired of looking at them.","If the last few seats could not produce anything eye-catching, it was almost impossible to win the judges’ favor.","In fact, weapons of the same level placed in front might get an A or B. When placed at the end, they would only get a B or C.","Although this rule was unfair, Beijing had not produced good results previously.","Master Cheng had no objections to this arrangement."]},{"number":3250,"title":"Chapter 3250: With Sister Nian Around, He Would Always Be Worried","paragraphs":["Chapter 3250: With Sister Nian Around, He Would Always Be Worried","Editor: Atlas Studios","Master Cheng got up at seven in the morning for the 10 a.m. exhibition.","Master Cheng did not even have time to eat breakfast. He quickly brought a group from the Ninth Branch to do a final check.","...","8:30 a.m.","Nie Qixing was also ready to set off.","Continent M was the reclusive families’ territory. He could enjoy preferential treatment, different from Master Cheng and the others. For example, he did not stay in a hotel that all the participants had to stay in because of his health. Instead, he stayed in a private sanatorium.","Although it was said to be a private sanatorium, Nie Qingru had reserved all the rooms and the sanatorium served him alone.","His teammates saw this unfair treatment but were powerless to criticize.","“Young Master Qi.” Zhou Zheng had been called over by Nie Qingru from Country M to accompany him.","“Shoot.”","In a wheelchair, Nie Qixing’s pale face was still covered by an eye mask. The black eye mask seemed to cut his face into two, making him look extremely sinister.","Zhou Zheng had been careful with him for the past two days, afraid of agitating his sensitive nerves. He only dared to whisper into his ear, “I’ve arranged for her to be near the sanatorium. You can see her anytime you want.”","Nie Qixing had secretly kept a woman in Country M behind Nie Qingru and Shadow’s back. Only Zhou Zheng knew about this.","This time, Nie Qixing was injured and had to stay in Country M to recuperate. Zhou Zheng was smart and naturally knew what he had to do.","As expected, Nie Qixing’s expression softened. He looked at him approvingly. “Why didn’t I know you were so smart before?”","Zhou Zheng did not dare to claim credit. He smiled apologetically and said, “I just wanted Young Master Qi to be happy. I didn’t think too much about it.”","“Okay,” Nie Qixing replied as if he had accepted his kindness. Then, he suddenly asked, “Is Mr. Auburn still unwilling to accept the gift?”","About this serious matter, Zhou Zheng did not dare to smile cheekily. He rubbed his face with a headache. “I’ve tried to send all kinds of gifts these two days, but Mr. Auburn’s assistant stopped me every time. I think he’s determined not to accept any gift... Young Master Qi, why don’t we forget about it?”","“This old thing!” Nie Qixing’s eyes spewed flames as he gripped the armrest of the wheelchair with all his might. “I’ve also contacted him many times. Heh! He really doesn’t give me face. He doesn’t even answer my calls.”","In fact, when Nie Qingru brought him to meet this legendary figure, the other party’s attitude towards him had been indifferent.","Although he had given Nie Qixing his contact number out of respect, his messages and calls were all like stones thrown into the sea.","Nie Qixing had no choice but to instruct Zhou Zheng to send him gifts, but that old man still refused to be persuaded!","This made him very angry.","After all, this old thing should know who his backer was, but he still treated him with this attitude.","Nie Qixing couldn’t help but think that the other party looked down on his current status as a cripple!","Crippled...","As soon as he remembered that he could not even walk normally, the blood vessels on his neck bulged, and his eyes became ferocious and terrifying.","Zhou Zheng was secretly shocked and quickly tried to smooth things over. “Young Master Qi, the weapons exhibition is coming soon anyway. It’s too late for us to see him now. Why don’t we wait until after the exhibition?”","Nie Qixing’s face was dark and he didn’t say anything, but his heart was in turmoil.","In the past, he might not have cared about this.","But this time was different.","Qiao Nian was like a bug.","He was worried an accident would happen at the weapons exhibition."]},{"number":3251,"title":"Chapter 3251: Continent F Gives Up Participating This Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 3251: Continent F Gives Up Participating This Time","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qixing narrowed his eyes as he thought of something and turned to Zhou Zheng.","“Y-Young Master Qi... This isn’t appropriate, right? Your sister didn’t agree either. If we hide it from her... I’m afraid...” Zhou Zheng was so frightened that his face turned pale.","Nie Qixing gripped the handle of the wheelchair and made up his mind. He said coldly, “I’ll bear all the consequences. Just do as I say!”","* * *","At the same time, in the hotel.","Qiao Nian was also up.","However, she was forcefully woken up by the alarm clock, and the back of her head was still buzzing.","As one of the delegation’s accompanying members, Qiao Nian was not considered a participant, so she wasn’t in a hurry to go to the exhibition hall.","Instead, she took a shower to clear her mind. Then, she dried her hair and tied it up. She casually picked up her baseball cap and put it on.","It was only nine o’clock when she finished tidying up and went out.","Out of her room, Qiao Nian bumped into Qin Si, Bo Zheng, and the others at the elevator.","Luo Qing greeted her casually, “Good morning, Miss Qiao.”","“Morning,” Qiao Nian replied casually, greeting Bo Zheng and Qin Si.","Qin Si immediately looked behind her and did not see a familiar figure. He shouted, “Sister Qiao, why aren’t you with Master Wang?”","“He went first to the exhibition hall with Master Cheng and the model.” Qiao Nian received a WeChat message from him when she woke up.","She put her hands in her pockets and leaned against the wall impatiently, waiting for the elevator to arrive.","She had long legs, to begin with, so as she leaned there leisurely with her hands in her pockets, she was as cool as could be. Qin Si was envious. “I say, big boss... can you stop exuding your charm?”","F*ck, she was so cool. Did she still leave room for them to exist?","Qiao Nian raised her head slightly and glanced at him with her black-and-white eyes. She didn’t quite understand what was going on. Her throat even moved slightly as she looked at him casually. “Hm?”","Qin Si wailed and raised his hands in surrender. “Forget I said anything!”","The elevator arrived just then.","Qiao Nian ignored him and turned to Bo Zheng and Luo Qing. “You guys are going to the exhibition hall too? Let’s go together.”","“Okay.” Bo Zheng’s eyes were filled with smiles. He shrugged and had no objections.","“Miss Qiao, let’s go.” Luo Qing entered the elevator and pressed the button to keep the doors open. He didn’t want the elevator doors to close before Qiao Nian entered.","Qiao Nian touched the bridge of her nose and was the third to enter.","Qin Si was left alone outside.","Luo Qing retracted his hand without giving him any face, not as enthusiastic towards him. “Little Young Master Qin, aren’t you coming in?”","“F*ck, just call me by my name. Can you not add the ‘little’ in front!” Qin Si cursed, but he entered the elevator anyway.","Luo Qing pressed the first-floor button and the elevator doors closed.","* * *","Many people were already gathered in the exhibition hall on the first floor.","It was no wonder so many people had come.","This weapons exhibition had the highest specifications in history and had the most participating countries. It included almost all the continents and oceans.","Only non-governmental areas like the illegal district and the independent continent did not participate. Those who could come from other areas came.","People from Continent F were also there.","However, they were not from Daji and the Dark Fort.","If the two major factions of Continent F did not come, it would not stand for much. The other participating regions completely treated them as cannon fodder.","They also came here to play, mainly to see if the other areas produced anything good."]},{"number":3252,"title":"Chapter 3252: Sister Nian: Alright, Let’s Wait and See!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3252: Sister Nian: Alright, Let’s Wait and See!","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian walked over with Bo Zheng and the rest and heard all kinds of voices.","Most of the discussions were about Nie Qixing.","“I heard that Country M’s representative has already met Mr. Auburn. Looks like there won’t be any suspense at this weapons exhibition.”","“Mr. Auburn shouldn’t be so unprincipled, right?”","“Tsk, haven’t you heard of the reclusive families? If you know the power behind Nie Qixing, you will understand why there’s almost no suspense in this exhibition.”","“That powerful?”","“Let’s put it this way. We’re all just foils. Only a fool would use this weapons exhibition as a place to compete.”","...","Other than Nie Qixing, there were also rare mentions of Beijing and Master Cheng.","“I heard that Beijing made a very advanced device this time. Master Cheng is not a nameless person. There’s still a competitor.”","“Beijing? You’re talking about China’s Beijing?” Someone immediately mocked. “Who doesn’t know Beijing’s standards? Forget it! They didn’t dare to participate in the past... This time, they’re just bragging. What good stuff can they bring out?”","Qin Si naturally heard them. His face darkened and he rolled up his sleeves, itching for a fight. “I’ll go talk to them.”","“Come back,” Qiao Nian called out softly.","Her voice wasn’t loud. However, Qin Si obediently stopped and looked at her.","The girl had not taken the noisy gossip to heart. She only said calmly, “Only useless people like to talk about others behind their backs.”","“...”","“Since they don’t have the ability, why do you have to argue with them?”","It was just two sentences.","Qin Si smiled and cursed, “Oh my god, Sister Qiao, you’ve hit the nail on the head!”","He was originally quite angry, but not so much right now.","However, they were already very close to the people who mocked Beijing behind their backs. Otherwise, they would not have heard their small talk.","They could hear them, so the other party naturally heard what they said.","Those who had mocked Beijing for bragging and Master Cheng for being unable to take out anything turned red and green. They were agitated, but since they had spoken behind others’ backs first, they didn’t have the moral high ground to confront Qiao Nian and the others.","However, they were clearly unhappy at being humiliated in public. One of them snorted and deliberately raised his voice in disdain. “What a joke! I can’t even speak the truth. Master Cheng was internationally famous when he was young, but who has heard of him in the past 20 years? I’m afraid he’s already exhausted his talents. He has to admit that he’s old!”","The smile that Qin Si had painstakingly raised instantly disappeared. Even Bo Zheng, who rarely got angry, glared at the man who spoke.","Back then, Master Cheng could have gone to a higher-level research institute overseas. However, for the sake of justice, he chose the Ninth Branch, which had just been established.","The Ninth Branch’s facilities and equipment were poor, greatly delaying Master Cheng’s research progress. But he never complained.","Later on, Ye Wangchuan gradually took over the Ninth Branch and gave them sufficient funds. Only then did the Ninth Branch flourish.","It could be said that Master Cheng had hidden his identity for decades for the Ninth Branch and Beijing’s sake.","This person’s mouth was too foul!","It was disgusting.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and finally looked at him seriously. Her gaze landed on the work tag on his chest. “Number 3, right? Let’s wait and see.”"]},{"number":3253,"title":"Chapter 3253: Sister Nian: Do You Want to Bet?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3253: Sister Nian: Do You Want to Bet?","Editor: Atlas Studios","The person who spoke was a short and fat man in glasses. He immediately pushed up his glasses and sneered. “Why? Do you want to fight? This is the exhibition hall, not a field in Beijing!”","Qiao Nian frowned slightly. She finally understood where Qin Si’s urge to beat him up came from. This person really deserved a beating!","This time, Qin Si was the one afraid she would be impulsive. He pulled the girl’s arm and said patiently, “Forget it, Sister Qiao. Ignore this idiot!”","The man from the science and engineering department heard Qin Si scold him and felt it was not enough. He deliberately raised his voice and said, “I’m an idiot? Then what are you?!","“What did your Beijing bring to this weapons exhibition that made you so arrogant?”","He rubbed his nose in it and sized up the nameplate on Qin Si’s chest. He snorted. “Oh, so it’s number 18.”","Qin Si glared at him.","The short fatty tilted his head and sneered at the person beside him. “I remember that only 20 delegations are participating in the weapons exhibition this time. This number is arranged according to previous years’ results, right?”","His colleagues couldn’t hold him back and could only reply awkwardly, “Yeah, I think so.”","“Tsk!”","The short fatty seemed to have caught hold of something. He turned to Qiao Nian and the others and mocked them. “In other words, your results have only been ranked third from the bottom?!","“Two delegations are participating for the first time, so they have no ranking. Strictly speaking, the third from the bottom is actually the last place.","“Haha, the last place is threatening me. Should I wait and see?”","The short fatty seemed to be deliberately targeting Qiao Nian. He mainly looked at her and did not hide his disdain. “Does Master Cheng know that you’re so arrogant?”","His facial expression was one of contempt. “Or has Beijing become so bad that you can only rely on talking harshly?”","“F*ck!” Qin Si’s handsome face was as dark as the bottom of a pot. He was furious.","Qiao Nian shielded him as if she did not notice the whispers and mocking gazes that fell on them.","“What are we betting?”","“What is it?”","The girl looked at the short fatty with dark eyes. Her red lips curled in a lazy arc, and her aura became cold. “You’ve said so much. If you lose to us, you’ll apologize for what you just said and give up participation in international competitions for three years. How about that?”","Three years—","This wasn’t too long or too short. It was enough for a person to fall into obscurity.","The short fatty did not expect her to suddenly suggest a bet. So many people were watching, and he was so confident. It seemed like he couldn’t afford to decline this time.","He stared at the girl with a dark expression. “What if you lose?”","“Up to you.” Qiao Nian smiled and raised her baseball cap, revealing her overly eye-catching and beautiful face. “But we won’t lose.”","As soon as she said this, the buzz of discussion around him became louder.","“Who is this person? Why is she so arrogant?”","“Li Xin’s team isn’t weak. They’ve always been in the top three. She took the initiative to propose a bet. If they lose later, they will cry.”","Qiao Nian did not seem to hear them. She looked straight at the short fatty who was hesitating. She raised her chin slightly and casually said, “Do you want to bet?”","Li Xin was considered a quarter Chinese biologically.","His grandfather had left Beijing. Later on, for various reasons, he stayed overseas most of the time and married a local, leaving behind a mixed-race child."]},{"number":3254,"title":"Chapter 3254: Only Use Your Strength to Give Them A Loud Slap","paragraphs":["Chapter 3254: Only Use Your Strength to Give Them A Loud Slap","Editor: Atlas Studios","Surprisingly, Li Xin looked more like his grandfather, retaining yellow skin and black hair despite having brown eyes.","He had been troubled by this since he was young. He felt that it was because of his appearance that he could not integrate into local life.","Even if he redoubled his efforts, he would only be able to reach this stage. He still did not have a chance to do much confidential research.","He attributed it to his appearance and hated people with the same physical characteristics.","Since Qiao Nian dared to bet with him, he did not care about being a gentleman and turned vicious. “I’ll bet. Why not?”","The surroundings were in an uproar.","No one expected that in just a few minutes, it would become a bet between third place and third from the bottom.","Li Xin wasn’t stupid. Or rather, he was too shrewd and afraid that he would be at a disadvantage. His tone changed and he immediately said, “But I want to change the bet. You’re not a scientist. Being unable to participate in international competitions for three years won’t be a loss to you.”","Qin Si rubbed his swollen temples and gave him a thumbs up. “You’re awesome!”","Qiao Nian wasn’t a scientist?","Who gave him the courage to say that?","Did the First Research Institute of the independent continent agree with that?","He was afraid that he would be at a disadvantage in this bet. He was really... ignorant!","Li Xin thought he had seen through his opponent and his opponent was now exasperated. Hence, he became even more confident. “If you lose, I request you to kneel in front of everyone and apologize to me! And admit that you people of Beijing are inferior to us!”","This request was too much.","Qiao Nian’s request was only targeted at him, while his request was obviously to humiliate the entire Beijing team, including Master Cheng...","The scientific research circle also emphasized the virtue of respecting the old and loving the young. Master Cheng had been famous for a long time and was considered an old senior. But he actually did not show any respect for him!","Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened and she agreed without hesitation. “Okay.”","* * *","Word about the bet spread, and people started catching wind of it.","Along the way, Qiao Nian and the others received many sympathetic gazes. Some teams close to them especially came over to show their concern and persuade them to forget about it.","They could just admit defeat and let this pass.","As a man, Li Xin was most likely embarrassed to make things difficult for a girl in front of so many people.","However, this time, from Qin Si to Bo Zheng, everyone in the Beijing team was unified. They wanted to fight Li Xin’s team to the end!","After a while, Master Cheng and the others returned.","With such a huge commotion, Master Cheng quickly heard about the bet. His eyes darkened, and he angrily said, “This Li Xin used to come to the Ninth Branch to exchange knowledge and learn. The photoelectric theory he launched not long ago was completed in cooperation with us. I didn’t expect him to turn hostile as soon as he left! What an ingrate.”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows disdainfully. “That’s normal. Some people look down on us and Beijing from the bottom of their hearts.”","Master Cheng’s heart sank.","Complicated feelings like anger, grievance, and discomfort that he was unable to release piled up in his chest, suffocating him.","Ye Wangchuan saw that he was angry and patted his shoulder. Then, he casually said, “It’s okay. They can think whatever they want. We just have to be ourselves. The best way to fight back against these people is to give them a resounding slap with absolute strength!”"]},{"number":3255,"title":"Chapter 3255: Of Course, They Will Lose for Sure","paragraphs":["Chapter 3255: Of Course, They Will Lose for Sure","Editor: Atlas Studios","If he did not suffer, he would never sober up.","Qiao Nian probably thought so too. Otherwise, she would not have taken the initiative to bet with Li Xin.","In this aspect, Ye Wangchuan and Qiao Nian shared the same thoughts.","Since the other party had a death wish, all they needed to do was to help him nail the coffin lid... so that he would not regret and back out halfway into his grave.","...","On the other side.","Li Xin returned to his team’s place and was immediately surrounded by his peers.","Everyone asked about the bet.","Li Xin basically ignored them.","He could ignore the others, but Li Xin had no choice but to answer honestly when faced with the questioning of the leader, Professor Ryan.","“I heard you went against the team from Beijing?","“Weren’t you too impulsive? What if you lose...”","Professor Ryan frowned. From his expression, it was clear he was unsatisfied with Li Xin’s impulsive gamble.","Li Xin could feel his reproachful gaze but still insisted. “Professor, don’t worry. We can’t lose! What results can they produce in Beijing? We have no room to lose!”","Professor Ryan shook his head. “Don’t be too confident. Master Cheng...”","Li Xin did not give him a chance to finish. He was very arrogant. “It’s been a long time since that master had a decent result. It’s just an undeserved reputation.”","Professor Ryan was very dissatisfied with his disrespectful attitude. He looked at him from head to toe and his attitude turned cold. “Since you’ve said so, I hope you can bear the responsibility when the time comes!”","Li Xin could feel the coldness in his attitude. He clenched his fists and thought that the reason why Professor Ryan was so cold to him was because he looked different from the rest of the team.","“Of course.”","“That’s good.”","Professor Ryan did not want to argue with him anymore. After saying this, he walked away to do the final examination.","The others scattered like birds and beasts.","Only a bearded man with a good relationship with him went over and hammered his shoulder. “Are you confident?”","Anyone with a discerning eye could tell that if Li Xin lost this time and implicated their entire team, Professor Ryan would definitely hold him accountable.","The stake of the other party’s bet was also tricky. It hit Li Xin’s weak spot.","The bearded man thought about it and said, “If you can’t participate in domestic and foreign competitions for three years, I’m afraid you’ll be kicked out of the team...”","A scientific research team was very expensive to maintain.","The team could not afford to keep trash.","Li Xin’s eyes flashed. He crossed his arms in front of his chest and snorted, then confidently said, “Don’t worry, I won’t lose!”","The bearded man was a little unconvinced.","Li Xin simply told him where his greatest confidence came from. “I heard that when Mr. Auburn’s plane landed, the Nie family was already there waiting to see him. Professor Nie has a deep relationship with Beijing. Given the conflict between the two sides, it’s purely a dream for Beijing to obtain good results in this weapons exhibition! With Mr. Auburn’s status, as long as we embarrass them on the Nie family’s account, the last place has already been internally decided!”","Indeed, the bearded man did not know about this insider news. Since the man’s words were firm, he believed most of it. Apart from being surprised, he could not help but show a sympathetic expression.","The girl who made the bet with Li Xin was probably in trouble."]},{"number":3256,"title":"Chapter 3256: Not Giving Her Any Face!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3256: Not Giving Her Any Face!","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, since Li Xin knew the inside story and still made a bet with the other party, and even proposed a bet to make the other party kneel and admit their mistake, it was considerably unethical.","At this thought, the bearded man’s attitude towards him faded. He patted his shoulder and did not say anything else. He followed the old professor to check on his exhibition.","Seeing he was being ignored, Li Xin felt even more resentful. He lowered his eyes and only wanted time to pass faster.","He wanted everyone to see who won!","* * *","9:55 a.m.","Nie Qingru’s and Mr. Auburn’s cars arrived outside the exhibition hall.","Because they “coincidentally” bumped into each other, out of courtesy, Mr. Auburn followed her into the exhibition hall.","They walked in side by side and chatted along the way. Those who did not know better thought they were very close and could not help but be attracted to them.","Even some of the judges noticed this and exchanged glances. They couldn’t tell if Mr. Auburn was already on the side of Country M’s delegation like the rumors said.","Daisy was also here today.","She was wearing a pink outfit and followed her grandfather like a lady. She had the bearing of a young lady from a wealthy family.","“Daisy is also interested in these things?”","“Somewhat.”","“Then you have to observe it with Mr. Auburn later.”","Nie Qingru was mainly the one talking along the way. After all, Mr. Auburn’s attitude towards her was not very friendly. He even deliberately kept a distance from her.","As a result, she could only place her gaze on Daisy and try her best to close the distance between them.","However, she was not used to having to lower her head. Even when she smiled, the corners of her eyes and brows revealed a sense of arrogance and distance.","Daisy probably felt that her grandfather’s relationship with Auntie Nie was not considered close. She was smart enough to speak less today.","Finally, all the judges met.","There were a total of eight judges this time. They were the top-notch experts from various regions in the high-tech field, and they all showed their respect for Mr. Auburn.","They gave Mr. Auburn the right to make decisions.","Which meant that...","If this master thought a weapon was not good, he could veto the results.","However, this power was only out of respect. Under normal circumstances, no one would use this power.","The white-haired old man still had the spirit of a dragon and tiger. Even though his azure eyes were covered with a layer of mist, they still did not change.","He did not exchange pleasantries with Nie Qingru. Instead, before setting off for the various exhibition halls, he took the initiative to say to all the judges, “Our weapons exhibition has a long history. It has always been based on fairness and openness. I hope everyone will respect the same guidelines this time and stick to your bottom line and principles. Everything will be based on the final product. Rate it as it is, no more and no less. Otherwise, it will have been meaningless for us old bones to have come here today.”","His words gave the judges an idea of what to expect and how to act. Everyone agreed verbally and glanced in Nie Qingru’s direction.","Nie Qingru maintained a dignified smile, but it did not reach her eyes, and the smile on her lips was rather stiff.","A pair of majestic eyes swept across the white-haired old man without leaving a trace. There was a dark surge in her eyes as if she was holding back her anger.","This Auburn! What an old fool!","She did not believe the other party did not know she wanted him to help ‘take care’ of her younger brother. However, the other party emphasized fairness and justice to all the judges at this juncture...","Heh, he really didn’t give her any face!"]},{"number":3257,"title":"Chapter 3257: Nie Qixing Wants to be Guaranteed First Place?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3257: Nie Qixing Wants to be Guaranteed First Place?","Editor: Atlas Studios","All eight judges had arrived, and it was exactly 10 o’clock.","It was time to start the weapons exhibition.","Thus, Auburn took the lead.","The others followed behind and started to watch from the first booth...","Country M had always obtained good results in the weapons exhibition. This time, they successfully obtained first place with an absolute advantage and suppressed the other participating regions.","Compared to No. 18, who was ranked third from the bottom, Nie Qixing’s starting point was indeed high.","As Mr. Auburn led the judges to their exhibition hall, Nie Qixing was the first to greet the old man. “Mr. Auburn.”","His tone was as if they were familiar with each other. He even greeted the woman at the end of the line like a gentleman. “Daisy.”","His actions undoubtedly attracted the attention of many people.","The people in booths 2 and 3 beside them saw this scene and whispered.","“He really knows Mr. Auburn.”","“I’m so envious of his social circle.”","...","At the third booth.","Li Xin naturally saw this scene as well. His heart, which had been hanging in the air, was completely relieved. He turned his head and whispered to the person beside him, “Look, I didn’t say anything wrong, right? The first place in the internal selection will definitely go to Country M’s team!”","The bearded man frowned and felt uncomfortable. “Isn’t this cheating?”","Li Xin was disapproving. “He has this network. What can he do? If you have this network, why wouldn’t you use it? Only a fool wouldn’t use it.”","He was right to say that.","The bearded man did not say anything.","Li Xin could already imagine Qiao Nian kneeling and admitting her mistake. The corners of his mouth curled up as he whispered excitedly, “Let’s take a look. Let’s see their results first.”","* * *","The discussions around them were so loud that it was impossible for the energetic old man not to hear them.","He immediately frowned and ignored Nie Qixing’s friendly attitude. He said indifferently, “Introduce your models.”","Nie Qixing could feel the distance between them. His expression stiffened, but he quickly adjusted his state and introduced their models to the judges in high spirits.","This time, they developed an electromagnetic cannon.","Unlike conventional cannons, which applied the gas pressure of gunpowder to the projectile, electromagnetic cannons used the ampere force generated by the electromagnetic field in the electromagnetic system to accelerate the metal shell, greatly increasing the speed and range of the projectile.","The key was that this was definitely the most advanced weapon research direction at the moment, and there had been no relevant results on the market for the time being.","Nie Qixing was very familiar with this field. He explained their models clearly and used the LED screen to show the 3D models they had created.","The effect was astonishing.","Even Mr. Auburn’s frown gradually relaxed, and he asked a few professional questions.","It was obvious Nie Qixing was well-prepared this time. He answered the questions one by one.","Not only did he answer, but his answers were also perfect!","Nie Qingru’s face, which had been cold for a few days, revealed a rare look of satisfaction. There was a smile on the corner of her lips, and she interrupted, “This project was proposed by Qixing 10 years ago. It took him 10 years to complete the production. Even his teacher praised him for his talent.”","“Mm.” This time, the silver-haired old man did not refute her. Although Mr. Auburn’s expression was cold, he still dolled out dome praise. “He does have some talent.”"]},{"number":3258,"title":"Chapter 3258: Only Some Talent in His Eyes?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3258: Only Some Talent in His Eyes?","Editor: Atlas Studios","—Some talent?","Nie Qingru’s smile disappeared and her eyes darkened. She felt that this master was too arrogant.","Ji Qing was already very talented in the past!","In her eyes, the electromagnetic cannon project that he had successfully researched was not inferior to Ji Qing’s weapon blueprints. It could even be said it was slightly better.","But he actually said Qixing only had ‘some’ talent.","Then how talented did he need to be?","The judges were also amazed by Nie Qixing’s trump card project. They surrounded him and asked all kinds of questions. Some even touched the model and studied it.","Normally, each booth would take 10 to 15 minutes, but Nie Qixing’s electromagnetic cannon excited all the judges.","In the end, they spent almost half an hour in their exhibition hall.","**","At the same time, in Beijing’s team’s exhibition booth.","Qin Si was indeed an expert at gathering information. He had already run back from the exhibition booth in front.","As he panted heavily, he did not forget to bring bad news.","“Sister Qiao.","“Nie Qixing got an A+.”","Master Cheng’s and Bo Zheng’s hearts sank.","Master Cheng frowned.","He took two steps forward and confirmed with Qin Si. “Are you sure they got an A+?”","“Yes, yes, yes.” Qin Si finally caught his breath and said with a rare serious expression, “They created an electromagnetic cannon!”","“Electromagnetic cannon?” Bo Zheng and Luo Qing exchanged glances and saw the shock in each other’s eyes.","The concept of electromagnetic cannons had existed internationally for a long time, but a feasible method was never developed. It was just a concept.","No one expected Nie Qixing to make this concept a reality.","Everyone looked in the same direction.","The girl was leaning back in her chair and playing with her phone when she suddenly felt a few gazes on her. She couldn’t help but pull down her baseball cap.","At least she was not deaf. When she heard what Qin Si said, she raised her head slightly, revealing her fair and clear face. Her attitude was casual. “Why are you all looking at me?”","Qin Si wanted to say something but hesitated. In the end, he pretended to be relaxed and teased, “You’re good-looking.”","Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows and put down her phone helplessly. “Don’t tell me you really think Nie Qixing is useless?”","“...”","Nie Qixing’s scandal had shattered the good reputation he had accumulated all these years. Of course, others ignored his previous achievements.","Qiao Nian remembered it very clearly.","“He’s the youngest scientist at Stanford, after all. Besides, Nie Qingru has nurtured her successor for so long. If he didn’t have some real ability, she wouldn’t have protected him like a pearl.”","Nie Qingru prioritized benefits.","Apart from feelings, Nie Qixing must be someone who could create value for her.","Otherwise, with Nie Qingru’s personality, if Nie Qixing didn’t have any ability, he would have long been abandoned.","However, she did not expect him to develop an electromagnetic cannon.","Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened as she pulled her baseball cap to relieve her frustration. She roughly understood why Nie Qingru was willing to give up on Ji Qing so easily.","It turned out she already had a “perfect” substitute, Nie Qixing, in her heart.","However, Nie Qingru probably still did not know what she had lost!","Qiao Nian relaxed and unhurriedly said, “Let’s wait and see.”"]},{"number":3259,"title":"Chapter 3259: She Would Never Give Up the Chance to Take a Shot at Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Chapter 3259: She Would Never Give Up the Chance to Take a Shot at Sister Nian","Editor: Atlas Studios","As the man in the first booth, Nie Qixing obtained an A+, people undoubtedly gave up on fighting for first place.","Everyone aimed for second place and tacitly agreed that the first place this year was going to Country M’s delegation.","The corners of Nie Qingru’s mouth curled into a faint arrogance.","Next was Number 2.","Number 2 had relatively good models to show. If they were in previous weapons exhibitions, they could at least achieve above-average results.","However, because Nie Qixing’s team came out with an electromagnetic cannon, Number 2’s model was not as attractive.","In the end, their overall rating was B.","They didn’t even get a B+.","This undoubtedly made Li Xin nervous. After all, what they brought to the exhibition this time was about the same standard as Number 2.","Soon, the judges arrived at their booth.","Li Xin was extremely nervous. He followed Professor Ryan and introduced their models to the judges.","Sure enough.","The judges were all indifferent, including Mr. Auburn. They did not seem to be in a good mood and just listened to their introductions...","Their grades would not be too high!","Just as Li Xin was feeling extremely nervous, a man in a black shirt and pants quickly walked to Nie Qingru’s side and whispered something into her ear.","Nie Qingru gently raised her eyelids and looked at Li Xin. The corners of her mouth curled into a faint smile.","Then, just before the judges were about to give their scores, she suddenly said, “This photon project isn’t easy, right?”","Li Xin was stunned for a moment upon noticing she was talking to him. His heart pounded as he swallowed his saliva and replied, “Uh, it took some effort.”","“Yes, you’ve done very well. The reclusive families are also researching this project. The progress so far is still a little behind you.”","Nie Qingru mentioned the reclusive families neither arrogantly nor rashly. It looked like she was only praising Li Xin’s project, but in fact, several of the judges present had heard about the bet.","She mentioned the reclusive families.","Three or four judges had already written their scores in their notebooks, but they crossed them out with a brush. After thinking about it, they raised it by one point.","It was not a big deal for one person to change his score, but with three or four judges changing their scores, with only eight judges, the final score was drastically different.","As expected, other than Mr. Auburn who gave a pertinent B, the others were more or less influenced by Nie Qingru and gave slightly higher results.","In the end, Li Xin’s team got an A-.","It was actually a point and a half more than Number 2.","Although the difference was only a point and a half, the difference was like heaven and earth!","Mr. Auburn undoubtedly did not agree with this result. However, the results were already out.","Unless he used his veto power. Otherwise, it would be impossible to change the score.","He was the last one to enter the exhibition hall, so he did not know about the bet. He only thought that Nie Qingru knew Li Xin and the others. Before he left, he said unhappily, “I hope that next time, no one will talk about irrelevant topics before the results are out!”","These words did not seem harsh, but they hit Nie Qingru in the face. He did not give Nie Qingru, the Empress of the reclusive families, any face.","He was just short of telling her not to interfere with the judging.","Nie Qingru’s expression froze.","She suppressed the anger in her chest and followed unwillingly.","She still wanted to see Qiao Nian make a fool out of herself."]},{"number":3260,"title":"Chapter 3260: Why Do I Feel That Qiao Nian and Her People Are Closer to Mr. Auburn?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3260: Why Do I Feel That Qiao Nian and Her People Are Closer to Mr. Auburn?","Editor: Atlas Studios","No one else in the following 14 booths scored high marks.","Only Number 8 was a little unexpected. He obtained an A-, similar to Li Xin’s team. There was a high chance they would be tied for second place.","The other teams scored either B or C. Some teams even got a D.","Back then, the Beijing team that participated in the weapons exhibition also obtained a D. It was a rather bad result. The team was also devastated. They could only hope that someone in the next few positions would obtain a worse result to wash away the humiliation.","Because Li Xin had gotten an A- with Nie Qingru’s help, he followed behind in high spirits and watched the show. He was just short of rubbing his fists and walking to the last three exhibits.","Seconds ticked by.","The judges finally reached Qiao Nian’s booth.","At this moment, the disadvantage of being at the back of the queue became obvious. A few of the old judges were tired after coming all this way.","By the time they reached Qiao Nian’s booth, some of the judges were already impatient. They only wanted to end it early so that they could go back and rest.","Originally, this tired and casual atmosphere would continue.","Unexpectedly, upon arriving at Number 18, Mr. Auburn greeted one of the team members with a smile. “Ye, we meet again.”","Qin Si, Master Cheng, and the others looked at the handsome man.","Master Wang?","Ye Wangchuan walked towards the white-haired old man elegantly. They seemed familiar with each other as they exchanged a few pleasantries.","This familiarity...","It was nothing like Nie Qingru and Nie Qixing who pretended to be close at the beginning, but it could be seen that Mr. Auburn really had a good relationship with the other party.","Even Daisy was surprised. She couldn’t help but ask, “Grandpa, do you know each other?”","As she spoke, an image flashed through her mind. She suddenly remembered bumping into him at the restaurant last night.","There was another girl who left a deep impression on her!","Daisy’s eyes glanced to the side, and she quickly noticed a unique figure in the crowd. She was also there!","Daisy was surprised and immediately looked at Nie Qingru and Nie Qixing...","As expected, she saw Auntie Nie’s expression darken when she saw Qiao Nian, whom she had claimed not to know. There was a stern look between her eyebrows, as if she hated Qiao Nian.","Auburn ignored his granddaughter. Instead, after a simple greeting with Ye Wangchuan, he also looked for Qiao Nian.","Soon, he saw Qiao Nian standing beside Master Cheng and the others. He waved and greeted her warmly, “You’re also here.”","This attitude...","Instantly, everyone’s gaze shifted from Ye Wangchuan to the low-key girl wearing a baseball cap.","“Who is this?”","“Looks like she’s part of the delegation.”","“She’s the girl who made the bet with Li Xin. Oh my, she knows Mr. Auburn? Didn’t Li Xin brag that Nie Qixing is the one who knows Mr. Auburn? Why do I feel Number 18’s team is more familiar with Mr. Auburn?”","However, at this moment, Mr. Auburn even took the initiative to mention it. “I asked you out previously, but you didn’t have time...”","Qiao Nian touched her earlobe awkwardly. “Yes, I was helping them out.”","Among the crowd.","Li Xin’s expression changed from shock to disbelief and a little panic.","This was different from what he had heard.","He did not expect an ordinary Qiao Nian to know a big shot like Mr. Auburn."]},{"number":3261,"title":"Chapter 3261: Just Watch, Their Scores Won’t Exceed B","paragraphs":["Chapter 3261: Just Watch, Their Scores Won’t Exceed B","Editor: Atlas Studios","His friend was also beside him. He looked at the girl in the middle of the crowd and nudged him curiously with his elbow. “Didn’t you say that Mr. Auburn is more familiar with Nie Qixing? It seems different from what you said!”","Li Xin’s expression was ugly, but he remained stubborn. “So what if they know each other? Hmph! Mr. Auburn still has to give the reclusive families face in the end. Didn’t you see that the judges changed their points as soon as that person spoke?”","He was talking about Nie Qingru.","He said confidently, “Just you watch. If she offended the reclusive families, she can forget about getting good results at this weapons exhibition!”","The bearded man turned to look at the serious old man talking to Qiao Nian with a smile. He felt that things might be different from what Li Xin said.","Based on Mr. Auburn’s attitude, it didn’t seem like he would give the reclusive families face.","When it was their group’s turn, Mr. Auburn was the one who gave them the lowest score.","And he did not change the score after that woman spoke!","In fact, after the incident, he even seriously suggested to the Empress that he hoped she would not interfere with the judges’ scoring... Was this considered giving face and having a good relationship?","This theory did not hold.","“I bet that their final score won’t exceed B.” Li Xin was full of bravado, but in reality, he was very nervous inside.","This concerned his reputation and whether he could survive in the industry in the future.","The bearded man could tell he was trying to hide his nervousness. He didn’t say anything else and looked straight at Qiao Nian and the others.","* * *","After chatting with the white-haired old man, Qiao Nian pulled Master Cheng over and introduced him.","Mr. Auburn was extremely famous in the circle.","Master Cheng was not without reputation either.","The two of them were over 70 years old and outstanding in the same field. They greeted each other politely.","Auburn finally remembered why he was there. After exchanging a few words with Master Cheng, he got to the point. “Let’s talk another day. By the way, what’s your project for this weapons exhibition? Is it convenient for you to introduce it to everyone?”","Master Cheng’s eyes turned solemn, and he immediately said, “Of course it’s convenient!”","Then, he led the team and introduced the Tsar to the judges and the surrounding onlookers.","At first, no one took them seriously.","After all, what good stuff could the third-last place bring out?","It was nothing more than the old-fashioned weapons and equipment that others had played with before. Then, they would study it for half a day like new equipment and make it into junk.","However, when the master showed them the Tsar’s model, the venue fell silent. Everyone was shocked.","“C-Can this thing be displayed casually?” Someone whispered, his voice mixed with shock and awe.","However, almost no one paid attention to him.","This was because, in addition to showing them the model, Master Cheng also played the realistic animation of the Tsar that Qiao Nian had made with him on the LED screen.","Although it was a computer-generated image, everyone saw the Tsar fly out and transmigrate across the Pacific Ocean in less than five minutes before landing accurately on the ship moored in the bay.","There was a loud explosion.","The ship on the LED screen was unable to fight back and was blown to pieces!","This effect was enough to shock everyone present.","Everyone knew it was just a computer simulation, but they felt the intimidation of a sharp blade piercing through their eardrums.","Nie Qingru’s expression was extremely ugly."]},{"number":3262,"title":"Chapter 3262: Face Slapping on the Spot, Your Suggestion Is Double Standards?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3262: Face Slapping on the Spot, Your Suggestion Is Double Standards?","Editor: Atlas Studios","It was not that she did not expect Master Cheng and the others to exhibit the Tsar, but she recognized at a glance that the object of the simulated attack in the animation was the reclusive families’ ship.","She narrowed her eyes and looked straight in the girl’s direction—Qiao Nian!","Nie Qingru did not even need to guess who was behind this computer simulation.","Other than her, who else in the entire Continent M would dare to provoke her like this?","There were people everywhere.","Everyone’s attention was on the simulation, repeatedly playing on the LED screen and listening to Master Cheng’s steady and powerful explanation.","No one noticed her at all.","Nie Qingru suppressed the anger that rushed to her throat. She clenched her fists, took a deep breath, and softly said, “It’s not good to study such a dangerous weapon, right?”","Everyone attentively listening to Master Cheng’s explanation, including Mr. Auburn, who was asking questions about the Tsar, was suddenly attracted by her words.","Nie Qingru was someone who had seen big scenes. Facing so many gazes, she gracefully took off her velvet gloves and handed them to the person beside her. Then, she said to Master Cheng meaningfully, “I think it’s better to study less of such lethal weapons.”","Master Cheng did not expect her to criticize him from this angle. He frowned and did not know how to argue with her.","Qiao Nian knew that some people would not continue watching quietly. She looked up and said lazily, “Why do I remember that the reclusive families have done a lot of similar research?”","Nie Qingru had already expected that she would dare to start a conflict with her in public and even defend an outsider. Her face immediately darkened. “I just think everyone should advocate less research on such weapons.”","“Isn’t it too late for you to think that now?” Qiao Nian did not give her any face and said frivolously, “Oh, or is your suggestion based on double standards? Only you can study it. No one else shall study it?”","Everyone present was smart. From the moment Nie Qingru spoke, everyone knew she was looking for trouble.","However, they did not expect Qiao Nian to dare to tell the truth and expose Nie Qingru’s hypocrisy.","She did not even try to be tactful.","After all, she was the Empress of the reclusive families. Qiao Nian’s fearless attitude surprised many people.","It was suddenly awkward.","No one dared to make a sound.","At this moment, Auburn stood out. He first frowned, then stood up straight and said to Nie Qingru in a low voice, “All the weapons in the weapons exhibition are lethal. Since they are weapons, there’s no need to argue about how lethal they are. It’s meaningless and unreasonable.”","Someone in the corner quietly added, “That’s right. Coming to the weapons exhibition to ask for weapons that are not lethal is like taking off your pants to fart. It’s unnecessary...”","“Lower your voice, are you courting death!” The person beside him quickly covered his mouth.","However, they were still heard by many people.","Those who heard it displayed playful facial expressions. They glanced at Nie Qingru intentionally or unintentionally, and someone even whispered, “I think they’re afraid she’ll get high marks, right? Tsk, are the reclusive families willing to go so low? They don’t even have this bit of tolerance?”","Someone kindly explained to him, “There’s a reason behind this. Let me tell you, it’s...”","Nie Qixing’s injured leg had not been properly treated. It was still hurting and he could not leave the wheelchair."]},{"number":3263,"title":"Chapter 3263: Mr. Auburn, Can You Clear My Questions?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3263: Mr. Auburn, Can You Clear My Questions?","Editor: Atlas Studios","He sat in his wheelchair and listened to the conversations from all directions.","The topics about his clubhouse, lying, and violating the rules to obtain the laboratory qualifications were raised again. Some people even directly complained that the clubhouse issue had yet to be resolved.","It was obvious that the reclusive families were protecting him.","Some people even mocked him for pretending to be close to Mr. Auburn. In the end, he was quickly slapped in the face. Mr. Auburn was more familiar with Qiao Nian!","These words were undoubtedly rubbing salt into his wounds.","Nie Qixing’s face immediately turned pale. He grabbed the wheelchair’s armrest tightly, and the back of his hand exerted so much force that his joints bulged and turned white.","Why was it like this...","Wasn’t the electromagnetic cannon enough to prove his ability? Why did everything change the moment Qiao Nian appeared?!","* * *","Nie Qingru originally wanted to interfere with the competition from the moral high ground, but Mr. Auburn took the initiative to speak up for Qiao Nian’s team.","The other judges naturally saw through his attitude.","After Master Cheng finished the introductions and the judges gave their marks, everyone thought about it and wrote down the scores.","Once the Tsar appeared, who could compete?","As expected, the eight judges all gave the S grade. Even the usually strict Mr. Auburn showed the S grade.","S.","The results were out!","No one could surpass this result at this weapons exhibition.","Therefore, Master Cheng led Beijing to win first place in this year’s weapons exhibition!","With the results out, someone took the lead and applauded.","Master Cheng was indescribably excited, but he restrained himself and chatted with Mr. Auburn and the other judges.","Only Li Xin, in the crowd, had an ugly expression. He looked at Beijing’s exhibit in disbelief and said dejectedly, “How is this possible? How can they get first place?”","And it was an S grade!","In the entire history of this weapons exhibition, other than Xie Tingyun obtaining this result 20 years ago, no one else had obtained an S grade.","If there was a difference in standards between grades A and B...","Then S was undoubtedly above all other results and was a unique existence.","For example, although Nie Qixing’s A+ was not bad and he was seemingly only half a step behind Master Cheng, he might not be able to surpass this half a step in his entire life...","This was a chasm!","The difference between heaven and earth!","Nie Qingru did not want to see such results. She turned around and left the exhibition hall as soon as the weapons exhibition ended.","She bumped into Mr. Auburn and Daisy, who were also leaving the venue.","They arrived at the hotel at the same time. The cars were also next to each other.","When they left, they naturally had to bump into each other.","Daisy saw Nie Qingru leaving alone and greeted her with the same smile as before. “Auntie Nie.”","Nie Qingru’s eyebrows twitched when she saw them. She was about to bend down and get into the car but suddenly stopped. In the end, she couldn’t hold back the anger in her heart.","She asked the white-haired old man face to face, “Mr. Auburn, there’s something I’m not sure about. Why do you have to help Beijing step on us?”","Not hiding her relationship with Nie Qixing, she narrowed her eyes sharply and said bluntly, “I admit that the Tsar is more stunning, but weapons in this field have existed for a long time. The electromagnetic cannon developed by Qixing is a new field, but you gave it just an A+.","“I don’t understand. What’s your scoring criteria?”","Nie Qingru was domineering as she stared at the old man and asked, “Mr. Auburn, can you clear my doubts?”"]},{"number":3264,"title":"Chapter 3264: You’re the One Who Wants To Know The Answer. That Person Is Ji Qing!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3264: You’re the One Who Wants To Know The Answer. That Person Is Ji Qing!","Editor: Atlas Studios","Daisy felt the unusual atmosphere, and the corners of her mouth twitched awkwardly as she tried to smooth things over. “Aunt Nie, my grandfather...”","“Children shouldn’t interrupt when their elders are talking,” Mr. Auburn interrupted her calmly. He looked straight at Nie Qingru’s unyielding gaze and said clearly, “I’ve never put personal emotions in my scoring. I gave him an A+, not for personal reasons, but because I saw the same electromagnetic cannon 20 years ago.”","20 years ago...","Nie Qingru was shocked. “How is this possible?!”","Mr. Auburn shook his head and took a step forward. His aura was not as aggressive as hers, but his words were heart-piercing. “I have no reason to lie to you.”","“...”","“20 years ago, someone showed me a semi-finished electromagnetic cannon model. No, it should be said it was already 80% completed. She even told me about her concept and final goal. If she completed it, the finished product would be even more perfect than what we saw in the exhibition hall today!”","“Who is it?” Nie Qingru had a vague idea.","As soon as this thought surfaced, it was as if a huge rock was pressing down on her heart, making it difficult for her to breathe. She did not want to think too deeply about it.","Old Mr. Auburn did not hide his disgust and disdain for her. “Ji Qing.”","Nie Qingru’s thought became reality. Swaying, she put her hand on the car door to barely remain standing.","Ji Qing was involved in the electromagnetic cannon 20 years ago?","Why did she never know about this?","“She’s the most talented student I’ve ever seen. She’s much more talented than the successor you’ve chosen. Unfortunately, she was too soft-hearted and cared too much about others’ opinions.”","Auburn was one of the few people who knew about the matter back then. Seeing her face suddenly turn an inch pale, he didn’t feel any sympathy for her. He only felt that it was ridiculous.","He did not want to blame anyone. He just sighed and said, “If she hadn’t died early, she would have become a world-famous master with her talent. Her achievements wouldn’t be worse than mine. She should be above me... It’s a pity that not many people know of her name now.”","Some people were treated as treasures and vice versa.","Auburn looked at her mockingly. After a long time, he looked away and concluded calmly, “So I didn’t mix in any personal feelings when I scored it.","“If I did, I wouldn’t give him a single point! He’s not even worthy of an F for me!”","Nie Qingru’s expression, which always remained proper, finally showed signs of cracking. She frowned and raised her voice. “Mr. Auburn, I respect your status and hope you can respect Qixing.”","However, Auburn did not take her warning seriously, and he bluntly said, “Be a proper person before you do anything else. The way I see it, he’s up to no good. If the Empress has the time, you should interfere more! He’s already in his thirties, he shouldn’t rely entirely on his elder sister. Otherwise, he can’t convince anyone of his ability.”","Nie Qingru’s eardrums were buzzing. She held her breath and stood rooted to the ground with an ugly expression.","Mr. Auburn opened the car door and said calmly, “I won’t stay in Continent M for long. I won’t say anything else. I’ll take my leave first.”","Nie Qingru was still holding onto the car door, not saying a word.","Mr. Auburn called out to his granddaughter, “Daisy, let’s go.”","Daisy returned to her senses and waited for him to get into the car before also entering. She didn’t even greet Nie Qingru as they left.","Nie Qingru watched as the black car drove past her."]},{"number":3265,"title":"Chapter 3265: Completely Dumbfounded","paragraphs":["Chapter 3265: Completely Dumbfounded","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Empress, should we teach him a lesson?” Shadow appeared beside her and asked in a low voice as he looked in the car’s direction.","Nie Qingru suppressed her anger and got into the car expressionlessly. Then, she said coldly, “He’s Xie Tingyun’s benefactor and has a connection with the Nan family of the independent continent. He’s also a respected master. There’s no need for us to fall out with him over a small matter...”","Although she said that, she actually felt suffocated.","Shadow hesitated for a moment before looking at her and saying, “Empress, Mr. Auburn said that Miss Ji Qing studied electromagnetic cannons back then...”","Nie Qingru’s tense body was like a bow leaning against the car. She lowered her eyes, and her dark eyebrows gave off an unreasonable feeling.","After a long while, she said faintly, “I won’t believe anything without evidence!”","Shadow looked at her in a daze. “But with Mr. Auburn’s prestige, he won’t lie about such a matter...”","Nie Qingru held onto the wide brim of her hat. She was graceful and elegant, but she was stubborn on this matter. “If she had already built the electromagnetic cannon, why didn’t she tell me? She never said anything, which means she didn’t succeed in the end!”","“But...”","“Didn’t that old man Auburn also say that Ji Qing only showed him an 80% finished product back then? She must have failed to finish it.”","Under normal circumstances, it’s impossible to fail after completing 80% of the finished product.","But Shadow had seen through her attitude, so he stopped talking and said considerately, “Empress, let me close the car door for you.”","The black car door blocked Nie Qingru’s cold and arrogant face, and the black car soon drove past Shadow...","Shadow stood on the spot and watched the tail of the car disappear from his sight. Then, he composed himself and walked towards the exhibition hall.","Young Master Qi was still inside.","The Empress left Young Master Qi behind. He couldn’t just ignore him.","...","“How come?”","“Why is this the result?”","“That’s impossible.”","Qiao Nian and the others’ results had been out for a long time, but Li Xin was still standing there in disbelief, muttering to himself.","The bearded man couldn’t stand it anymore and slapped him on the back in an attempt to wake him up. “The results are out. Number 18 did get first place!”","Li Xin mechanically turned to look at him and asked, “They got first place?”","The bearded man frowned and woke him up coldly. “Li Xin, there’s no point in being conflicted like this. You’re a man. If you lose, so be it! She didn’t ask you to kneel or anything like that... Just apologize properly and do what you have to do.”","When Li Xin made the bet back then, he did not leave any leeway for Qiao Nian. He was certain he would win, so he asked Qiao Nian to kneel and apologize to him in front of everyone.","Compared to his conditions, Qiao Nian’s conditions were not harsh.","So now that he had lost, no one would sympathize with him.","However, Li Xin’s face was ashen. Suddenly waking up, he pushed the bearded man away and fiercely said, “Why should I apologize?! I...”","The bearded man was caught off guard and staggered. Seeing that he was a sore loser, he immediately waved his hand and left. “Up to you!”","“Don’t go!” Li Xin panicked again when he saw he was about to leave.","Unfortunately, the bearded man had no intention of putting up with him anymore. He left without looking back, leaving him alone."]},{"number":3266,"title":"Chapter 3266: You Want to Go Back on Your Word Now?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3266: You Want to Go Back on Your Word Now?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Because of Li Xin’s sudden loud voice and push, the surrounding onlookers, still immersed in Qiao Nian and the others’ S grade, noticed him.","Someone immediately remembered the bet he had made with Qiao Nian.","“Isn’t that Li Xin from Number 3?”","“That’s him.”","“Tsk. He thought he was going to win, so he asked her to kneel and apologize. Now, there’s a good show to watch.”","The whispers were very unfriendly.","Li Xin felt that more and more people were paying attention to him. Their gazes were filled with ridicule as if they were watching a show. It was as if they had stripped him naked and thrown him here to perform.","His face grew paler and uglier.","Finally, he looked at the girl in the baseball cap saying something to Master Cheng and the others. Then, she turned around and walked in his direction.","Li Xin’s heart pounded, and his throat felt like it was stuffed with cotton. When she was in front of him, he opened his mouth with a red face and squeezed out a word. “Congratulations.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows.","She couldn’t tell what he was going to do.","However, Li Xin seemed to have found his backbone and turned shameless. “I was too impulsive previously and said something unpleasant. Don’t take it to heart... I’m a few years older than you. Consider me your elder brother. I was wrong this time. I’ll treat you to a meal another day. How about that?”","The surrounding people could tell what he was implying.","“Is he trying to weasel out of the bet?”","“Isn’t this Li Xin too shameless?”","“How could he have the cheek to say he’s her brother? Tsk!”","Many people couldn’t stand him. They didn’t hold back their ridicule as harsh words entered Li Xin’s ears one after another.","Li Xin was also embarrassed. His clenched fists were sweaty—sticky and uncomfortable.","Of course, he knew how shameless he was being, but he only wanted to deny this bet.","“Your surname is Qiao?”","He tried his best to change the topic. He stared at Qiao Nian’s nameplate as if he had just noticed her name.","“Qiao Nian? I’ll call you Nian Nian.”","“I heard your friend calling you Nian Nian too...”","Li Xin tried to squeeze out a smile, but it was too fake and stiff.","He didn’t want to talk by himself like a clown, but when he bombarded her with questions, the girl just watched his performance with a faint smile.","Finally exhausted, he did not know how to argue his case anymore.","Qiao Nian lifted her baseball cap, stuck one hand in her pocket, and raised her eyebrows. “Are you done?”","Li Xin was quite embarrassed. “Uh...”","“Do you mean you want to go back on your word now?” she asked directly.","This time, not only was Li Xin embarrassed, but his toes were also clenched tightly.","His face was red as he waved his hands excitedly. “How can this be called going back on my word? Everyone was just joking.”","He was addicted to biting back. “Yes, it was just a joke. Who knew you would take it seriously? Is there a need?”","Qiao Nian looked at him impatiently.","At this moment, having just finished talking to Master Cheng, Ye Wangchuan turned around and saw them. He walked behind the girl and patted her shoulder. Then, he raised his chin slightly and looked at Li Xin. “What are you talking about?”","Qiao Nian replied lazily, “He made a bet with me, but he doesn’t want to admit it after losing.”","Li Xin’s face turned even redder. He pretended to retort loudly, “I already said I was just joking!”"]},{"number":3267,"title":"Chapter 3267: Master Wang Is Playing With Him Like a Monkey","paragraphs":["Chapter 3267: Master Wang Is Playing With Him Like a Monkey","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan looked at the clown-like Li Xin and then at the impatient expression on Qiao Nian’s face. He curled his thin lips and looked at Li Xin wantonly. “Why are you allowing him to talk so much? Just ban him.”","Ban?","Li Xin was stunned.","Then, he felt that Ye Wangchuan was bragging.","What ability did Beijing have to ban him?","He wasn’t from the Ninth Branch.","He was about to laugh.","Unexpectedly, Ye Wangchuan looked at him and slowly said, “Tell Dean Feng about it, he should be happy to ban such a scumbag.”","The corners of Li Xin’s mouth curled up, but halfway through, his lips trembled. He had a bad feeling.","Qin Si happened to come over at this moment to listen and casually said, “Master Wang, are you talking about Dean Feng Yu?”","Feng Yu!","The dean of the First Research Institute on the independent continent.","The exhibition hall was only so big, and Qin Si’s voice wasn’t soft.","As a result, many people were paying attention to them. They heard clearly when Feng Yu was mentioned.","Many people looked at the low-key girl in surprise. The girl had only come as an entourage this time.","If not for her conflict with Li Xin, not many people would have paid attention to her.","But she seemed to know Mr. Auburn and Dean Feng...","Many people asked themselves—who exactly is this girl?!","“Let me do it.” Ye Wangchuan took out his cell phone and pretended to make a call.","Qin Si glanced at Li Xin, whose shoulders were trembling, and gloated. “Indeed, let’s ban such people so that they don’t endanger society.”","Li Xin’s heart was in turmoil. He wasn’t sure if Qiao Nian really knew Feng Yu. After all, the girl had only listened to them from the beginning to the end and had not expressed her stance.","However, a strong sense of uneasiness surged in his heart. In the end, Li Xin couldn’t hold it in anymore. Before Ye Wangchuan could make a call, he said with a trembling voice, “I apologize!”","Ye Wangchuan paused and glanced at him.","Li Xin was scared silly. “Don’t call, I apologize!”","He would just not be able to participate in the competition for three years.","But if the First Research Institute banned him... that would be a lifetime problem.","Ye Wangchuan raised his thin lips. “Are you sure?”","Li Xin nodded like he was pecking at rice. He was afraid that the other party would go back on his word. “I’m sure. I’ll apologize. Let’s do as we agreed on.”","He stopped pretending to be stupid and ran in Master Cheng’s direction. He was afraid that if he was a step slower, Ye Wangchuan would not give him a chance to apologize.","Off he went.","Qiao Nian’s sharp eyes saw that the phone a certain someone had put down did not have the number he had mentioned at all. Instead, the phone was not even unlocked. He had completely played Li Xin like a monkey.","Impressive.","She rubbed her temples and said to Ye Wangchuan, “Let’s go back.”","At this moment, a figure stood in front of them.","Qiao Nian looked up and saw Nie Qixing’s vicious and gloomy face. She looked away and said, “A good dog doesn’t block the way.”","Nie Qixing’s eyes darkened. “I have something to ask you.”","Qiao Nian ignored him and walked past him.","This attitude of not taking anyone seriously angered Nie Qixing. He supported himself with both hands and struggled to stand up. The veins on his forehead bulged. “Qiao Nian, don’t you feel guilty for causing me to be like this?!”","Many people were watching the previous show.","They had not completely dispersed.","Nie Qixing came to look for Qiao Nian as soon as Li Xin left.","Those who had planned to leave stayed behind."]},{"number":3268,"title":"Chapter 3268: The Empress Has Left","paragraphs":["Chapter 3268: The Empress Has Left","Editor: Atlas Studios","Everyone was stunned after they heard Nie Qixing’s hoarse questioning.","“What does he mean? I think he means his being in a wheelchair has something to do with this person from the Beijing delegation?”","“Who is this person? Isn’t Nie Qixing backed by the reclusive families?”","“She actually can make Nie Qixing end up like this? Is there a mistake?”","Some of the whispers reached Li Xin’s ears, who was conflicted about how to apologize to Master Cheng. He turned his head and saw Nie Qixing fall back into the wheelchair in a sorry state. His heart tightened, and he no longer wanted to try to save face. He grabbed Master Cheng’s hand and apologized solemnly.","...","On the other side.","Nie Qixing watched the girl walk away as he fell back into the wheelchair.","With a thin layer of sweat on his forehead, his face was distorted and his facial expression was malicious. His eyes were fixed on the girl. His gaze was like a venomous snake lurking in the dark, ready to pounce and bite at any time.","Qiao Nian walked in front, but Ye Wangchuan did not immediately leave.","Noticing Nie Qixing’s unusual gaze., he stopped in his tracks and warned him faintly, “I advise you not to have any crooked thoughts. Otherwise, the reclusive families might not be able to protect you.”","Nie Qixing only noticed that Ye Wangchuan had not left when he spoke.","He lowered his eyes and sneered. “Oh? Are you so confident that the reclusive families can’t protect me?”","Ye Wangchuan’s gaze swept across his eye and injured leg. His lips curled into a faint smile. “The truth is obvious!”","Ever since Nie Qixing became disabled, he had been especially sensitive to the way others looked at his legs and eyes. He immediately sensed where Ye Wangchuan was looking.","He was like a venomous snake that had been stepped on. He had no choice but to retract his fangs, and his expression became gloomy and silent.","Ye Wangchuan did not want to talk to him. He just saw the strange look in his eyes, so he stopped to warn him.","Since the other party understood what he meant, he did not stay any longer. He went after Qiao Nian.","“Young Master Qi.”","At this moment, Shadow found Nie Qixing in the middle of the exhibition hall. He quickly walked over and pushed the wheelchair for him.","Nie Qixing closed his eyes to hide his hazy gaze and softly asked, “Where’s my sister?”","Shadow guessed he would ask about Nie Qingru. He pursed his lips and quietly answered, “The Empress has already left.”","Nie Qixing’s hands in his lap clenched into fists. His gloomy expression became mocking and painful but was soon replaced by resentment.","He stopped talking and let Shadow push him out of the crowd.","* * *","Outside the elevator.","The girl who had just walked out of the exhibition hall looked down at her cell phone as if she were replying to a message.","Ye Wangchuan walked over and stopped beside her. He glanced sideways and said, “Be careful these days. It seems Nie Qixing won’t give up.”","Qiao Nian had just replied to Guan Yan’s message. She nodded, looked at him with clear eyes, and calmly said, “Nie Qingru will take good care of him. At least, she won’t let him provoke me during this period.”","That was the logic.","However, Ye Wangchuan had a feeling that things were not that simple.","He had not discovered anything that Nie Qixing was doing behind the scenes for the time being. It was just a psychological effect, so he did not continue on this topic. He was about to ask her when she would return to Beijing...","However, Qiao Nian suddenly received a call."]},{"number":3269,"title":"Chapter 3269: I Found a Woman","paragraphs":["Chapter 3269: I Found a Woman","Editor: Atlas Studios","“I found a woman,” the other party said immediately.","Qiao Nian frowned and replied in a frivolous tone, “Huh?”","“No.” The other party probably realized he was too ambiguous and quickly added, “This woman is a little special.”","Coincidentally, the elevator doors opened at this moment.","Qiao Nian had not finished her call and did not plan to go up for the time being. She held the cell phone to her ear and motioned to the side before saying to Ye Wangchuan, “I’m going to take this call.”","Leaning against the wall gracefully and lazily, Ye Wangchuan nodded slightly, indicating for her to go.","Qiao Nian walked away.","**","At this moment.","A young man with colorful hair was squatting on the corner road of a high-class hotel in Continent M. The man was of mixed race and with good facial features.","It was a pity that he was dressed sloppily, like a homeless man. No one would pay special attention to his face.","The man did not care about the luxury cars and rich people passing by on this street. He held a bowl of instant noodles in one hand and a fork in the other, with a cell phone between his shoulder and ear. He stared at the instant noodles and muttered something.","At this moment, a black Bentley was parked in front of the hotel.","Soon, the valet took the car keys from the man who got out of the car and drove the car to a special parking lot.","The homeless man, squatting by the roadside eating his instant noodles, sensed something and looked up at the man tidying his suit and about to enter the hotel.","Probably because his gaze was too obvious, coupled with his strange attire and flamboyant hair, he attracted the attention of the people about to enter the hotel.","From the corner of his eye, Zhou Zheng saw the person “stunned” by the roadside. He subconsciously frowned and asked the hotel staff, “Who is that person?”","The doorman followed his gaze and immediately said, “A vagrant?”","This was the most famous commercial street in Continent M.","There were many hotels and high-class cafeterias nearby.","Therefore, homeless people often wandered around, begging or rummaging through the trash cans.","The hotel staff were already used to it.","“If you mind, I’ll inform the security officers to chase him away later.” The doorman glanced at the ‘vagrant’ disdainfully.","Zhou Zheng adjusted the watch expressionlessly. As he walked in, he said coldly, “What an eyesore. Chase him away!”","***","When Zhou Zheng completely disappeared from the entrance of the hotel.","The ‘vagrant’ retracted his gaze and continued eating his instant noodles when he suddenly saw security officers approaching him aggressively from the corner of his eye.","“F*ck!","“Someone’s coming after me.","“It must be that young brat! That dog looks like a human, why is he so dog-like?","“Boss, wait for me to lose them first.”","He had no choice but to throw the fork into the bowl, pick up his instant noodles, and immediately run in the opposite direction.","He ran very fast.","In a moment, he was already across the road.","The other side of the road was no longer within the hotel’s jurisdiction. The security officers could only stare at him.","Only then did the vagrant whistle proudly at them. He leaned against a tree and caught his breath. Then, he grabbed his phone and looked down at it.","The big boss did not hang up."]},{"number":3270,"title":"Chapter 3270: Is Everyone from the Reclusive Families Crazy?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3270: Is Everyone from the Reclusive Families Crazy?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Hence, he grabbed his cell phone and complained, “Is everyone from the reclusive families crazy? I’m so far away from him eating instant noodles, but he still ordered someone to chase me away.”","What a problem!","At such a distance, could the smell of instant noodles still reach their suits?","“Did you meet Nie Qixing?” The girl’s voice was calm and emotionless, like the cool and refreshing spring water flowing in summer.","The ‘vagrant’ shook his head and regained his attention. He looked at the bowl of noodles that he could not eat and was furious. He gritted his teeth and squeezed it out. “No, he was just a lackey.","“That’s why I said that the people from the reclusive families are all so arrogant. Even a lackey is so arrogant.”","He even called the security officers to chase him away.","Most importantly, the security officers were all holding electric batons, looking like they wanted to beat him up.","At this thought, Slim Waist Control shook his head, and the colorful bird feathers on his head became even more conspicuous. “Boss, can you assign Daji for this kind of job in the future? It’s too f*cking infuriating! I might as well go to Continent F’s red light district to sell my butt. At least I can lie down and earn money. It won’t be like now, where I can’t even eat a bowl of instant noodles.”","“Do you still want the source code for the iris?” Qiao Nian knew him very well. She blocked all his complaints with just a simple sentence.","The iris verification system.","Sun got tired of playing with that little program very early on.","But this source code was worth a lot!","Currently, the best iris system technology in the world belonged to Sun. Any company or individual that had this technology would hold some power.","In other words, they could charge a fee for its usage.","It was a large sum of money every year.","Sure enough.","Slim Waist Control stopped complaining, smiled, and happily said, “Yes!”","Qiao Nian did not want to bicker with him and cut to the chase. “The person you were talking about just now...?”","“Ah, you’re talking about this.” Slim Waist Control immediately remembered. He put away his unreliable expression and said seriously, “I’ve been tailing them for a few days and found a woman hiding beside Nie Qixing...”","Originally, at Nie Qixing’s age and status, it was normal for him to have a woman by his side.","There were many sanctimonious hypocrites in this circle, not to mention Nie Qixing, who was already a hypocrite.","He was just keeping a woman.","He did not pay much attention to it at first.","Until he accidentally saw that woman’s face today.","Thus, Slim Waist Control called Qiao Nian.","“I secretly took a photo. I’ll send it to you later.”","He did not know how to describe it. Anyway, this matter was quite strange. Nie Qixing’s woman was very strange.","“You’ll understand when you see it.”","After saying that, he looked down and sent the photo to her.","...","Slim Waist Control was a computer expert. Although the photo was a little blurry, after his technical processing, the photo was clear enough for the woman’s face to be seen clearly.","Qiao Nian clicked on the photo the moment she received it. She narrowed her eyes and looked at it. She did not immediately realize it... until Slim Waist Control asked, “Boss, don’t you think the woman in the photo looks a little like you?”","She looked a little like her!","Qiao Nian suddenly realized why she felt a strange sense of familiarity.","“I found it strange back then.” Slim Waist Control muttered, “This Nie Qixing has a huge feud with you. He still hid such a person. He’s f*cking perverted!”"]},{"number":3271,"title":"Chapter 3271: Sister Nian: She’s Not Imitating Me","paragraphs":["Chapter 3271: Sister Nian: She’s Not Imitating Me","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened, but she only said, “It’s not that she looks like me.”","“Uh...”","Slim Waist Control took the phone away and zoomed in on the photo. The woman’s facial features were definitely not as stunning as Sun’s, but they were at least 50% similar.","For ordinary people, even a 30% similarity was considered fate.","This one was 50% similar.","And she said the woman did not look like her?","“Her eyes don’t look like yours, but her nose, mouth, and face shape look similar. The key is that she’s imitating your temperament.”","“No, she isn’t imitating me either.”","The woman in the photo was obviously imitating someone.","Qiao Nian didn’t explain herself. She only said, “Keep an eye on things on your end. Send me a message if anything happens.”","She seemed to have discovered a secret.","Even Nie Qingru might not know about this secret.","Qiao Nian then told him how to keep an eye on Nie Qixing. She also instructed him to be careful outside. If there was anything, he could call her. If he could not get her, he could call Ye Wangchuan.","Slim Waist Control agreed to every statement. In the end, he couldn’t help but mutter, “Boss, don’t you trust him too much?”","Previously, he had been sent by Qiao Nian to teach Ye Qichen and had stayed in the Ye family’s old residence for more than half a year. A few days ago, Qiao Nian had called him to Continent M to carry out a mission.","He knew well how the Ye family treated his big boss. They were just short of setting off firecrackers to welcome her into the family tree.","However, Slim Waist Control still felt that, although Qiao Nian was amazing in other aspects, she was still young and impulsive in relationships. What if she regretted it in the future...","Therefore, he mentioned this out of concern.","Unexpectedly, the girl’s reply was calm. “Yes, I trust him.”","“Alright, pretend I didn’t say anything.” Slim Waist Control was smart and immediately understood what she meant. She was set on this guy.","He wasn’t a gossipy shrew. He was simply concerned for her as an elder brother would for a younger sister. That’s why he gave her some advice.","Since Sun was smart and understood what he meant and expressed her attitude, he naturally had nothing more to say.","“Then I’ll continue keeping an eye on this side. Be careful yourself.”","“Sure.”","Qiao Nian had always been pretty cool. She wasn’t a chatterbox.","“Then I’ll hang up first. I’ll contact you later if there’s anything.” Slim Waist Control had known her for a long time, so he did not say more.","After hanging up, he looked at the white and inedible noodles in the bowl. After a long while, he threw the instant noodles into the nearby trash can with hatred.","Then, he gloomily grabbed a handful of his hair and leisurely walked to the roadside. He planned to buy another bowl of instant noodles and continue watching from another place.","* * *","On the other side.","Ye Wangchuan waited in front of the elevator for almost half an hour before he saw the girl slowly walking back.","He stood up straight and did not complain. He lowered his eyes slightly, showcasing his thick and long eyelashes, forming a wing-like shadow under his eyelids. “I’m done.”","Qiao Nian did not expect him to be waiting for her here. Stunned, she asked after a second, “You didn’t go up?”","“I was waiting for you.” Ye Wangchuan looked at the time on his watch.","27 minutes.","She had been on the phone for nearly half an hour. Something must have happened.","However, he did not ask Qiao Nian what had happened. Instead, he pressed the elevator button before asking, “Master Cheng and the rest have already gone up. What are you planning to eat for lunch?”","“Anything is fine.”","Qiao Nian was still distracted, thinking about the photo Slim Waist Control had sent her."]},{"number":3272,"title":"Chapter 3272: We Can Deal With Qiao Nian Together","paragraphs":["Chapter 3272: We Can Deal With Qiao Nian Together","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan could tell she was thinking about something and lowered his head slightly to look at the girl. His voice was low and gentle. “Everyone wants to celebrate. Master Cheng asked if you have anything you want to eat.”","Master Cheng’s intention was obviously to go along with Qiao Nian’s taste.","Qiao Nian came back to her senses. “I’m not picky.”","After she finished speaking, she saw the man raise his eyebrows in disbelief.","Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows and said speechlessly, “... As long as it’s not too spicy.”","Perhaps because a certain someone’s gaze was too focused, making her feel irritable, she paused again and explained with one hand in her pocket, “Master Cheng is old. It’s better for his health for him to eat less spicy food. I don’t have much of an appetite right now, so don’t worry about me.”","Noticing her serious expression, Ye Wangchuan retracted his eyes and smiled. “Alright.”","Qiao Nian nodded and thought about the photo again.","* * *","At the same time.","Nie Qingru returned to her residence.","When the car parked, the butler was already standing outside.","He said, “Empress, Elder Xue from the Privy Council is here.”","What did the conservatives want with her?","“Mm.”","Someone opened the door for her, and Nie Qingru slowly got out of the car. Then, she took off her hat, handed it to the butler, and strode towards the villa.","Her every step was steady, with an ambition that did not match her age. Even at this age, she was still hale and hearty.","Within minutes, she looked at the silver-haired old man sitting in the reception room waiting for her.","Elder Xue was still wearing a half-new Chinese tunic suit. One could tell from the design that the eastern elements were included. His clothes were neat, but he did not look like someone from the reclusive families.","He was too low-key!","Instead, he appeared hypocritical.","Nie Qingru walked past him and sat down on the sofa opposite him. She asked a servant to make a cup of coffee before looking at the person who should not be there.","“Is something the matter?”","She had always been at odds with the conservatives, so she was too lazy to put on an act.","Elder Xue watched as the servant brought her coffee. Without batting an eyelid, he pushed his teacup away and calmly said, “Empress, I heard that the results of the weapons exhibition are out. Your brother didn’t get first place, nor did he get Mr. Auburn’s favor.”","Having just picked up the coffee cup and as she was about to take a sip, Nie Qingru’s hand stilled. Her gaze instantly became sharp, and she immediately sneered. “Heh, what do you think this place is? Why? Are you here to mock me?”","It was not surprising for the Privy Council to hear about this, but she did not expect the other party to come to her and tell her this. It was a little too presumptuous!","Losing her appetite, she slammed the cup and placed her hands on the table. Leaning back and narrowing her eyes with condescending pressure, she reminded him coldly, “Don’t forget that the imperial power is above everything! Even you elders of the Privy Council don’t have the right to point fingers in front of me.”","Not wanting to look at the old thing who did not know what was good for him anymore, she instructed the butler, “What are you waiting for? Send the guest out!”","The butler was a little embarrassed. For a moment, he did not know how to approach the silver-haired old man. After all, he was one of the elders of the Privy Council.","The Empress could treat him disrespectfully, but the butler did not dare to chase him away with a stick.","Elder Xue did not expect such a big reaction. He was a little stunned and embarrassed. He immediately tried to persuade her.","“Empress, that’s not what I came for.","“I mean, we can deal with Qiao Nian together!”"]},{"number":3273,"title":"Chapter 3273: Keep an Eye on Qixing and Don’t Let Him Cause Trouble for Me","paragraphs":["Chapter 3273: Keep an Eye on Qixing and Don’t Let Him Cause Trouble for Me","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Oh?” As expected, Nie Qingru looked at him with a playful expression. “You want to deal with Qiao Nian?”","“Yes.” Elder Xue watched as she stared at him with a faint smile. He had always acted appropriately and calmly.","Nie Qingru gradually retracted her ridicule and calmly asked, “Why? Aren’t you close to her?”","Elder Xue frowned and pursed his lips. “Because she has affected the reclusive families’ reputation.”","“Oh? Just for this?” Nie Qingru did not quite believe him.","Elder Xue looked at her frankly and said in a deep voice, “Empress, there are many conflicts within the reclusive families, but to outsiders, we are a unit. I don’t want anyone to shake our foundation. This is also my principle and bottom line!”","His meaning was clear.","Qiao Nian’s existence had already begun to shake the reclusive families’ foundation. This was something he did not want to see.","Nie Qingru roughly understood what he meant and finally looked him in the eye. “How do you plan to deal with her?”","“My idea is...” Elder Xue naturally came up with an idea to discuss with her this time, so he told Nie Qingru his thoughts.","Nie Qingru did not immediately express whether this method was feasible. Instead, she revealed a thoughtful expression. “Let me think about it first.”","“Sure.” Elder Xue wasn’t in a hurry. He picked up the teacup.","He slowly blew away the foam and looked at the leaves floating in the tea. He thought of the girl’s unruly face. In the end, he sighed and lowered his head to take a sip.","Nie Qingru thought for about 10 minutes, but she still could not give him an answer. She said with a deep gaze, “Go back. I’ll discuss it with you after I’ve thought it through.”","Elder Xue had already been here for a long time. He tactfully stood up and did not disturb her anymore. “Then I’ll go back now, Empress.”","“Go.” Nie Qingru’s expression softened, and she forced herself to give him a good look.","The butler respectfully made a “please” gesture.","Elder Xue followed him.","After they left, the servants did not dare to disturb Nie Qingru. They quietly finished their work and left.","Only Nie Qingru was left sitting on the sofa in the living room. She picked up the indoor phone with her well-maintained hand and dialed a number.","The other end picked up instantly.","Nie Qingru put the receiver to her ear. Not letting the other person speak, she ordered in a low voice, “Keep an eye on Qixing for the next few days!","“... Before Qiao Nian leaves, don’t let him go out alone. I don’t have time to clean up his mess every day!”","“Yes, Your Majesty.”","Shadow was as loyal as ever.","Nie Qingru was slightly relieved. About to hang up, she paused and lowered her eyes. Then, she whispered, “Help me make an appointment with Master Cheng.”","The Empress wanted to make an appointment with Master Cheng?","Why did the Empress want to meet Master Cheng?","Shadow was puzzled, but he did not dare to disobey her order. “... Yes.”","This time, Nie Qingru directly hung up.","* * *","At the hotel.","Originally, Master Cheng had arranged for a simple celebration in the afternoon. However, too many media outlets wanted to interview him, so he could not take the time.","The celebration party was changed from noon to the following night.","In the end, the next afternoon, Master Cheng received Nie Qingru’s invitation for a meeting.","He had to discuss this with Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan first, so he immediately went looking for her."]},{"number":3274,"title":"Chapter 3274: Master Wang: Her Air Conditioner Is Good","paragraphs":["Chapter 3274: Master Wang: Her Air Conditioner Is Good","Editor: Atlas Studios","It was not that he didn’t want to look for Ye Wangchuan, but over the past few days, Master Cheng had understood that everyone went to Qiao Nian’s room when something happened.","He might not be able to find anyone in their respective rooms, but if he went to Qiao Nian’s room, he would most likely find them there.","Hence, Master Cheng couldn’t be bothered to trouble himself. He immediately went to Qiao Nian’s room.","Knock knock.","He knocked twice.","Soon, he heard footsteps from inside.","“Coming.”","Right on the heels of that, the door opened. Master Cheng was not surprised to see Qin Si. Looking over his shoulder, he immediately spotted Bo Zheng, Luo Qing, and the carefree master inside.","Master Cheng was speechless. He coughed dryly and said to the person blocking the door, “I’m looking for Qiao Nian.”","“Ah, looking for Sister Qiao.” Qin Si stepped aside with a smile. “She went out to get takeout and will be back soon. Master Cheng, come in first.”","There was no need for him to say anything. Master Cheng had already walked in.","Seeing the large group in the hotel room, he couldn’t help but ask the person who closed the door behind him, “There are so many of you. Why did you let a girl go get the takeout?”","What he meant was that they were all men, but it was actually the only girl who went out to get takeout. It was inappropriate.","Unexpectedly, Qin Si rubbed his nose and said frankly, “She insisted on going.”","“Young Master Qin, it’s all because you talk too much! You’ve been buzzing around Miss Qiao since you came. Miss Qiao couldn’t take it anymore and left to take a breather.” Luo Qing exposed his shortcomings straightforwardly, not leaving him any face.","Qin Si immediately blew his beard and widened his eyes. He looked around the room indignantly. “Is it because of me alone? Aren’t you all here too?!”","He snapped back, “Speaking of which, don’t you have a room yourself? Why did you all come to Sister Qiao’s room?”","Bo Zheng picked up a draft paper that Qiao Nian did not want to look at. Hearing this, he looked up and slowly said, “Luo Qing and I are here to discuss the return flight with her.”","Qin Si noticed the man sitting on the lazy sofa with a magazine on his lap. He looked like he had nothing to do. “Master Wang... are you also here to ask about the return flight?”","“Mm?”","Ye Wangchuan did not expect his question. He raised his eyes slightly and glanced at him with his deep eyes. Then, he lazily said, “No.”","“Then you are...” Qin Si was impatient.","Ye Wangchuan leaned back lazily. He was magnanimous... and shameless. “The air conditioner here is good.”","Qin Si did not expect such a nonsensical reason. He was filled with disdain. That was too shameless! How could he say such shameless words? He even said them calmly, as if they were real.","“What about you? What are you doing here?” Ye Wangchuan did not give him a chance to refute him. His words were concise and direct.","Qin Si walked around and the question returned to him.","He couldn’t answer himself. “I... I came... I came to take a look.”","Ye Wangchuan said sharply, “So you’re the only extra here!”","... Is your freeloading the air conditioner any more valid?","Qin Si only dared to think about it in his heart, but he did not dare to say it out loud, lest his face hurt from being taught a lesson. Hence, he shut his mouth resentfully."]},{"number":3275,"title":"Chapter 3275: Master Cheng Is Because of the Privy Council","paragraphs":["Chapter 3275: Master Cheng Is Because of the Privy Council","Editor: Atlas Studios","Master Cheng watched their bickering before walking over and saying to Ye Wangchuan, “Coincidentally, I was looking for you too.”","Master Cheng was an elder.","Ye Wangchuan politely stood up and gave up his seat. After forcing him to take his seat, he asked, “Why are you looking for me?”","Master Cheng was originally quite embarrassed to take his seat, but when asked about serious matters, he forgot about this small awkwardness and said seriously, “It’s not a big deal.”","At this moment, the sound of a door opening came from outside.","Because Master Cheng was immersed in his thoughts, he did not notice that Qiao Nian had returned. He continued, “Someone from the reclusive families contacted me and said the Empress wants to see me. From his voice, it seems he wants me to enter the Privy Council...”","The last part was his guess. The other party did not say it directly.","However, the hint was obvious.","It wasn’t that he was being narcissistic.","Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes. “Enter the Privy Council?”","At this moment, Qiao Nian walked in with the takeout and interrupted calmly, “They must have their eyes on the Tsar’s technology.”","There was another reason she did not mention.","It was easy to guess what Nie Qingru and the reclusive families were thinking. Other than seeing Master Cheng personally, they probably wanted to use Master Cheng’s safety as leverage to restrain her.","Once Master Cheng entered the Privy Council, Nie Qingru and the elders could use Master Cheng to negotiate with her in the future.","If she didn’t agree, they could further force her to lower her head by making use of Master Cheng.","Qiao Nian understood this, but she did not say it.","“Sister Qiao?” Qin Si turned around and saw her. His voice was loud and clear.","Qiao Nian held the takeout in one hand and took her baseball cap back to her seat with the other. She placed the takeout on the table and went to the fridge to get a bottle of ice water.","Master Cheng looked at her in surprise as the girl pulled out a chair and sat down handsomely. She unscrewed the bottle’s cap and gulped down two mouthfuls of water. Then, she screwed it again and put the bottle aside.","“They want to get the Tsar’s data from me?” Master Cheng looked a little angry.","Qiao Nian casually placed her hand on the table, looked at him, and calmly said, “We weakened 40% of the Tsar’s power for the weapons exhibition. Perhaps the people who attended the weapons exhibition are not fools. Many people can tell that the Tsar’s power is not limited to this.","“Under these circumstances, it’s normal for various factions to be tempted to get the Tsar’s technology for themselves.”","The First Research Institute had not produced advanced weapons in the past 20 years. In a way, not much progress had been made in weapons manufacturing in the past few years.","In such an environment, who would not want to take the Tsar for themselves when the originally inconspicuous Beijing suddenly appeared?","Didn’t Lu Zhi come from the illegal district to look for Master Cheng exactly because of the Tsar?","Even Lu Zhi wanted to get involved. Of course, the reclusive families also wanted to get involved with the Tsar.","Moreover, although this suggestion seemed an exception and gave Master Cheng huge honor and opportunity, it was actually a sure win for them.","“Hmph, they wish.” Master Cheng understood and became even angrier. He had no intention of entering the Privy Council at all. “The Ninth Branch spent so much money and time to develop the Tsar. I can’t reveal the confidential data. There’s no need to talk about the Privy Council or the reclusive families. At my age, I don’t care about these empty titles! If I did, I wouldn’t have returned to China back then.”"]},{"number":3276,"title":"Chapter 3276: They Look Down on People Too Much","paragraphs":["Chapter 3276: They Look Down on People Too Much","Editor: Atlas Studios","The opportunities he had in the past were no less than Feng Yu’s.","He was also considered famous in the physics world. Became famous in his early thirties.","Many forces extended olive branches to him, but he did not accept them. He resolutely returned from overseas and entered the Ninth Branch incognito.","All these years, he had slowly let go and no longer hid his past existence. He was respectfully addressed as Master Cheng by the domestic physics world.","However, no one knew about him in the first few years.","Hadn’t he made it anyway?","How could a person like him, buried in the soil to his neck, sell the Tsar’s data for a false reputation? It was too laughable!","“They think too highly of themselves and look down on our countrymen.”","Since Nie Qingru had proposed this invitation with such an intention, that was really too arrogant.","Qiao Nian was not surprised. “The reclusive families’ people are like this. No matter how they try, they can’t hide the arrogance in their bones. You’ll get used to it.”","Master Cheng still looked displeased. He forced a grunt and said, “Then I’ll reject them directly.”","“No need.” Qiao Nian thought for a moment and supported her chin with her hand, then slowly said, “If you reject them directly, they might cause trouble again. Delay it for now and wait for us to go back.”","They were in Continent M. Nie Qingru could use force to “invite” Master Cheng to meet her.","But they were about to leave.","Nie Qingru wouldn’t be able to do much when they returned to Beijing.","Master Cheng thought about it and felt that it was a good idea. Hence, he nodded and agreed trustingly. “Alright.”","They had probably discussed a countermeasure.","Bo Zheng asked where they would be having dinner tonight. “Shall we gather at the hotel tonight?”","Qin Si couldn’t interrupt earlier, and now only said, “I’m good with it.”","“Me too.” Luo Qing raised his hand.","The three of them looked at Master Cheng, Qiao Nian, and Ye Wangchuan for their opinions.","Qiao Nian remembered Ye Wangchuan telling her about the celebration party. Since they did not manage to have it yesterday, they had to do it today.","Hence, she nodded casually. “I’m fine too.”","Ye Wangchuan put his hands in his pockets and gracefully said, “I’ll tell the hotel staff to reserve a private room.”","Five-star hotels all had their own private rooms. It was fine as long as they booked it in advance.","This kind of thing that required connections was left to Ye Wangchuan.","Master Cheng’s gaze softened. Having already forgotten about Shadow’s call, he smiled and said, “Then I’ll inform the others that we’re having dinner at the restaurant on the 6th floor tonight.”","Of course, he was referring to the people from the Ninth Branch.","Qiao Nian wasn’t familiar with the others from the Ninth Branch and did not say anything.","Bo Zheng waited for Master Cheng to leave before taking the initiative to ask the girl, “The matter here has come to an end. When are we going back?”","A trace of surprise flashed across Qiao Nian’s eyes. She didn’t know why he asked her and not Ye Wangchuan, but after some thought, she said, “Tomorrow.”","After a pause, she added, “Early tomorrow morning.”","Since Nie Qingru and the Privy Council had set their sights on Master Cheng, she was afraid of an accident happening.","“Okay, I’ll make the arrangements.”","Bo Zheng was mainly in charge of their safety on this trip. He asked her for the time and told Luo Qing. The two of them discussed the details."]},{"number":3277,"title":"Chapter 3277: Ignore Him, He’s Satisfied With Love","paragraphs":["Chapter 3277: Ignore Him, He’s Satisfied With Love","Editor: Atlas Studios","Bo Zheng made a few calls and quickly decided on the time. He put down his phone and asked the girl, “Is nine in the morning okay?”","“Sure.” Qiao Nian grabbed the takeout and opened the box. The rich fragrance of red oil filled the room, increasing their appetites.","She found disposable chopsticks in the bag and tore them open. Then, she started eating.","Qiao Nian wasn’t a pretentious eater. Her speed was not slow, but she gave off a refined and calm feeling. She was quite serious.","Seeing that she had started eating, Qin Si took the initiative to say, “I’m hungry. I’m gonna grab something too. Which one of you wants to go with me?”","Luo Qing smelled the fragrant roast duck and also got hungry. Hence, he was the first to raise his hand. “Me.”","Bo Zheng wasn’t hungry like them. He looked down at the time on his watch and stood up, saying, “Let’s go together.”","The three of them made to leave.","However, before leaving, Bo Zheng remembered there was someone else and turned to him. “Aren’t you coming?”","Ye Wangchuan lazily placed his hand behind his head and replied, “Go ahead.”","Qin Si couldn’t stand his smug look, so he pulled Bo Zheng and angrily said, “Uncle Bo, ignore him. He’s satisfied with love.”","Their voices gradually faded, and the door closing sounded from the entrance. The lively room finally quietened down.","Only now did Ye Wangchuan walk up to the girl engrossed in her meal. He smiled. “Goddess Qiao, are you really going to let me drink love until I’m full?”","Qiao Nian did not even look up. She grabbed the remaining chopsticks in the bag and tossed them to him. Then, she pouted and casually said, “There’s a bowl in the bag. Take it yourself.”","Ye Wangchuan sat down opposite her. Sure enough, he saw another serving inside. It seemed prepared for him long ago and was just waiting for him to ask.","He raised his eyebrows. He did not mind that it was an ordinary takeout. He opened the box naturally and was a little surprised to see the neatly packed roast duck. “... Peking duck?”","There was actually a takeout of Peking duck in Continent M.","Qiao Nian had already finished her portion and was half full. She put down her chopsticks, unscrewed the water bottle, took a sip, and leaned back. “Slim Waist Control sent it over. I wonder where he found it.”","There was too little variety of food in Continent M. Other than steak, there was only salad. She would eat them occasionally, but she grew frustrated after eating them for consecutive days.","She didn’t know where Slim Waist Control found a restaurant selling authentic Peking duck, but it solved her problem.","Otherwise, she would starve to death here.","Slim Waist Control was here? Ye Wangchuan caught the main point and remembered the person who had called her while waiting for the elevator.","The chance was high he was one of the main members of the Red Alliance, Chen Chen’s computer teacher...","* * *","The next day.","9 a.m. flight.","Everyone woke up punctually at 7:30 a.m. They packed up and prepared to go to the airport.","Master Cheng was the oldest and woke up the earliest. He had breakfast with a few people from the Ninth Branch and packed his luggage while waiting for Qiao Nian and the rest to come down.","Qiao Nian didn’t have much to pack. She only brought a charging cable, a computer, and two sets of clothes. Soon, she tidied up her backpack and went to meet Master Cheng.","On the way, she bumped into Bo Zheng and Qin Si in the corridor. The three of them went down together.","In the elevator.","The chatterbox Qin Si asked Bo Zheng why Luo Qing wasn’t with him.","Bo Zheng said that Luo Qing was with Master Cheng and the others and was in charge of protecting Master Cheng. The next second, his phone rang."]},{"number":3278,"title":"Chapter 3278: Lend Me What You Brought","paragraphs":["Chapter 3278: Lend Me What You Brought","Editor: Atlas Studios","The signal was bad.","Bo Zheng frowned. He grabbed his cell phone and looked down. Seeing it was Luo Qing, he thought he was going to urge them to go down as he accepted the call. “I’m in the elevator. I’ll be down soon. Qiao Nian and Qin Si are also with me...”","Unexpectedly, before he could finish his sentence, a noise in the background interrupted him as Luo Qing’s panicked voice sounded. “No, Captain Bo, something happened to Master Cheng! Come quickly!”","“What did you say?!” Bo Zheng instantly became serious, and his tone grew anxious. “Where are you? I’ll be right there.”","Luo Qing told him the exact location.","Bo Zheng hung up with a livid expression. The first thing he did was look up at the floor number. They were on the 12th floor, and the elevator was still going down.","His reaction was so big, and they were in a sealed space. Even a fool could tell something was wrong.","Before Qin Si reacted...","Qiao Nian spoke first. “What happened? I think I heard Master Cheng’s name.”","Qin Si gasped and looked at Bo Zheng in shock.","Master Cheng? That’s impossible, right?","Bo Zheng’s face was ugly and his muscles were tense. He did not answer her directly and did not meet her eyes. He only said vaguely, “I don’t know the details. We’ll know when we get there.”","The elevator was quite fast.","A minute later, the elevator stopped steadily in the lobby on the first floor.","Bo Zheng quickly walked out in front. Qin Si and Qiao Nian followed behind him. The three of them barely spoke. Even Qin Si, who was used to joking, had a solemn expression.","Soon, they saw a circle of people in front of them.","Many onlookers and hotel security officers were outside. There were too many people, and Qiao Nian couldn’t tell anything from the outside.","She pushed through the crowd and said in a deep voice, “Please make way.”","Due to hereditary reasons, the people in Continent M were relatively tall. Qiao Nian’s height was not eye-catching. However, when the people she pushed turned around and saw her, they couldn’t help but obediently make way for her.","Qiao Nian, Qin Si, and the others squeezed through the crowd. The closer they got, the more she could smell the blood in the air.","The smell was as heavy as rust!","Her heart sank.","Qiao Nian’s eyes were fierce, and the corners of her mouth were pursed tighter and tighter. She pushed through the crowd as her hostility increased.","Finally, light appeared in front of them.","They finally squeezed into the middle of the crowd.","Jiang Tianzhi, Yu Wenhao, and a few others from the Ninth Branch formed a human wall and struggled to block the surrounding onlookers.","Among them, Jiang Tianzhi’s face was as red as a pig’s liver. He kept saying to the people trying to squeeze in, “Make way, everyone, make way. Let’s get some air inside!”","“Please move aside. Stop squeezing! Stop squeezing!”","However, basically no one listened to him. Those who should squeeze in were still squeezing in as if they were watching a show.","Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened. She turned to Bo Zheng and asked, “Do you have a gun?”","Bo Zheng did not expect her question, but after interacting with her for so long, he knew that Qiao Nian was not someone who would ask nonsense. After a short pause, he handed her the portable pistol at his waist.","“What are you going to—” use the gun for...?","Before he could finish his sentence, the girl took the gun from him and loaded it skillfully. Then, she raised the pistol to the sky and pulled the trigger!","Bang!","White smoke came out of the muzzle.","The sound of the gunshot at such a close distance was enough to shock everyone!"]},{"number":3279,"title":"Chapter 3279: I’ll Tell Gu San to Go Down Immediately","paragraphs":["Chapter 3279: I’ll Tell Gu San to Go Down Immediately","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, the girl did not even blink. She raised her head slightly, revealing a surly face. Her eyes seemed to be dyed black as she looked around and coldly said, “If anyone takes another step closer, I promise to shoot them next!”","This five-star hotel had the shadow of the reclusive families behind it. No one had ever caused trouble here, let alone fired a shot in public.","The noisy crowd instantly quietened down.","Even the people from the Ninth Branch were shocked by her, let alone the onlookers.","However, it had to be said that Qiao Nian’s shot was very intimidating. It was simple and crude. Those trying to squeeze in and refused to listen all retreated.","Jiang Tianzhi and the others suddenly felt much more relaxed. At least they were no longer pushed so hard that they could not stand steadily.","Qiao Nian returned the gun to Bo Zheng and continued forward expressionlessly.","“Miss Qiao.” Jiang Tianzhi reacted first upon seeing her. He said anxiously, “Master Cheng was stabbed.”","He did not need to say anything.","Qiao Nian had already seen Master Cheng and Luo Qing behind the human wall.","Master Cheng held his abdomen on the ground, which was covered in blood. It was unknown how much blood he had bled to wet the ground.","Luo Qing squatted beside him. He tore off the fabric of his T-shirt and pressed it against Master Cheng’s wound. His forehead was covered in cold sweat, and his face was pale. It was obvious he was extremely anxious.","“Master Cheng, hold on!”","Seeing he was about to lose consciousness, Luo Qing was so anxious that blisters appeared in his mouth.","Fortunately, he looked up and saw Qiao Nian, Bo Zheng, and the rest. As if seeing his saviors, he quickly shouted, “Miss Qiao, Captain Bo, he’s about to die...”","Qiao Nian had already squatted down and checked Master Cheng’s pulse without a word.","Master Cheng’s heart was beating slowly. He had already fallen into a semi-conscious state. This situation was not good.","She quickly placed her shoulder bag on the ground, unzipped it, and took out the small bottle of chewing gum she carried. Opening the bottle, she realized there were no more small pills inside.","Only then did she remember that she had already used up the last small pill for Master Cheng to sober up yesterday.","“Did you call an ambulance?”","“I did.” Luo Qing sounded defeated. “But it’s not here yet.”","Qiao Nian did not say anything. She got up and called Ye Wangchuan.","The other party picked up instantly.","She briefly explained what happened before saying, “I’m afraid they will deliberately delay the ambulance. Think of a way to get the ambulance here faster.”","Ye Wangchuan was making arrangements with Beijing, so he came down a few minutes later. Hearing this, his tone grew heavy. “Leave this to me. How’s Master Cheng’s situation?”","Qiao Nian looked at Luo Qing, who had barely helped Master Cheng with an emergency according to her method. “I finished using up the small pills yesterday. The situation... isn’t good.”","Ye Wangchuan could hear the impatience in her tone. He told her not to be anxious and said, “I’ll tell Gu San to go down immediately.”","“Mm.”","Qiao Nian hung up. After some thought, she called Slim Waist Control.","10 minutes later.","A young man with hair akin to bird feathers rode a motorcycle he got from somewhere and rushed to the hotel. He ignored the security officers and barged in.","“I’m sorry, I have something urgent to attend to.”","“Stop, you’re not allowed to enter! Register first!”","“I told you, it’s an emergency.”","Slim Waist Control was agile and the security officers could not do anything to him. They could only chase after him and keep telling him to stop."]},{"number":3280,"title":"Chapter 3280: Someone Help Me Hold Master Cheng","paragraphs":["Chapter 3280: Someone Help Me Hold Master Cheng","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian had fired a shot previously, which was enough to suppress most of the people who wanted to watch the show.","Many people could tell that she was not to be trifled with. They were afraid of getting into trouble, so they stopped watching and pulled their friends far away.","Therefore, not many people were surrounding Master Cheng.","Slim Waist Control passed through the lobby and turned into the corridor Qiao Nian told him about. Soon, he spotted them around the corner and immediately ran towards them.","“Boss!”","The bird feathers on his head were too bright. Jiang Tianzhi and the others immediately became vigilant.","At this moment, Qiao Nian patted Jiang Tianzhi’s shoulder from behind and said to Luo Qing, “He’s my man.”","The vigilance in Luo Qing’s eyes instantly dissipated by more than half. He silently let Slim Waist Control pass through.","“Here’s what you wanted.”","Slim Waist Control quickly passed a bag to the girl.","Only now did everyone notice he was carrying a plastic bag. It looked like there was something inside the crumpled plastic bag.","Qiao Nian took the plastic bag and opened it to check the contents. It was the ones she had asked him to bring over. Hence, she turned around and squatted beside Master Cheng.","She called out softly.","Master Cheng’s consciousness was blurry, but it was obvious he was struggling to hold on. His lips gently opened as if he wanted to struggle. “No, I’m not going to the hospital.”","“My... my bag.”","“Got... the bag.”","He had been saying this since his consciousness grew blurry.","Qiao Nian’s heart tightened, and an indescribable feeling surged in her chest. She leaned over and checked the body temperature of the almost unconscious old man.","It was boiling hot.","Under such circumstances, a person should basically be completely unconscious.","But he kept talking.","It was obvious he was relying on his willpower and his concern about this matter. It was too important, so he forced himself not to fall into a coma.","“The bag...”","Qiao Nian heard his muffled voice and knew what he was worried about.","Master Cheng’s luggage contained the Tsar’s modeling data. He was afraid the data would fall into the villain’s hands.","“Deputy Captain Luo is here. No one touched your luggage.”","Master Cheng was going to the washroom when an accident happened.","Originally, Luo Qing had been following him. However, the washroom wasn’t far. Furthermore, Master Cheng was going to the washroom, so Luo Qing was too embarrassed to insist on following him.","Who knew that an accident would happen!","Qiao Nian had already seen the surveillance footage.","That person was very arrogant. He only wore a hat and mask to cover his face. Then, when Master Cheng came out of the washroom, he rushed forward and stabbed him in the abdomen.","Then, he pulled out his knife and ran away without looking back.","It happened very suddenly. Many people were around. Everyone was stunned and forgot to arrest the man.","It was also because this happened in public that many onlookers quickly gathered.","As a result, Jiang Tianzhi and the others could not chase them away no matter what.","Qiao Nian looked at the semi-conscious old man mumbling about his ‘bag’. It seemed that life and death were not as important to him as the data in his luggage.","Qiao Nian pursed her lips and stopped talking. She quickly grabbed the bag Slim Waist Control passed her and took out its contents: alcohol, gauze, needle drip, and so on.","Nobody knew how Slim Waist Control had obtained these things and rushed to the hotel in such a short time.","Qiao Nian grabbed a cotton swab and bit open the cap of the alcohol bottle. Then, she turned around and called out in a low voice, “Someone help me hold down Master Cheng!”"]},{"number":3281,"title":"Chapter 3281: Sister Nian Does Emergency Bandage on Master Cheng","paragraphs":["Chapter 3281: Sister Nian Does Emergency Bandage on Master Cheng","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qin Si walked over without hesitation. “I’ll do it.”","Qiao Nian squatted and said with a determined gaze, “Remember, you must hold Master Cheng down firmly and not let him move. Can you do that?”","Qin Si nodded. “Don’t worry, Sister Qiao.”","Qiao Nian poured some alcohol on his hands to wash and disinfect them. Then, she asked him to help her press Master Cheng’s hands and feet. Looking at the hideous wound on his abdomen, she gritted her teeth and poured the alcohol on it.","“Ah!”","The skin and flesh of the wound washed by alcohol turned white, and blood mixed with alcohol flowed to the ground. The piercing pain was definitely not something ordinary people could endure.","As expected, the semi-conscious Master Cheng instinctively struggled.","Qiao Nian quickly said, “Hold him down!”","“Okay.” Qin Si sweated profusely as he grabbed Master Cheng’s hands and feet tightly and said in a low voice, “Then what, Sister Qiao?”","A thin layer of sweat formed on Qiao Nian’s forehead as she quickly put the alcohol bottle aside and got the gauze from the bag. Then, she concisely said, “I’ll bandage him.”","Time was tight. She had to do the most basic emergency procedure on Master Cheng before the ambulance arrived!","The longer the wound was exposed to air, the higher the risk of infection and inflammation.","With Master Cheng’s age and his usual poor health, it would be fatal if his wound got infected.","So, she couldn’t wait.","Bo Zheng saw their actions and immediately went over. “I’ll help too.”","Qiao Nian asked him to disinfect his hands first, then asked him to help stop the bleeding with gauze. Next, she got the needles and IV from the bag.","After assembling the tools, she squatted down, found the blood vessels on the back of Master Cheng’s hand, and inserted the needle. Then, she hung up the IV drip.","Qiao Nian was extremely calm throughout the entire process, controlling the terrible situation step by step.","Ye Wangchuan arrived at this moment.","“Helicopter’s here.”","Gu San also brought people carrying stretchers and specialized medical staff.","The doctor was slightly surprised when he saw that the patient had been bandaged and given the IV drip.","“Who did this? Do you have a doctor here?”","However, the situation was urgent and he did not have time to ask further. He immediately called for the others. “Quick, carry the patient to the helicopter.”","The two medical staff gently placed Master Cheng on the stretcher. Then, they lifted the stretcher together and rushed out.","Gu San followed them and said to Ye Wangchuan and Qiao Nian, “Master Wang, Miss Qiao, I’ll follow Master Cheng to the hospital.”","Bo Zheng patted his shoulder. “I’ll go too.”","Gu San was a little hesitant. “This...”","However, Bo Zheng insisted. He turned to Luo Qing and said, “Stay behind and help Miss Qiao and the others find out who’s behind Master Cheng’s assassination attempt.”","Luo Qing felt extremely guilty about not protecting Master Cheng well. At this arrangement, he had no objections at all. His rough face expressed guilt as he replied, “Yes, Captain Bo, don’t worry. I’ll definitely catch that person!”","Bo Zheng nodded and patted his back silently, indicating he shouldn’t blame himself too much.","Luo Qing’s lips moved. He didn’t say anything, but he felt terrible inside.","How could he not blame himself!","If anything happened to a national treasure like Master Cheng under his watch, he would never be able to forgive himself in this lifetime!"]},{"number":3282,"title":"Chapter 3282: Tell Me More About the Situation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3282: Tell Me More About the Situation","Editor: Atlas Studios","The people from the Ninth Branch also gathered. Among them, Jiang Tianzhi took the initiative to stand up. “I also want to follow.”","Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows and turned to Ye Wangchuan. “How many of you are there?”","“Two crew members and three medical staff.” He glanced at Bo Zheng and Gu San and counted them in. “There are a total of seven people now.”","Qiao Nian had a rough idea.","She turned around and said to the tall man, “The helicopter can only seat seven to eight people. Including Master Cheng, there are already eight people.”","Jiang Tianzhi looked dejected and clenched his fists. However, he also understood that Qiao Nian was not targeting them. In this situation, it was much more useful for Gu San and Bo Zheng to accompany Master Cheng than for researchers like them!","“I... I understand.”","Qiao Nian looked at him as he walked back dejectedly and noticed the worried expressions of the others from the Ninth Branch. She thought before saying to his back, “When Master Cheng settles down in the hospital, I’ll arrange for a car to send you there. Just wait for now.”","Jiang Tianzhi did not expect this.","Even at such a moment, Qiao Nian was still willing to consider their feelings. He immediately turned around with gratitude in his eyes. He suppressed his emotions before saying sincerely, “Thank you, Miss Qiao.”","Bo Zheng and Gu San did not dare to delay and had already followed the crew and doctor to board the helicopter. The helicopter then took off.","Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened when she heard the sound of the fanning blades. When she looked again, her gaze had become surly, and her entire temperament had changed.","Qin Si’s heart thumped.","He had seen Qiao Nian like this before.","Every time Sister Qiao revealed such a look and expression, it meant that someone was going to suffer!","This time... should be no exception.","Qiao Nian licked her dry lips and walked up to Luo Qing. “Tell me about the situation again.”","Everyone’s eyes fell on them.","Luo Qing’s expression was as if he had experienced the vicissitudes of life. He stood there, his lips trembling slightly. After a long time, he finally dared to look into Qiao Nian’s eyes. His voice was dry and hoarse. “Master Cheng and I came down to wait for you after breakfast. Then, Master Cheng went to the washroom.","“I thought the washroom wasn’t far, so I didn’t follow him.","“And then... it was what you saw.”","Luo Qing grabbed his hair and looked up. His eyes were bloodshot as he blamed himself. “When I rushed over, Master Cheng was already lying in a pool of blood. I saw that person’s back and wanted to chase after him, but... there were too many people around, and I didn’t dare to leave Master Cheng alone. In addition, that person ran away quickly and seemed very familiar with the hotel. He disappeared into the crowd in a few moves! By the time the others from the Ninth Branch chased after him, there was no one outside.”","Jiang Tianzhi and the others immediately chased after that person after arriving at the scene.","However, that person was too fast. There was no one there when they got outside.","The streets were filled with cars and pedestrians of all shapes and sizes. It was impossible to tell who was suspicious.","“What about the other party’s appearance? Do you remember?”","Luo Qing shook his head stiffly. “I only saw his back. From that, I can tell he’s a young man not more than 40 years old. He’s between 1.80 to 1.85 meters tall, and I couldn’t see his hair color. He was wearing a hat, and his entire body was covered tightly. Not a single piece of skin on his hands and neck was exposed.”"]},{"number":3283,"title":"Chapter 3283: Sister Nian’s Angry","paragraphs":["Chapter 3283: Sister Nian’s Angry","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qin Si immediately cursed!","It was impossible to lock onto the assassin just by relying on this.","The other party was smart.","Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes. He was not as frustrated and angry as the others as he tilted his head at the girl and lazily asked, “What do you think?”","Qiao Nian tilted her head and let out a low laugh. Her eyes were cold. “They might think I have to have evidence before I act.”","In the past few times, no matter what she did, she would throw the evidence at the other party’s face and make them speechless before settling the score with them.","Now these people thought she would only take action if she had evidence.","However, they seemed to have forgotten she was from the illegal district.","Be it the illegal district or Continent F, it was never a reasonable place!","Fists were the hard truth.","A disobedient child would become sensible after a few beatings.","If they were still disobedient...","Qiao Nian’s eyes turned dark. She suddenly smiled disdainfully and said in a low voice, “What if I don’t this time?”","What if she didn’t wait till she had evidence?","There was no need for a reason either.","She wanted to pursue the matter.","What could Nie Qingru and the reclusive families do to her?","Slim Waist Control touched the ear stud and asked softly, “Boss, which do you think it is? The old one or the young one?”","“To be honest, both possibilities are high. After all, they don’t get along with you. Perhaps... it might even be a third person we didn’t notice.”","As he spoke, he stole a glance at Qiao Nian.","F*ck! In that case, Sun was quite hated. Why were so many people unable to bear to see Sun doing well and causing all kinds of trouble?","That person did not even let an old man off. Their methods were even more despicable than theirs in the illegal district.","To think these people prided themselves on being upper-class people and reclusive families... When they did things, they had no bottom line compared to people from all walks of life.","“What do you plan to do?” Ye Wangchuan understood Qiao Nian’s thoughts the most. He didn’t ask who she suspected but asked her directly what she planned to do.","He would cooperate with whatever Qiao Nian wanted to do.","He would help her even if she wanted to tear the sky off Continent M.","Qiao Nian’s mind raced. After a short consideration, she thought of something. “Doesn’t Nie Qingru cherish her reputation the most?","“Back then, she could sacrifice Ji Qing for benefits. What if the same situation happens? Will she also sacrifice Nie Qixing for benefits?”","Ye Wangchuan was standing behind her. Hearing this, he only lowered his head and chuckled.","Then, he said in a low and mellow voice, “Alright, I also want to see what she’ll choose.”","**","The next half of the day was peaceful.","Apart from the sudden incident at the hotel where the various delegations were staying this time...","Continent M was as calm as water, as if nothing had happened.","Regardless of whether Qiao Nian was from Beijing, she was uncharacteristically quiet this time. There was no reaction from her at all.","This kind of silence was no different from the calm before the storm. Instead, it was even more nerve-racking than a huge reaction... At least if Qiao Nian reacted, the mastermind behind the scenes could counter every move and know what to do next.","However, there was no movement from Qiao Nian and the others. The hotel was also extremely calm.","They didn’t even request to check the surveillance footage!","Besides Qiao Nian and the others not leaving, and Master Cheng seemed to not have been heavily injured, they couldn’t find any information on this matter at all."]},{"number":3284,"title":"Chapter 3284: Don’t You Know What You Did?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3284: Don’t You Know What You Did?","Editor: Atlas Studios","The Empress’s villa.","Nie Qingru had been receiving endless messages since early in the morning.","“Empress, Qiao Nian fired at the hotel.”","“Empress, the Bright Gate people have arranged for a helicopter to land at the hotel.”","“Empress, I’ve investigated thoroughly. It was Master Cheng from Beijing who was suddenly stabbed outside the restroom. It’s unknown if he’s dead or alive.”","Every piece of news hit Nie Qingru’s heart like a drum. As more and more news came, her face turned more pale. She asked someone to find Nie Qixing.","During this time, she also waited for Qiao Nian and Beijing’s reaction.","However, from morning to noon, the hotel was extremely quiet.","She thought Qiao Nian would check the surveillance footage. She even specially sent someone to destroy the surveillance cameras at the nearby intersection and clean up all the clues that could be found to ensure that Qiao Nian wouldn’t be able to find anything even if she had extraordinary abilities.","Nie Qixing finally arrived when she was done.","He was still in the wheelchair and looked no different from usual. “Sis, you were looking for me?”","Shadow was standing behind the sofa where Nie Qingru was sitting. He had his head lowered and did not dare to speak.","Nie Qixing acted as if nothing had happened. He even took the initiative to ask the Empress why she was looking for him.","Anxiety brewed between his brows as he looked at Nie Qixing, then at Nie Qingru. He opened his mouth to remind Nie Qixing of something...","But it was too late.","The woman sitting elegantly on the sofa and arranging for her subordinates to destroy the evidence suddenly stood up and ran over. Without a word, she slapped him hard.","Slap!","Everyone in the villa heard the crisp sound.","Nie Qixing’s head was slapped to the left, and his ears buzzed. The huge impact even tore the corner of his lip, and the smell of rust immediately surged in his mouth...","The next second, he felt a stinging pain in his cheek. It quickly grew swollen and hot. He could feel the side of his face swelling without touching it with his hand.","“Empress!” Shadow finally reacted. He hurried over to stop her as Nie Qingru tried the second slap and begged, “Young Master Qi has just been saved from the gates of hell. His body has not recovered yet. Please calm down, don’t be angry.”","Shadow stopped her with all his might, but Nie Qingru’s face was ashen. She was furious. “If I had known earlier that he was like this, I would have let him die in Continent F. Why would I save him!”","Shadow had no choice but to beg her. “Calm down. Young Master Qi is still young, after all. It’s normal for him to be ignorant...”","These words hit Nie Qingru’s sore spot. Although she had no intention of hitting him anymore, her expression was not good. “He’s young? He’s already in his thirties. I don’t want to compare him to anyone, but how old is that Qiao Nian? She’s only 20. He can’t even compare to half of her!”","Nie Qixing paled when he heard that. He suddenly looked at Nie Qingru and grabbed the armrest of the wheelchair. “So, what did I do? Why are you so angry?”","Shadow did not expect him to add fuel to the fire. He quickly turned around and shouted at him, “Young Master Qi, stop talking!”","But it was too late.","Nie Qingru’s anger, which had finally subsided, was easily ignited. She turned around and stared at him with a mocking expression. “You don’t know what you’ve done?”"]},{"number":3285,"title":"Chapter 3285: Fortunately, You Only Targeted Master Cheng","paragraphs":["Chapter 3285: Fortunately, You Only Targeted Master Cheng","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qixing’s heart skipped a beat, but he managed to stay calm. He looked into her eyes and said, “I don’t know.”","“Empress, Young Master Qi hasn’t recovered yet.” Shadow tried his best to stop Nie Qingru with a pleading tone.","However, how could Nie Qingru listen to him in her anger? She immediately shook off his hand and ordered, “Move!”","Shadow saw she was really angered. He nervously let her go.","Nie Qingru wasn’t so patient. The moment he moved aside, she quickly walked to Nie Qixing. She was so angry that she laughed. “If you don’t know why I called for you, do you know what happened at the hotel where the delegations are staying?”","Nie Qixing’s guess was right.","He saw Shadow shaking his head as a silent hint.","He pretended not to see it and forced himself to say, “I don’t know. What happened at the hotel?”","Nie Qingru narrowed her eyes. Her sharp gaze seemed to be able to see through him. She said word by word, “Don’t you know that Master Cheng was stabbed in public and the perpetrator ran away?”","Nie Qixing’s heart beat like a drum. He grabbed the wheelchair with a surprised expression. “What? Master Cheng was stabbed?”","Then, he pursed his lips and looked at Nie Qingru sincerely. “... I really didn’t know about this.”","Shadow did not dare to look at Nie Qingru’s face. He could only look at Nie Qixing with anxiety and disappointment.","Why was Young Master Qi so muddle-headed?","Since the Empress had urgently called him over, how could she not guess he was the one behind it!","He might as well admit it straightforwardly. Perhaps the Empress would not be so angry and... disappointed.","However, he thought he was smart and played dumb under such circumstances.","Wasn’t this... clearly treating the Empress as a fool?","Nie Qingru took a deep breath, and the cold air poured into her lungs. Under the stimulation of extreme anger and disappointment, she began to feel light-headed. Her old migraine acted up again, and it became difficult for her to breathe.","She simply sat back down and did not even look at the person in the wheelchair.","“Do you think admitting to it matters?”","Nie Qixing opened his mouth but did not say a thing.","Nie Qingru snorted. “I’ve already cleaned up your mess. As long as she can’t find any evidence, she probably... won’t do anything to you.”","Actually, even though she said this, she did not have much confidence.","Qiao Nian had always been generous.","She had also seen how rebellious the other party was. Logically speaking, Qiao Nian wouldn’t cause trouble if she couldn’t find evidence.","However, Nie Qingru also knew that Qiao Nian didn’t do things according to logic all the time.","What if she didn’t play by the rules this time...","Nie Qingru could only tell herself not to think negatively. She straightened her shawl and said lightly, “Fortunately, you only targeted Master Cheng.","“Master Cheng can’t even be considered her teacher. Naturally, he can’t compare to the Jiang Weishang you targeted last time... However, you caused too much trouble this time. It’s fine if Master Cheng doesn’t die. If he does die... Even if she doesn’t pursue this matter, the Ninth Branch will probably pursue it.”","Qiao Nian was already difficult enough to deal with, but Nie Qixing still wanted to provoke Ye Wangchuan.","Nie Qingru did not know what to say to him.","Shadow quickly changed the topic. “But Empress, other than sending Master Cheng to the hospital for emergency treatment, there’s no reaction from them. This is too illogical!”","It was mainly because it didn’t match Qiao Nian’s personality."]},{"number":3286,"title":"Chapter 3286: Sister Nian Makes a Move","paragraphs":["Chapter 3286: Sister Nian Makes a Move","Editor: Atlas Studios","“This is Continent M...” Nie Qingru could only think of this reason. However, even she herself did not believe it.","Nie Qixing added, “What’s there to worry about? This is our territory, not her Continent F!”","Nie Qingru looked over and saw the unconcealed disgust and contempt on his face. The migraine that had finally subsided began to hurt again.","Seeing this, Shadow quickly interrupted, “By the way, Empress, the news of Master Cheng’s attack has already spread throughout the hotel. As the leader of this weapons exhibition, should we send someone to visit him?”","Nie Qingru thought of the hidden but unpredictable young man in the Beijing team. Her eyelids twitched and she raised her hand to instruct him. “Go to my storeroom, get a few expensive gifts, and send them over. Make it sound better.”","“Yes.”","Shadow understood what she meant.","The Empress wanted to take advantage of this opportunity and give them some gifts to express their concern. In addition, it could be considered a disguised goodwill, and she hoped that the other party would not pursue the matter.","He was about to do it.","Nie Qingru stopped him again. “Wait.”","Shadow stopped and turned around. “Empress, do you have any other instructions?”","Nie Qingru tapped the table lightly, feeling an indescribable uneasiness and frustration in her heart. She frowned and thought for a moment. “Ask them if they need our help. If they do, transfer our experts to them.”","Shadow quickly looked up at her and immediately lowered his head. “Yes, I’ll do it right away.”","Nie Qixing waited for him to leave before saying in confusion, “Sister, isn’t he just a master of physics from Beijing? Is there a need for us to do this?”","Nie Qingru was annoyed just by looking at him, and her face was full of displeasure. “You think I’m doing this to save him?”","Nie Qixing stopped talking, but his hair covered his eyes, and he clenched his fists.","This was Continent M. He did not believe Qiao Nian would dare to fall out with them for Master Cheng.","Nie Qingru wasn’t in the mood to care about him. She didn’t even look at him as she thought what Qiao Nian would do.","* * *","The answer to this question quickly surfaced.","Yesterday, when Shadow returned from the hotel with a gift, Nie Qingru was still unsure what Qiao Nian wanted to do.","But when the Privy Council came looking for her, she quickly knew what Qiao Nian was thinking.","Nie Qingru’s car drove into the Privy Council’s branch in Continent M. Along the way, people bowed and greeted her.","Nie Qingru ignored all of them and quickly walked inside. After passing through the deep corridor, she finally arrived at a large door.","Without having to be instructed, Shadow immediately went forward to open the door.","The double doors opened, and the light inside shone on her.","Nie Qingru walked in against the light. Her eyes adapted and she soon saw the elders of the Privy Council sitting at the round conference table.","Under everyone’s gaze, she expressionlessly walked to the seat of honor and sat down.","The door of the parliament hall closed.","“Empress, your coffee.” A servant brought her coffee and placed it beside her before gently retreating.","Nie Qingru picked up the porcelain-white cup and blew on it. Before she could drink, someone couldn’t hold it in anymore and took the initiative to attack—","“Empress, for the past two days, rumors that Young Master Nie has a woman outside are being spread... Is this true?”","To be precise...","This rumor had been circulating since yesterday.","For some reason, it quickly spread throughout the upper-class circle of Continent M."]},{"number":3287,"title":"Chapter 3287: Qiao Nian Seems to Be Qualified to Succeed the Position","paragraphs":["Chapter 3287: Qiao Nian Seems to Be Qualified to Succeed the Position","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qingru knew they had called her over for this matter, so she was not flustered.","As the other party spoke, she lowered her head and sipped the coffee. Then, she slowly put down the cup and said disdainfully, “Does the Privy Council have nothing to do? You’re so free that you even have to care about such a small matter!”","Her attitude was extremely unyielding!","Under normal circumstances, with her status, no one would dare to offend her if she intended to protect Nie Qixing.","But it was different this time!","The person who spoke did not care about her domineering question at all. Instead, he frowned and said with a serious expression, “You once said that you wanted him to be the successor. If he’s just a Nie family member, the Privy Council certainly wouldn’t care about such things, but if he wants to inherit your position, then we certainly have to.”","Nie Qingru slammed the table with a dark face. “How dare you!”","She looked around the round table. Her gaze paused on the archbishop and the others before landing on the speaker. It was as sharp as a knife. “Don’t forget that the imperial power is above all power! Even the Privy Council has no right to question my decision!”","She took a deep breath and calmed down, then coldly said, “Besides, apart from Qixing, who else is suitable to take over my position?”","The parliament hall was silent.","At this moment...","“Heh.” Someone chuckled casually.","Then, Nie Qingru’s pupils constricted. A middle-aged man in a red robe stood up and faced her.","“Empress, have you forgotten someone?”","Nie Qingru seemed to realize who he was referring to.","Her face immediately fell.","Quentin wouldn’t take her pressure as a threat. He smiled and said, “If I remember correctly, the Ji family has a direct descendant related to you by blood. Qiao Nian. She’s also qualified to inherit your position.”","The parliament hall was in an uproar.","“Qiao Nian is the Empress’s granddaughter?”","“That’s right. Someone’s already said she’s a direct descendant of the Ji family— If she’s a direct descendant, doesn’t that mean she’s the Empress’s—”","Everyone knew Nie Qingru had a sore spot that could not be mentioned. That was the past of her marriage with the Ji family of the independent continent when she was young.","All of this was replayed. Those discussions were like steel knives stabbing into her heart, forcing her to face the past again.","“Enough.”","She had just spoken when an unexpected person stood up for her. “Archbishop, I’m afraid Qiao Nian isn’t suitable, right?”","Elder Xue suddenly spoke up for Nie Qingru, and the discussions in the parliament hall gradually stopped. Everyone looked at him in disbelief.","Even the conservative faction he belonged to looked at him strangely.","Everyone knew that Elder Xue and the Empress did not get along.","However, on this matter, Elder Xue stood on Nie Qingru’s side. “Although she’s qualified to inherit the Empress’s position, she has been wandering outside all this time and has yet to be truly recognized by the Ji family. She has yet to be recorded in the family tree. Under such circumstances, she can’t be considered to have truly inherited the Ji family’s bloodline, so she’s not the Empress’s granddaughter.”","They were clearly related by blood, but he easily erased this connection by citing she was not officially in the family tree.","Nie Qingru’s expression softened and she added, “She’s not suitable to take over the reclusive families.”","Quentin did not expect them to stand together and sneered. He did not give Nie Qingru much face and asked, “Then is Young Master Nie suitable?”"]},{"number":3288,"title":"Chapter 3288: The Show Has Just Begun","paragraphs":["Chapter 3288: The Show Has Just Begun","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qingru’s face frosted over as she glared at him.","If Quentin had been afraid of her, he wouldn’t have stood on the neutral side for so many years. “You indeed have the imperial power, but don’t forget that the Privy Council has the right to oversee. Even the Empress has to be supervised by the Privy Council! The reclusive families are not your property alone.”","Nie Qingru naturally understood that the reclusive families represented the interests of hundreds of families.","Seeing that the people in the parliament hall were starting to talk again, she had no choice but to take a step back. “I’ll give you an explanation.”","It was not a big deal that Nie Qixing was exposed to having a private woman.","However, the problem was that not only had he lost Country M’s first place at the weapons exhibition, but he had also been discovered entering and leaving the hotel where that woman was staying...","One couldn’t help but think that he was a playboy who lost his ambition and couldn’t be of much use!","This was more fatal than scandals like illegally owning a laboratory and participating in a gray business clubhouse. At the very least, it accurately dealt a blow to whether Nie Qixing could inherit her position.","Nie Qixing’s scandal was enough to make these people unhappy.","If she hadn’t suppressed the news of Nie Qixing’s disability and told the public that his eye and leg still had a chance of recovering...","The Privy Council would have turned hostile long ago.","Now that Nie Qixing had caused this scandal so close to the weapons exhibition... Nie Qingru’s temples throbbed, and she couldn’t help but press the space between her eyebrows.","Almost at the same time, she thought of the person behind this—Qiao Nian!","She knew this evil creature wouldn’t know its place and would definitely take revenge on her.","As expected!","Fortunately, this matter was neither big nor small. As long as she found that woman and dealt with her, she would be able to give the Privy Council an explanation.","**","“Nie Qingru has already come out of the Privy Council. There’s a high chance she will immediately deal with the people in the hotel and clean up Nie Qixing’s mess.”","Ye Wangchuan ordered someone to keep an eye on their every move. Of course, he could receive the news immediately.","As soon as Nie Qingru’s car left the Privy Council, he immediately found out from the hotel.","At this moment, the girl was sitting on the chair with her cap pressed down. She was spinning a pen in her hand. The black pen spun nimbly between her fingers, making her feel quite frustrated.","“This is just the beginning.”","What she wanted was for Nie Qingru to make a choice.","Between Nie Qixing and her reputation and future, which one did she want more?","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows. He knew her very well. “Do you want Gu San to remind Nie Qixing?”","The pen landed on the table. As if tired of playing, she leaned her head back. “Yes, remind him.”","“Okay.” Ye Wangchuan sent Gu San a message asking him to remind Nie Qixing that Nie Qingru was about to go to the hotel to look for the woman.","Then, he naturally bent down to pick up the pen and put it back on the pen holder. His gaze was deep, and the girl’s cold face was reflected in his eyes.","“Have you thought it through this time?”","Qiao Nian subconsciously looked up and met his deep eyes. She immediately understood what he was asking her. “I’ve thought it through.”","She leaned against the back of the chair. She was very relaxed, but her eyes were like a cold lake that could not be melted. A faint mist shrouded them. “I gave him a chance. He has a death wish. I can only fulfill his wish!”","She wouldn’t let Nie Qixing off this time.","After all, Nie Qixing had a death wish.","She wanted to see the same situation happen again. Was her younger brother more important than her daughter? Or would she always be the most important person in her heart?"]},{"number":3289,"title":"Chapter 3289: It’s Too Late to Regret Now","paragraphs":["Chapter 3289: It’s Too Late to Regret Now","Editor: Atlas Studios","At the same time.","In the presidential suite where Slim Waist Control was waiting outside, Zhou Zheng received a mysterious call and quickly walked back.","The presidential suite was large and luxuriously decorated. There were cashmere carpets everywhere. In a corner of the brown leather sofa, Nie Qixing sat in a wheelchair, thinking about something.","Zhou Zheng did not dare to look further. He walked over and lowered his head. “Young Master Qi, someone just called me and said that your sister is coming our way.”","“What?” Nie Qixing looked up at him.","Only then did Zhou Zheng notice that the swollen palm print on the left side of his face had not disappeared. It was obvious he had been slapped.","He did not dare to look further and immediately lowered his head. “... The Empress probably knows.”","He didn’t say it out loud.","However, he might as well have said it all.","What else could Nie Qingru know? She must know that they had hidden a woman here!","Zhou Zheng was afraid of being dragged in, so he gritted his teeth, braced himself, and raised his head. “Young Master Qi, why don’t... I mean, why don’t we hand her over to the Empress? She’s just a woman. There’s no need to go against the Empress for her. It’s not worth it.”","“What do you know?” Nie Qixing immediately said.","Zhou Zheng’s lips moved, but he didn’t dare to argue with him.","He really did not understand what Young Master Qi meant.","Could it be he still wanted to hide her with the Empress knocking on his door?","Zhou Zheng was still thinking about this when he heard Nie Qixing’s decision after a moment of silence. “Take her away and hide her. No matter who comes looking for you, you’re not allowed to hand her over. Do you understand?”","“Young Master Qi?” Zhou Zheng’s face was full of surprise and confusion. He did not understand why he had to hide her.","Nie Qixing did not explain. He lowered his voice and said seriously, “If you still want to live, do as I say!”","Zhou Zheng did not move.","He was surprised that Nie Qixing said “if you still want to live”. Was this matter that serious?","“Why aren’t you leaving?” Nie Qixing saw he was not moving and looked at him in frustration. He could tell he was fearful.","Nie Qixing took a deep breath and said as calmly as possible, “As long as you hide her well, nothing will happen.”","Zhou Zheng was like a grasshopper tied to his ship. Even if he regretted it, it was impossible to get off the ship now. He could only grit his teeth and say, “Yes, I’ll immediately move her away.”","“Go.” Nie Qixing raised his hand, feeling mentally and physically exhausted.","Zhou Zheng took two steps before stopping and turning around. “Young Master Qi, I still don’t understand one thing. Why can’t we hand her over to the Empress? This is Continent M. Isn’t it better to hand her over to the Empress?”","Nie Qixing had been wondering who had tipped Zhou Zheng off. Hearing Zhou Zheng’s question, he looked over. However, he did not answer directly. He only said absent-mindedly, “You just need to know that if she sees that woman, she will definitely be furious. Under such circumstances, I might not die, but you... I can’t be sure.”","Zhou Zheng’s body stiffened, and a chill rose from the bottom of his feet. It was so cold that his teeth trembled. He looked at Nie Qixing with fear and regret!","He really regretted it!","Why did he want to curry favor with Nie Qixing back then?","If he had known earlier, he wouldn’t have boarded this ship!","Now, he didn’t get any benefits and was about to lose his life!","...","With his life at stake, Zhou Zheng was still very efficient. He quickly moved the woman away before Nie Qingru arrived at the hotel."]},{"number":3290,"title":"Chapter 3290: Young Master Qi, Tell Me Quickly!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3290: Young Master Qi, Tell Me Quickly!","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qingru didn’t hide her whereabouts this time. She entered the hotel with a majestic group. Ignoring the gazes of the people around, she asked Shadow expressionlessly, “What’s his room number?”","Shadow had already gone to the front desk to get the spare room card. He did not dare to hide it. He lowered his head respectfully and whispered, “Young Master Qi is in Suite 8808.”","Nie Qingru narrowed his eyes and suppressed her anger. She instructed the few people beside him, “Go and watch the elevator and the stairs. No one is allowed to leave until I say so!”","“Yes, Your Majesty.”","Her subordinates immediately dispersed to guard the elevator and emergency exit. People were also guarding the entrance, looking like they wanted to seal the entire hotel.","The people watching the show in the lobby realized they had been locked inside and started to make a fuss.","“What do you mean? Why don’t you let us out?”","“Yeah, who is this?! Why can’t we leave? I can leave whenever I want!”","The commotion grew louder and louder.","The manager and security officers also rushed over and tried their best to comfort the agitated guests. “Everyone, don’t be anxious. There’s an emergency. It shouldn’t take long. Please calm down!”","“What emergency happened? Why can’t we leave? Tell us!” someone asked loudly without giving them face!","Some people took out their cell phones without hesitation.","“I’m calling the police.”","The hotel was in a mess.","All of this did not bother Nie Qingru.","As if she couldn’t see the commotion below, she entered the elevator under the bodyguards’ escort and walked straight to the presidential suite on the top floor...","* * *","Room 8808, where Nie Qixing was staying, was on the top floor.","Ding!","The elevator doors opened.","Nie Qingru walked out with an icy face. As she walked, she carried the biting wind with her and soon arrived at the door.","“Open the door,” she ordered without turning around.","Observing her expression, Shadow slowly moved to the front and took out the spare room card. He did not swipe the card but looked at her hesitantly. “Empress, I know you’re angry, but Young Master Qi hasn’t fully recovered...”","“I said open the door. Don’t make me say it a third time!”","Nie Qingru did not give him a chance to finish.","Shadow didn’t dare to plead for Nie Qixing anymore. He gritted his teeth and opened the door.","Nie Qingru walked past him and entered the room.","...","Nie Qixing had been waiting for them. Upon seeing Nie Qingru, he took a deep breath and called out, “Sister.”","Nie Qingru did not respond. She walked to the center of the room and looked down at him. “Where is the woman?”","Nie Qixing rarely saw her so angry. His eyes flickered as he tried to bluff his way out. “Who? I’m alone here.”","Nie Qingru looked deeply into his eyes. Without another word, she sat on the leather sofa. Looking at him again, there was no emotion in her eyes as she ordered her subordinates, “Beat him up until he speaks!”","“Empress!” Shadow was shocked, and a cold sweat broke out on his back.","He could tell that Nie Qingru was serious. He hurriedly turned to Nie Qixing and loudly said, “Young Master Qi, don’t force yourself. The Empress knows! She just returned from the Privy Council. The elders want an explanation from the Empress.","“If you hand the person over, this matter will come to an end.","“If you insist on not handing her over, the Empress will be in a difficult position!”"]},{"number":3291,"title":"Chapter 3291: Almost Beat Nie Qixing to Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 3291: Almost Beat Nie Qixing to Death","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qixing did not expect that the matter had already reached the ears of those old fellows in the Privy Council. His expression changed slightly, as if he was swayed.","Shadow hurried to persuade him. “Young Master Qi, don’t be willful! The Empress has been worried about you lately. Don’t make her angry again.”","Nie Qixing looked at the graceful and noble person sitting on the sofa. Even though she was old, she still had an unattainable noble aura that made people yearn for her.","His eyes dimmed. Under Shadow’s expectant gaze, he shook his head and said with a pale face, “I don’t know who you’re talking about.”","—I don’t know!","At this moment, he still said that he did not know!","Nie Qingru shut her eyes tightly as if extremely disappointed in him. She did not want to give him another chance, so she ordered in a low voice, “Beat him up!”","“Empress...” This time, even Shadow could not stop her.","Two burly men dragged Nie Qixing from his wheelchair without another word. Even when he fell to the ground in a sorry state, they did not show mercy and said coldly, “Young Master Nie, sorry for offending you.”","...","An hour and a half later.","The air in the suite was filled with the strong smell of blood. The smell of rust mixed with some sweetness blended into the air.","Shadow kneeled and begged the high and mighty woman more than 10 times, but the other party’s heart was of stone, and she was not moved.","At first, Nie Qixing could still groan in pain, but later on, he gradually stopped making any sounds.","The two bodyguards taking action also stopped and looked at each other. Neither of them dared to continue.","The Empress said to beat him up, but she did not say she wanted Young Master Nie to die.","After all, Young Master Nie was the Empress’s younger brother. If anything happened to him, and the Empress took her anger out on them, they would be unable to bear the consequences.","“Why did you stop?” Nie Qingru asked impatiently.","One of the bodyguards braced himself and took a step forward. “Empress, Young Master Nie seems to have fainted.”","Nie Qingru also noticed that Nie Qixing was lying motionless on the ground. The ground was covered in blood, staining the carpet. It was a shocking sight.","She rubbed her eyebrows and asked, “He still won’t say anything?”","The bodyguards looked at each other again and shook their heads. “Young Master Nie won’t answer no matter what.”","The Empress was there the whole time. She would have heard if Young Master Nie said it.","The truth was that Young Master Nie refused to say a word. He would rather die than say anything.","Shadow squatted down and touched Nie Qixing’s nose. His heart pounded on his chest. Unable to stand it anymore, he knelt and begged Nie Qingru again. “Empress, you can’t hit him anymore. If you continue, Young Master Qi will lose his life. I know you’re furious this time, but you watched Young Master Qi grow up. Are you going to watch him die?”","He knew he was crossing the line.","However, he had also watched Nie Qixing grow up from a small baby to an adult, and now, Nie Qixing had fallen from the clouds into the mud...","Shadow did not have the heart to beg Nie Qingru to let Nie Qixing go.","“Your Majesty...”","“...”","Nie Qingru was a human, after all. She was not completely emotionless. Looking at the motionless person on the ground, after a long silence, she said hoarsely, “Why does he have to protect that woman?”","It was just a woman.","Nie Qixing really disappointed her!","However, she could only think of another way now. She pressed a hand to her forehead and thought for a moment before making a decision."]},{"number":3292,"title":"Chapter 3292: Do Whatever You Want, I’ll Always Be By Your Side","paragraphs":["Chapter 3292: Do Whatever You Want, I’ll Always Be By Your Side","Editor: Atlas Studios","She looked up and ordered Shadow with a sharp gaze. “Find a sacrificial lamb and deal with it. Then show it to those old fellows in the Privy Council. Tell them that... I’ve already given them an explanation.”","There was a certain risk to this method.","If someone found out she had found a fake to deceive the Privy Council, even if she was the Empress, she would be affected to a certain extent. However, Nie Qingru could not think of a better way to deal with this matter.","“Okay.”","Shadow finally changed her mind. Afraid that she would change her mind again, he stood up immediately. “I’ll do it right away.”","Nie Qingru glanced at the unconscious person on the ground from the corner of her eye. Exhausted, she raised her hand and said to the bodyguards, “Get him up too. Call an ambulance.”","“Yes, Your Majesty.”","The two bodyguards felt as if they had been pardoned and quickly went out to call for help.","A few minutes later, Nie Qingru heard the sound of the ambulance. Then, the medical staff carried Nie Qixing into the vehicle on a stretcher. Many onlookers were pointing at Nie Qixing outside...","She watched all of this from afar and felt extremely humiliated.","However, to give the Privy Council an explanation and let the others of the reclusive families see, she could only make the matter bigger and let everyone see that Nie Qixing had already been punished!","It would not be good if those old things came to her again and asked to deal with Qixing...","She was indirectly protecting Nie Qixing.","* * *","“After Nie Qingru arrived at the hotel, she beat Nie Qixing up. It was said that not long after, Nie Qixing was carried into the ambulance covered in blood.”","Ye Wangchuan smiled narrowly, but his tone was cold. “She’s really ruthless. She made those people from the Privy Council completely speechless.”","Qiao Nian was waiting in the room for news from Nie Qingru, so when the news came, she only raised her eyebrows, not looking surprised.","“A person who could easily sacrifice her own daughter caused such a huge commotion, but in fact, she only beat Nie Qixing up. She’s already merciful enough.”","If it were Ji Qing, Nie Qingru would have pushed her out long ago. She wouldn’t have protected Ji Qing as she did for Nie Qixing.","“But if she thinks it’s over, she’s too naive.”","Qiao Nian pressed down on the brim of her cap to cover her surly eyes, then casually said, “I said that we’ll see if she chooses herself or him this time~”","Ye Wangchuan understood why she was so insistent on knowing the answer. He silently rubbed the top of her head and retracted his hand. He cooed softly. “Do whatever you want. I’ll always be by your side.”","Originally frustrated, Qiao Nian’s anger reached its peak when she heard that Nie Qingru chose to protect Nie Qixing.","However, at this moment, her heart seemed to have been injected with a calmant, quickly suppressing the prairie fire. Her eyes gradually darkened as she said, “Let’s wait a little longer. When she thinks that she has settled the Privy Council.”","* * *","Shadow had followed Nie Qingru for so many years and was very efficient. Soon, he found a sacrificial lamb of the same age as the woman and gave the Privy Council an explanation.","Everyone had only heard rumors that Nie Qixing had hidden a woman during the weapons exhibition, but nobody knew anything more about her.","Nie Qingru had caused such a huge commotion. Not only did she lock down the hotel, but she also called an ambulance... Now, she had even brought a woman to ‘account’ to them.","Even the archbishop and the others could not point fingers at her.","Nie Qingru was the Empress, after all.","She had already done so much, if they still refused to let go, it’d be a little too much.","Things should have calmed down at this point.","Nie Qingru also went to the hospital to visit the unconscious Nie Qixing.","However, the next day, the Privy Council received a stack of photos from an anonymous sender..."]},{"number":3293,"title":"Chapter 3293: The Photos Were Enough to Take Nie Qixing’s Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 3293: The Photos Were Enough to Take Nie Qixing’s Life","Editor: Atlas Studios","Quentin was the first to finish looking at the stack of photos. Then, he handed the photos to the others with a dark gaze. “Take a look.”","The photos were passed over.","Everyone took a look before the photos were passed to the green-robed old man at the end.","At first, Elder Xue did not know what kind of photos they were. It was only when the photos got to him that his expression darkened.","Quentin clasped his hands in front of him, and his wide red robes hung down. Sitting there, he gave off an extremely oppressive feeling. He stared at Elder Xue with a deep gaze. “Elder Xue, you are the most senior member. What do you see through these photos?”","Elder Xue suddenly raised his head and met his gaze. After a long while, he asked, “What are you trying to say?”","Quentin smiled casually. “You should know what I want to say.”","Elder Xue frowned and looked at him without saying anything.","“Since these photos have been sent to the Privy Council, it’s possible that they will be circulated. You’re an old member of the Privy Council, so you should understand that this is no longer a small matter of morals... Once it spreads, not only Nie Qixing’s but the reclusive families’ reputation will also be damaged.”","“It hasn’t been concluded yet...”","Elder Xue pursed his lips and did not let go.","However, so many people were looking at him. Their eyes were filled with disapproval. Even he had to consider their opinions.","In the end, the green-robed old man relented.","“Let’s ask the Empress first.”","He hoped that the Empress could give him a reasonable explanation for these photos.","Otherwise, they were enough to take Nie Qixing’s life!","**","After a night of high fever, Nie Qixing slowly woke up in the morning. He was still weak and could not even get out of bed.","Although Nie Qingru visited him last night, she only stayed in the ward for less than 10 minutes and asked the attending doctor about his health.","Then, she left with her men.","Shadow received a call from the hospital in the morning and rushed over to see him.","Nie Qixing had just woken up less than two hours ago and was being examined by a doctor.","After Shadow came in, he did not make a loud sound. He quietly stood in the corner, waiting for the doctors and nurses to finish their examination before he walked over and looked at the sickly pale person lying on the bed.","“Young Master Qi, why are you doing this? Actually, as long as you listen to me and hand that woman over to the Empress, and the Empress gives the Privy Council an explanation, this matter will be over.”","Nie Qixing called out weakly, “Uncle Ning.”","Shadow could not bear to see him like this. He sighed and did not talk about this anymore. Instead, he told him, “Rest assured and recuperate.”","“My sister...” Nie Qixing tried to sit up.","Shadow pressed him back down and covered him with the blanket again. He said quickly and steadily, “The Empress has found a substitute to give the Privy Council an explanation and appease them.”","Nie Qixing was stunned. “She’s not angry with me?”","Angry?","Shadow looked at him with a complicated expression, not knowing how to answer.","This time, instead of saying that she was angry, it would be more accurate to say that she was disappointed.","Even he did not understand it.","There were only them in the ward. Shadow looked at his face and asked bluntly, “Young Master Qi, can you tell me why you protected that woman? You...”","He was about to ask if he liked her, but when the words reached his mouth, he felt it was inappropriate."]},{"number":3294,"title":"Chapter 3294: Sister Nian Even Posted the Photos Online","paragraphs":["Chapter 3294: Sister Nian Even Posted the Photos Online","Editor: Atlas Studios","In the end, he was just an orphan brought back by Nie Qingru. He was a servant. How could a servant ask about his master’s private matters?","Shadow wanted to say something but hesitated. In the end, he just said, “Forget it, it’s over. Young Master Qi, just remember not to make the Empress angry again.”","“Is the Privy Council... really willing to let it go?” Nie Qixing was not stupid. He knew that this matter was not small.","The Privy Council must have given Nie Qingru a lot of pressure.","Seeing that he still cared about Nie Qingru, Shadow looked at him with a little more warmth. “The Empress sent you in an ambulance for everyone to see and gave them an ‘account’. Those people from the Privy Council are not fools. They know when to stop. As long as there are no more incidents, this matter should be over...”","Nie Qixing breathed a sigh of relief.","At this moment, Shadow’s cell phone rang.","He took it out and looked down at the caller ID. Adjusting his expression, he immediately said to the person on the bed, “Young Master Qi, I’m going out to take this call.”","From this angle, Nie Qixing could already see the number flashing on the screen. He knew who was calling. His eyes darkened, and his face was expressionless. “Go.”","Shadow left the ward in a hurry.","* * *","Outside the ward.","Shadow cautiously walked to an empty corner before respectfully accepting the call.","“Empress.”","“Have you seen the photos online?” Nie Qingru’s voice was quick and anxious.","Shadow was stunned for a moment. He had never heard her sound so irritated. He immediately returned to his senses and asked, “Empress, what do you mean...”","“Go online immediately,” Nie Qingru ordered without hesitation.","Shadow had no choice but to put her on hold and log into Instagram.","He had never needed such an account. He was just a guest, but once he logged in, big data would still send him content that he would pay attention to daily.","Other than occasionally following news related to Nie Qixing, he basically did not read anything else and was not interested in entertainment gossip.","Therefore, the first piece of news the big data sent to him was related to Nie Qixing.","It was a forum post that was purely carried by random netizens.","——[Orange-Flavored Pirate King: Does anyone remember the scientist involved in the clubhouse scandal? I saw a few photos related to him online. It’s him entering and leaving the hotel with a woman. The woman is quite beautiful.]","Nine photos were attached to the post.","Shadow only clicked on one of them. When he took a closer look, his back was drenched in cold sweat. He suddenly turned around and looked in the direction of Nie Qixing’s ward.","“This is?!”","“You saw it?”","Nie Qingru had not hung up. Hearing his uncontrollable voice, she knew he had seen the photos online.","Shadow felt extremely uneasy. “Empress, Young Master Qi was just... just... confused.”","He did not know how to explain Nie Qixing’s actions.","This was not something that could be explained by muddle-headedness.","If these photos were to spread, not to mention Young Master Qi, even the Empress would be implicated!","Fortunately, Nie Qingru had no intention of dealing with Nie Qixing immediately. The voice on the other end of the cell phone was extremely tired. “I received photos from an unknown number this morning. No matter what, find someone to delete the photos online first.”","The reclusive families were not to be trifled with.","It was a piece of cake to delete photos that a random forum user posted online."]},{"number":3295,"title":"Chapter 3295: The Privy Council Received an Identical Photo","paragraphs":["Chapter 3295: The Privy Council Received an Identical Photo","Editor: Atlas Studios","Shadow was relieved after hearing that. He quickly agreed. “Yes, I will get someone to do it right away. I promise to delete all the photos.”","“Mm.”","On the other end, Nie Qingru responded calmly and then hung up.","* * *","In the house.","Nie Qingru hung up and looked at the nameless message she had received in the morning. She narrowed her eyes and looked a little ruthless.","Walking back to the living room, she sat down on the sofa, took her mobile phone, and replied to the other party.","She did not hide her dissatisfaction. In fact, because of her anger, she even questioned the other party.","—[Qiao Nian, what are you trying to do!]","Nie Qingru looked at the successfully sent message and was about to put it down with a cold expression. After all, with that evil creature’s personality, the chances of her replying to the message were basically zero.","Unexpectedly, her cell phone vibrated right after.","Nie Qingru looked at the new unread text message on the screen and opened it.","It was the same anonymous number.","—[It’s nothing. I just want to see what desperation looks like.]","Nie Qingru seemed to see the girl’s sloppy and unruly face, as well as her dark eyes staring at her.","Her blood flowed in reverse, and a fire rushed to the top of her head again, causing the nerves at the back of her head to twitch in pain.","“Evil creature!”","What she hated the most was the Ji family’s arrogance. It was as if they did not care about anyone.","It made people want to beat them into a quagmire, watch them suffer, watch them kneel and beg for mercy...","However, Nie Qingru wasn’t in the mood to think further. Her face was cold, and she felt vaguely uneasy. She felt that Qiao Nian would not just post the photos on the forum.","She was about to call and ask what the other party wanted to do when someone called.","Nie Qingru raised her dark brows upon seeing the caller ID. Then, she accepted the call and placed the phone to her ear. “Elder Xue, why are you calling me at this hour?”","“The Privy Council received a stack of photos early in the morning. The person in the photos doesn’t match the person Shadow brought yesterday. Empress, are you free to come over? The elders want a reasonable explanation.”","Yesterday, Nie Qingru asked Shadow to find a random sacrificial lamb to give the Privy Council an ‘explanation’.","In the blink of an eye, this ‘explanation’ became a joke.","Moreover, now she had to explain herself to the Privy Council today!","Nie Qingru almost crushed her phone. Her temples throbbed violently, but she managed to steady her breathing and said coldly, “I understand. I’ll be there.”","Elder Xue hung up.","Nie Qingru then received the only good news from Shadow in the past two days: [Empress, the photos have already been deleted.]","Nie Qingru grabbed her phone and instructed the butler with a deep gaze, “Prepare the car. I’m going to the Privy Council.”","...","In the afternoon.","Nie Qingru’s car drove into the Privy Council.","This time was different from last time.","People revealed indescribable expressions when they saw her. There was less fear in their eyes and even a hint of gossip...","The Empress’s status had always been unattainable for them.","Nie Qingru had long been used to being feared, unlike now, when even these small characters dared to sneak glances at her.","She walked into the Council Hall.","Other than a few elders, there were no outsiders in the hall.","Nie Qingru walked in and sat in her seat."]},{"number":3296,"title":"Chapter 3296: There’s Actually Such a Mother in the World","paragraphs":["Chapter 3296: There’s Actually Such a Mother in the World","Editor: Atlas Studios","Elder Xue was the first to speak. “Empress, the photos... take a look.”","He pushed a stack of photos over.","Nie Qingru looked at the photos in front of her. With just a glance, she could tell they were the photos she had seen online this morning.","However, the photos produced by the Privy Council were clearer and richer.","Her eyelids twitched as she pushed the photos back. There was no change in her expression. “I’ve seen them. It’s just some ordinary photos.”","She still wanted to protect Nie Qixing?","Everyone’s gazes became strange.","The archbishop chuckled and looked at her with a half-smile. “I’m afraid these photos can’t be described as ordinary.”","Nie Qingru narrowed her eyes and looked at him dangerously.","Quentin looked at her disapprovingly. “Empress, don’t you find the woman in the photo familiar?”","The person in the photo had unique facial features and temperament.","Those characteristics were the most fatal!","Nie Qingru’s fingers subconsciously curled up as she warned, “What are you trying to say?”","Quentin originally wanted to say that it was Ji Qing.","The person in the photo looked very much like her.","He had met Ji Qing back then. She was the most respected princess of the Ji family’s direct line of descent in the independent continent. Compared to the current Patriarch of the Ji family, Ji Lingfeng, who was an illegitimate child.","Ji Qing was Ji Wusun and Nie Qingru’s only child.","She was the direct descendant of the direct descendants!","The nobility of this bloodline was not something Ji Lingfeng could compare to.","However, Ji Qing was extremely talented and had a natural personality. At that time, countless people’s gazes were on this shining pearl.","However, that incident back then covered the pearl in dust and quickly became a taboo in their circle.","Not to mention the Ji family, no one in the reclusive families mentioned her.","Until Qiao Nian appeared!","When Quentin saw the person in the photo, the first person he thought of was Ji Qing because that woman looked a little similar to her.","However, a ripple suddenly appeared in his heart, and an even more unbelievable thought surfaced.","Quentin could not help but look at the majestic woman sitting at the head of the table. The words at the corner of his mouth became, “I want to say that the woman in the photo looks like... she looks like an old friend.”","As soon as he said this, the entire hall fell silent.","Everyone was paying attention to Nie Qingru’s reaction.","Unexpectedly, while Nie Qingru thought that Ji Qing was a taboo topic and would definitely not allow others to mention it, there was not much of a reaction from her this time.","She even took the initiative to say her name. “You mean Ji Qing?”","Quentin’s eyes flashed. “... I didn’t say that.”","Nie Qingru’s expression remained unchanged. She tapped her finger on the table and said unhurriedly, “It’s not impossible. Qixing is about the same age as her.”","She sounded as if Ji Qing had deliberately seduced Nie Qixing.","Everyone’s expressions became subtle.","Ji Qing had already passed away for so many years, but this matter was caused by Nie Qixing. Nie Qingru did not distinguish right or wrong and even pushed all the infamy on Ji Qing. It was really not the behavior of a mother.","This was no longer within the scope of favoritism.","There was actually such a mother in the world.","Just as everyone was shocked by her behavior...","Someone knocked on the door and broke the silence.","“Come in.” Elder Xue frowned when he saw Jacob rush in. Then, in front of everyone, he handed an envelope to Quentin.","“Archbishop, I received another envelope.”","The stack of photos this morning had also been sent to Quentin. This time, it was the same yellow envelope, making people focus on it.","... What was it this time?"]},{"number":3297,"title":"Chapter 3297: Empress, Explain Who the Person in the Photo is","paragraphs":["Chapter 3297: Empress, Explain Who the Person in the Photo is","Editor: Atlas Studios","Jacob looked at the envelope and explained in a low voice, “It was given by the same person.”","Quentin fiddled with the yellow envelope, in no hurry to open it. Instead, he looked meaningfully at the person in the high position. “Oh? What a coincidence. We were talking about her, and here she comes.”","Her?","Nie Qingru’s expression changed slightly. She couldn’t tell if Quentin was referring to her or just ‘her’ as in the documents. In short, her expression did not look too good. “Archbishop, this is the Privy Council. Don’t open everything any Tom, Dick, or Harry sends.”","“Is that so?” Quentin seemed to be deliberately opposing her. He casually tore open the envelope and said with a smile, “I think I can take a look.”","Nie Qingru’s face instantly darkened, her expression uncertain.","There were still so many people in the hall. More than 10 pairs of eyes watched her every move.","No matter how anxious Nie Qingru was, she couldn’t snatch the envelope from him in public. However, her mouth slowly tightened.","Quentin did it on purpose. His movements were slow and unhurried, and he did not take out the contents of the envelope for a long time.","Everyone’s eyes in the Council Hall were fixed on him.","They did not say anything, but they really wanted to know what was in the envelope.","Finally.","From the corner of his eye, he saw Nie Qingru’s ashen face. As if he had had enough fun, he turned the envelope upside down and poured out the contents.","A photo landed lightly on the black conference table.","Everyone’s eyes were focused on it.","“Another... photo?” Someone could not help but ask in surprise.","The others were more composed.","Elder Xue looked in Nie Qingru’s direction and saw the back of her hand tense up. He realized that this photo might be extraordinary.","He considered the reputation of the reclusive families and wanted to help Nie Qingru out. Suddenly, he put both hands on the table and stood up. Then, he looked at the middle-aged man sitting opposite him and said, “Archbishop, you have to know when to stop! We’re all members of the reclusive families. We have to prioritize the families. Don’t put your personal feelings in it.”","Before he could finish his sentence, Quentin had already picked up the photo and looked at it. With just one glance, he dropped his teasing expression. His dark brown eyes were dark and heavy as he suddenly sent the photo in Nie Qingru’s direction.","The atmosphere in the parliament hall became solemn.","He said right on the heels of that, “Empress, shouldn’t you give everyone an explanation?”","Nie Qingru frowned, and the uneasiness in her heart gradually increased. She thought the photo was of her and that woman. Suppressing her complicated emotions, she opened her mouth. “Didn’t I already say? They’re not of the same age. Even if it’s possible, she’s already dead. Why should a dead person be part of a conclusion?”","She was already dead.","A dead person.","She really wanted to pin this blame on Ji Qing. Even if Ji Qing was dead, she had to make use of her cleanly.","Quentin roughly understood why Qiao Nian had to go against her.","Any granddaughter who saw her grandmother disparaging her own daughter after having killed her would do the same.","Quentin was not trying to help anyone.","He simply wanted to see how the great Empress of the reclusive families was going to resolve this matter.","So he did not say anything. He just showed the photo to everyone around him so they could see who it was.","“Then, Empress, please explain who the person in this photo is!”"]},{"number":3298,"title":"Chapter 3298: I Hope You’re Not Fooling Us This Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 3298: I Hope You’re Not Fooling Us This Time","Editor: Atlas Studios","Everyone’s eyes were focused on the photo on the table.","Standing behind him, Jacob also stole a glance at the photo.","After all, he was only responsible for delivering the envelope. Before the archbishop opened it, he did not know what was inside.","Looking at the photo displayed on the conference table, he was stunned as if he had been struck by lightning. “This is...?”","The others’ reactions were similar to his.","Lei Ting had taken Leonard’s place among the council.","He was still inexperienced, and the radicals did not respect him much.","Therefore, he was one of the last few people who saw the photo.","When he saw the person in the photo, he blurted out, “This isn’t... Miss Ji, right?”","Elder Xue was more experienced and was one of the three elders of the Privy Council.","After Leonard’s death, he had the upper hand.","He picked up the photo and then silently put it down. Without a word, he handed the photo to Nie Qingru. “Take a look.”","Nie Qingru had already guessed who it was after hearing the discussions.","Her entire body stiffened as she stared at Elder Xue with a sharp gaze.","Elder Xue was unmoved and asked her to take a look at the photo herself.","Nie Qingru’s back was like a bow as she slowly took the thin photo from him and lowered her head to look.","It was a printed version of an old, yellowed photo.","The print was new.","However, if one took a closer look at the yellow marks, they would know it was an old photo.","None of that was the point.","The focus was on the person.","It was actually... her when she was young!","Nie Qingru also saw a line of small words written in a fountain pen at the bottom-left corner. The handwriting was elegant and upright—it was Ji Qing’s handwriting. There was also a time and date.","Nie Qingru’s head buzzed, and her old migraine problem acted up. She looked extremely pale, and the corners of her mouth were tightly pursed.","She held the photo and did not take it to heart. Instead, her eyes were dark and murderous. “Who sent the photo?”","The council hall was silent.","The others had quietened down and did not say anything. However, they all looked at her. Their subtle expressions from before became even more subtler and indescribable.","Nie Qingru could only hear the sound of the wind blowing into her ears, as well as her furious questioning, “I’m asking who sent the photo!”","The entire place was dead silent!","At this moment.","Quentin stood up unhurriedly as if he was not intimidated by her imposing manner. He faced her directly and said indifferently, “Empress, is it important who sent the photo now? What’s important is the thousand-year-old reputation of the reclusive families. As the Empress, what should you do next?”","“What do you mean?” Nie Qingru stared at him as if she wanted to eat him up.","“Pfft.” Quentin’s sleeves brushed across the conference table. He might as well make himself clear. “Do you want the reclusive families’ age-old reputation or Nie Qixing?”","This short sentence blocked all of Nie Qingru’s escape routes.","Everyone looked at her.","This time, it included Elder Xue.","Elder Xue did not want Qiao Nian to destroy the prestige and status of the reclusive families, but before that, he wanted Nie Qingru to make the right ‘choice’.","Their gazes were like steel knives, leaving no room for negotiation.","What was even more unyielding was the neutral party’s attitude this time.","“I hope you can give us a satisfactory explanation this time and not continue to fool us.”"]},{"number":3299,"title":"Chapter 3299: Master Cheng Is Out of Danger","paragraphs":["Chapter 3299: Master Cheng Is Out of Danger","Editor: Atlas Studios","After all, no matter how noble the Empress was, no matter how she stood at the peak of power, it was still the power given to her by the reclusive families. If she couldn’t make the right decision...","In that case, since the reclusive families could give her a unique status, they could also take away this honor.","Quentin was reminding her that the sacrificial lamb incident could not happen again.","If she tried to use this to brush off the Privy Council again, her position would be implicated...","Nie Qingru quietly pinched her palm, closed her eyes, and remained silent.","If it was anything else, she could choose without hesitation.","However, the Privy Council did not want anything else but Nie Qixing’s life!","* * *","Qiao Nian went to the hospital in the afternoon to see Master Cheng.","This time, Ye Wangchuan specially transferred Ji Lin over to be in charge of Master Cheng’s safety in the hospital.","Ji Lin had always been overseas, and his social circle was also there. It was naturally easier for him to deal with these things than Bo Zheng and Luo Qing.","He quickly transferred Master Cheng to a relatively safe private hospital and even brought an expert doctor from Country M.","Master Cheng’s problem was not particularly serious.","Mainly because Qiao Nian handled it well and immediately performed emergency treatment. The key was that under limited conditions, what she did was no less than what the doctors in the emergency room could do.","Under such circumstances, Master Cheng was sent to the hospital in time. His life was not in danger.","He had been under observation in the intensive care unit for the past few days.","Qiao Nian could not go in. She could only look at the person lying on the bed through the glass.","At this moment, the doctor and nurse were changing Master Cheng’s dressing. After a few minutes, they closed the curtain.","Qiao Nian took out a mint from her pocket, tore open the candy wrapper, and threw it into her mouth. She bit the candy and walked to the side casually.","Ye Wangchuan and Bo Zheng were also there. They followed her and waited for the doctor and nurse to change the medicine so that they could ask about the situation.","“Master Cheng’s life is not in danger. He can be transferred to a normal ward to recuperate tomorrow,” Ye Wangchuan said as he looked at the girl eating candy with the brim of her cap lowered.","Qiao Nian savored the mint and leaned against the wall with her hands in her pockets, looking nonchalant and inexplicable. “I know.”","Qin Si looked at her cool posture and smacked his lips. He wanted to make a joke to liven up the atmosphere, but Gu San quietly pulled him back before he could speak.","Qin Si turned to him with a questioning expression.","Gu San gave him an expression that said, “You’d better shut up.” Qin Si could not recover for a long time. He didn’t say anything yet!","What was wrong with Gu San?","At this moment, Qiao Nian took a silver lighter from her pocket. With a “click”, blue flames appeared.","Qin Si’s attention was attracted again.","The brim of her cap was lowered, and only her snow-white chin could be seen clearly. The corners of her cold mouth were quite cool. “Fortunately, Master Cheng’s life isn’t in danger...”","She did not finish her sentence.","Ye Wangchuan knew what she wanted to say. He gently smiled and said in a low voice, “The Privy Council has already received the photo.”","“What photo?” After listening for a long time, Qin Si finally found something he could say and asked the question in his heart.","Bo Zheng and the others were also curious about this.","However, other than Qin Si, no one else was that gossipy.","Ye Wangchuan replied kindly, “Nie Qingru’s photo.”"]},{"number":3300,"title":"Chapter 3300: If This Drags On, I Won’t Even Give Her a Choice","paragraphs":["Chapter 3300: If This Drags On, I Won’t Even Give Her a Choice","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qin Si was even more puzzled.","Photos of the old witch?","Why did Sister Qiao send the old witch’s photo to the Privy Council?","Only Gu San roughly guessed something. He looked up and said anxiously, “Could it be the one on the Internet...”","“What?” Qin Si finally found someone who knew. He immediately grabbed Gu San and asked him to explain.","Gu San did not know much.","Only Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan knew. He had just seen the photos by chance.","He briefly told Qin Si, Bo Zheng, and the others about the photos on Instagram and scratched his head in frustration. “But they were already deleted at noon.”","Qin Si and the others stopped talking.","It was obvious Nie Qingru was behind it. She got someone to delete the photos to protect Nie Qixing.","However, there was one thing they did not understand.","“What does this have to do with Sister Qiao sending the old witch’s photo to the Privy Council?” Qin Si asked about the key point.","Slurp.","The girl turned off the lighter and estimated that it was about time. She took out her cell phone and lowered her eyes, seemingly sending something.","Seeing she was playing with her phone, Qin Si was too embarrassed to disturb her.","He wanted to ask Ye Wangchuan, but he automatically cowered upon looking at him.","Great.","He couldn’t afford to offend either of the two big bosses!","However, the secret still made Qin Si’s heart itch. He really wanted to know what the connection was.","* * *","Nie Qingru’s eyelids twitched as she left the Privy Council. The sunlight shone down, making her dizzy.","“Empress.” The chauffeur opened the door for her.","She sat down in silence.","The chauffeur closed the door and went around to the front. Then, he turned around and asked her softly, “Empress, where are we going next?”","“To...” Nie Qingru had just spat out a word when her nerves began to throb and she had a headache.","Seeing that she did not look too good, the chauffeur did not dare to rush her.","Nie Qingru pinched her forehead and tried to calm down. For a while, she really did not know where to go.","To the hospital?","She had yet to figure out how to deal with this matter.","Go home?","With the current situation, she wouldn’t be able to solve this difficult problem even if she went back.","Nie Qingru leaned back. This was the first time he had been caught in such a dilemma.","She came from a good family and married well.","She was used to bossing people around all her life.","Other than being unable to raise her head in front of that person, she had always been unrestrained.","She had always been the one telling others to choose. No one had ever dared to ask her to choose.","But now...","Nie Qingru’s eyelids twitched again. The image of the arrogant girl’s face appeared in her mind.","At this moment, her cell phone rang.","Nie Qingru picked it up and answered, “Hello.”","Her tone was not good.","In the past, Shadow had to show some concern, but this time, he was anxious. “Empress, Qiao Nian posted a photo on Instagram with her own account.”","“What photo?”","Nie Qingru’s heart sank.","It wouldn’t be what she thought, right...","She did not have time to think further.","Shadow hurriedly replied, “Your old photo.”","Nie Qingru only heard a string snap. She paused for two seconds before suddenly smashing her cell phone in anger. She gritted her teeth and squeezed out two words. “Evil creature!”","This evil creature was telling her—there was no time for her to dawdle. She had to choose quickly. Otherwise, the choice would be taken from her!","Nie Qingru’s temples pounded, and her heart raced. With a dark expression, she ordered the frightened driver, “To the hospital.”"]}]);
